      "prompt": "生成一张横版 16:9 的东方建筑场景海报，必须是一张已经完成中文排版的成品海报。\n整体风格为：东方空间长卷、中式建筑概念设计、建筑模型感、山水意境、现代建筑剖面、场景叙事海报、高级留白、中文竖排排版、博物馆展板质感。\n画面主体是一座以【主题方向】为核心的中式建筑空间。建筑不是普通房子，而是一条横向展开的空间长卷，拥有连续起伏的曲线屋顶，屋顶像山脊、琴弦、纸卷、药草坡、书页、月牙、船篷或织机曲线一样延展。建筑下方或内部采用玻璃剖面结构，可以看到不同房间、人物活动、家具陈设与空间功能。\n画面采用横向构图，大面积留白，背景为米白、宣纸色、淡墨灰、雾白或夜色深黑。远处可以有淡淡山影、云雾、水面、庭院、坡地、树木、台阶、池塘或荒漠，但整体必须克制，不要拥挤。\n建筑内部需要有微型人物活动，人物穿着古代或新中式服饰，正在进行与主题相关的行为，例如：问诊、煎药、按摩、抚琴、品茶、读书、抄经、制香、染布、织造、泡汤、观月、修复壁画、做实验、整理器物。人物要小而精致，像建筑模型中的生活场景，不要抢主体。\n海报必须包含中文竖排标题：「【主标题】」。可加入一到两组竖排副文案：「【副标题】」「【短句】」。中文排版要像东方展览海报、古籍题签、建筑展板或文人画题跋。文字要克制，放在画面左侧或右侧留白处，不能压乱建筑主体。可以加入小印章、小号题注、细线、馆藏式标识，但不要真实品牌 Logo。\n画面质感：纸张纹理、轻微颗粒、柔和雾气、低饱和色彩、建筑模型级细节、电影感光影、克制高级、安静叙事。\n构图要求：建筑横向展开，占画面下半部分或中下部；上半部分保留大量空气感留白；水面、台地或坡地作为前景；远山或雾气作为背景；中文竖排文字与建筑形成平衡。\n不要：不要普通房地产效果图，不要现代商业售楼处，不要杂乱国潮，不要大红大金，不要电商海报，不要水印，不要真实 Logo，不要把人画得太大，不要复杂拥挤背景。",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a horizontal 16:9 Oriental architecture scene poster, a fully finished poster with completed typography. Style: Oriental spatial handscroll, Chinese architectural concept design, architectural-model feel, shanshui landscape mood, modern architectural section, narrative scene poster, refined negative space, elegant vertical typography, museum exhibition-board texture.\nMain subject: a Chinese architectural space themed around [THEME]. Not an ordinary house but a horizontally unfolding spatial scroll with continuous undulating curved roofs extending like mountain ridges, zither strings, paper scrolls, herb slopes, book pages, crescent moons, boat canopies or loom curves. A glass sectional structure below/inside reveals different rooms, human activities, furniture and functions.\nHorizontal composition, large negative space, background in off-white / rice-paper / light ink-grey / misty white / deep night-black. Faint distant mountains, mist, water, courtyards, slopes, trees, steps, ponds — restrained, never crowded.\nInside, miniature human figures in ancient or neo-Chinese attire perform theme-related actions (consulting, brewing herbs, massage, zither, tea, reading, copying scripture, making incense, dyeing, weaving, hot-spring, moon-watching, restoring murals, experiments, arranging objects), small and exquisite like a life scene in an architectural model, not stealing the subject.\nThe poster must include an elegant title and typography — ALL TEXT IN ENGLISH: main title [MAIN TITLE], optional subtitle [SUBTITLE] / [short phrase], placed in the left or right negative space without cluttering the architecture. Small seals, captions, fine lines and archival marks allowed, but no real brand logos.\nTexture: paper grain, slight grain, soft mist, low saturation, model-level detail, cinematic light, restrained refined quiet narrative. Composition: architecture spans horizontally in the lower/center-lower; upper half keeps airy negative space; water/terrace as foreground; distant mountains/mist as background. Avoid: real-estate renders, sales-office look, messy guochao, big red-and-gold, e-commerce posters, watermarks, real logos, oversized people, crowded backgrounds. | All visible text/typography in ENGLISH only.",
