      "prompt": "Create an ultra-premium cinematic flagship campaign image for Samsung, set in a futuristic Seoul metropolis, where a gigantic Samsung Galaxy flagship smartphone is being assembled like a monumental architectural structure in the heart of the city. The image should feel like a high-budget science-driven urban blockbuster: precise, realistic, elegant, and emotionally powerful. It must combine real construction logic with a visionary Seoul future-city atmosphere and the flagship-level prestige of Samsung.\n\nMain concept: A colossal Samsung Galaxy flagship smartphone stands vertically in the center of a futuristic Seoul construction district, as if it were the newest landmark of the city. The device is being assembled by cranes, scaffolding crews, suspended platforms, and engineering teams, but the overall image should feel less like ordinary construction documentation and more like a cinematic reveal of the future being built in public.\n\nPhone design: Use a highly recognizable Samsung Galaxy flagship design, inspired by the latest Galaxy S Ultra line — refined camera lens arrangement, premium glass and metal surfaces, clean edge geometry, ultra-precise industrial design, cool titanium or graphite finish, subtle blue-gray reflections.\n\nMain composition: Dramatic vertical composition with the giant Samsung device dominating the center of the frame, surrounded by realistic construction systems — tower cranes, high suspended platforms, modular scaffolding, worker crews in correct scale, temporary structural supports, construction fencing, service vehicles, precision lifting equipment. The device towers above the boulevard like a technological monolith; the lower portion shows street-level urban energy, the upper portion opens into the futuristic Seoul skyline.\n\nSeoul future-city environment: dense but organized urban planning, sleek Korean high-rise architecture, glass office towers, LED media facades, futuristic transit corridors, elevated roads, subtle Hangul signage, high-tech urban infrastructure, clean metropolitan rhythm, premium East Asian city energy.\n\nConstruction realism: cranes logically placed, correct worker scale, plausible scaffolding connections, naturally placed construction vehicles and barriers — nothing toy-like or random.\n\nCinematic flagship lighting: dramatic cinematic lighting, blue hour or transitional cinematic skyline moment, cool city light and warm construction light coexisting, strong directional light, soft atmospheric haze, glowing reflections on glass towers, subtle volumetric light, rich contrast on the Samsung device catching flagship highlights across the camera rings and body edges.\n\nMaterial and texture: glass reflections on the phone, metallic edge highlights, camera lens depth, steel scaffolding texture, construction dust, urban asphalt, glass-building reflections, wet or polished road highlights.\n\nColor palette: cool steel gray, graphite black, titanium silver, Seoul blue, urban glass cyan, construction amber accents, subtle LED magenta or electric blue details, clean neutral concrete tones.\n\nTypography: minimal and premium — \"SAMSUNG\", optional support line \"THE FUTURE RISES IN SEOUL\", restrained and secondary to the image.\n\nRendering: hyper-realistic commercial photography, giant Samsung Galaxy flagship under construction, futuristic Seoul city environment, accurate crane and scaffolding logic, cinematic blockbuster lighting, flagship material rendering, premium urban atmosphere, monumental scale realism, world-class advertising finish, 8k, masterpiece.\n\nNegative prompt: Apple phone design, generic smartphone shape, non-Korean city look, unrealistic crane placement, toy-like workers, chaotic composition, weak Seoul identity, fantasy city distortion, cheap sci-fi look, low-detail scaffolding, incorrect urban scale, cartoon construction scene, weak flagship presence.",
