      "title": "핸드드로잉 그래피티 타이포 + 프리미엄 운동복 캠페인 포스터 (시리즈 5편)",
      "prompt": "高端健身服装系列5 High-End Fitness Apparel Collection 5\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt:\nCreate the fifth poster in a unified campaign series for Lululemon Athletica, preserving the same bold fashion-sport poster DNA while shifting the visual system into a cleaner minimalist composition with strong hand-drawn typography interaction. The image must feel hyper-real, striking, modern, avant-garde, and premium, with one athletic female figure dominating the composition against an ultra-clean minimal background. The key visual energy must come from the interaction between the body pose and the large hand-drawn graffiti lettering wrapped around the figure.\n\nUse a vertical poster layout with a mostly minimal clean background, like a premium studio cyclorama or soft matte paper backdrop. Palette built around ivory white, soft warm off-white, matte black, deep emerald green, and subtle dark graphite accents, with tiny controlled touches of muted coral or brushed silver; emerald green is the main accent color.\n\nHero figure: one healthy Western female fitness model, sculpted athletic body, realistic anatomy, powerful editorial presence. Forward-pressing street-fashion athletic stance: one leg stepping/driving forward, one anchoring behind, torso leaning slightly toward camera, both hands near the hood/hair/collar as if locking into focus before movement. Assertive, energetic, believable balance — no distorted anatomy or awkward limbs.\n\nWardrobe: authentic premium activewear rendered with extreme realism — cropped performance top or sports bra, lightweight technical jacket, high-waisted sculpted leggings, premium sneakers, in emerald green / ivory white / soft black / graphite grey, with clean seam construction and realistic stretch tension.\n\nTypography interaction: oversized hand-drawn graffiti-style lettering and brush-script forms wrap around and behind the model, framing shoulders, curving around the torso, tucking behind the legs — a visual force field around the body, not a headline pasted on top. Mostly black/charcoal with selected emerald-green emphasis strokes.\n\nBackground: minimal and bright, subtle paper texture, soft studio shadow grounding, a few restrained brush-flick/ink-tail accents — no cluttered graffiti walls.\n\nLighting: refined premium studio lighting, clean sculptural highlights on face/shoulders/jacket/waist/legs/shoes, sharp dimensional body against a soft controlled background.\n\nTypography content: English branding only — \"LULULEMON\" / \"ATHLETICA\" / \"MOVE WITH FORCE\" / \"FORM LEADS MOTION\" / \"STANCE BECOMES POWER\".\n\nMood: clean, assertive, athletic, avant-garde, premium, minimalist, editorial, forward-moving, sharp, fashion-led, graphic, modern.\n\nNegative prompt: yellow-dominant palette, blue-dominant palette, cluttered graffiti wall, messy background, distorted anatomy, broken limbs, bad hands, extra fingers, twisted joints, weak stance, influencer look, generic activewear, low-detail fabric, cartoon lettering, cheap fitness ad, blurry shoes, bad typography, dirty shadows, black blotches, unrealistic pose",
      "prompt_ko": "특정 브랜드(루루레몬) 캠페인 시리즈 5번째 편 포스터. 미니멀 스튜디오 배경 위 운동선수 여성 모델 1인이 스트리트 패션풍 포즈로 서 있고, 손으로 그린 듯한 그래피티 타이포가 몸을 감싸며 힘의 장(force field)처럼 상호작용 — 헤드라인을 따로 붙인 게 아니라 몸과 얽힌 조형. 에메랄드그린+아이보리+매트블랙+그래파이트 팔레트, 프리미엄 스튜디오 조명. Krea2용 gen_prompt는 특정 브랜드명 반복 없이 '프리미엄 운동복 캠페인'으로 일반화.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium hyper-realistic fashion-sport campaign poster, vertical format, part of a unified apparel campaign series. One athletic Western female fitness model dominates the composition against an ultra-clean minimal studio background (soft matte cyclorama), in a confident forward-pressing street-fashion stance — one leg driving forward, one anchoring behind, torso leaning toward camera, both hands near her hood/hair/collar as if locking into focus before movement. She wears premium technical activewear: a cropped performance top or sports bra, a lightweight technical jacket, high-waisted sculpted leggings, and premium sneakers, rendered with realistic fabric stretch, clean seams, and premium matte texture. Color system: deep emerald green, ivory white, soft black, and graphite grey, with tiny restrained touches of muted coral or brushed silver. Oversized hand-drawn graffiti-style lettering and expressive brush-script forms wrap around and behind her silhouette — some strokes framing her shoulders, curving around the torso, tucking behind her legs — reading as a visual force field around the body rather than a headline pasted on top; lettering mostly black/charcoal with selected emerald-green emphasis strokes. Background stays minimal and bright with only subtle paper texture, soft studio shadow grounding, and a few restrained brush-flick or ink-tail accents — no cluttered graffiti walls. Refined premium studio lighting with clean sculptural highlights across face, shoulders, jacket, waist, legs, and shoes; sharp, dimensional body and clothing against a soft controlled background. Typography content: bold motivational wordmarks such as 'MOVE WITH FORCE' or 'FORM LEADS MOTION'. Mood: clean, assertive, athletic, avant-garde, premium, editorial, forward-moving. Avoid: yellow- or blue-dominant palette, cluttered graffiti walls, distorted anatomy or bad hands, generic activewear look, low-detail fabric, cartoon lettering, or dirty shadows.",
