      "target_model": "Seedream 5.0 Pro (openart) — 영문 본문 직접형([PLACE]/[CITY] 템플릿)",
      "category": "수채 일러스트",
      "title": "아쿠아렐 어반 스케치 [PLACE]/[CITY] 템플릿 (프리핸드 잉크+절제된 투명 수채+45% 종이 여백+상단 도시명 타이포)",
      "prompt": "Turning iconic places into timeless aquarelle art. Create a refined horizontal aquarelle urban sketch of a peaceful, iconic outdoor location in [PLACE], [CITY], using delicate freehand ink, restrained transparent watercolor, and generous areas of warm-white cold-pressed paper. COMPOSITION: landscape 3:2, natural pedestrian eye level; place the defining feature of [PLACE] across the left and center-left middle ground; let the street/promenade/square/riverbank recede toward an off-center vanishing point on the right; keep the immediate foreground spacious and pale, no oversized/cropped foreground objects. PERSPECTIVE: paving joints, curbs, railings and architecture converge naturally; reduce size of distant elements; believable perspective with slight freehand irregularity. MIDDLE GROUND: [PLACE] as primary focal area with a few relaxed proportionate pedestrians; fine blue-black fountain-pen lines with changing pressure, broken contours, searching construction marks, limited cross-hatching, no heavy outlines. COLOR: transparent warm ochre, pale terracotta, muted coral, dusty sage, cerulean blue, soft lavender-gray; light-to-medium density; subtle blooms, uneven deposits, dry edges; pale blue-violet cast shadows; leave parts unpainted. BACKGROUND: surrounding skyline as thin interrupted lines and diluted blue-gray washes; one recognizable landmark only as a small distant soft silhouette (no landmark collage). WHITE SPACE: preserve ~45% of the paper. TYPOGRAPHY: upper-right warm-white area, exact city name '[CITY]' in refined uppercase editorial lettering in muted blue-gray, with a short handwritten poetic tagline beneath; crisp, correctly spelled, unobstructed. Strongest detail/color in the middle-ground focal area; foreground stays light and secondary. No dramatic close-ups, no crowded tourist scenes, no uniform color filter, no glossy digital watercolor, no CGI.",
      "prompt_ko": "임의 장소를 절제된 아쿠아렐(수채) 어반 스케치로 만드는 @ZaraIrahh 영문 템플릿([PLACE]/[CITY] 치환형). 프리핸드 블루블랙 만년필 잉크+투명 수채+웜화이트 콜드프레스지 45% 여백. 가로 3:2, 보행자 눈높이. [PLACE] 핵심 피처를 좌·중좌 미들그라운드에, 프롬나드는 우측 오프센터 소실점으로 후퇴. 전경은 넓고 창백하게(대형 전경 오브젝트 금지). 잉크선은 필압 변화·끊긴 컨투어·작도선, 국부 크로스해칭. 색=투명 웜오커/테라코타/코럴/세이지/세룰리안/라벤더그레이, 라이트~미디엄 농도, 블룸·드라이엣지, 미채색 영역 남김. 배경 스카이라인은 가는 선+희석 워시, 랜드마크 하나만 작은 실루엣(콜라주 금지). 우상단 웜화이트에 [CITY] 대문자 에디토리얼 레터링(뮤티드 블루그레이)+손글씨 시적 태그라인. gen_prompt=프라하 카를교 데모.",
      "gen_prompt": "A refined horizontal aquarelle urban sketch of the Charles Bridge in Prague, using delicate freehand blue-black fountain-pen ink, restrained transparent watercolor, and generous areas of warm-white cold-pressed paper. Landscape 3:2, natural pedestrian eye level. Place the bridge with its baroque statues across the left and center-left middle ground; let the cobbled promenade recede toward an off-center vanishing point on the right. Keep the foreground spacious and pale with a few thin perspective lines and diluted lavender-blue shadows. A few relaxed proportionate pedestrians in the middle ground. Fine ink lines with changing pressure, broken contours, searching construction marks and limited cross-hatching concentrated around the central focal area, no heavy black outlines. Transparent warm ochre, pale terracotta, muted coral, dusty sage, cerulean blue and soft lavender-gray; light-to-medium watercolor density with subtle blooms, uneven deposits, dry edges; pale blue-violet cast shadows; leave portions of sky, architecture and pavement entirely unpainted. Suggest the Prague Castle and St. Vitus Cathedral skyline as a small, distant, softly-rendered blue-gray silhouette. Preserve about 45% of the paper unpainted. In the upper-right corner, on reserved warm-white paper, add the city name 'PRAGUE' in refined uppercase editorial lettering in muted blue-gray, with a short handwritten poetic tagline beneath it. Crisp, correctly spelled typography. No oversized foreground objects, no crowded tourist scenes, no landmark collage, no glossy digital watercolor, no CGI.",
