      "prompt": "What if you let AI roll the dice on styles. Well, let's see here with GPT: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, AI infers: x = \"any subject\" function roll_the_scene(x) {   let d = {     style: Roll([\"baroque\", \"vaporwave\", \"woodcut\", \"data-viz\", \"graffiti\", \"naive folk\"]),     mood:  Roll([\"euphoric\", \"ominous\", \"tender\", \"absurd\", \"reverent\", \"feral\"]),     time:  Roll([\"dawn\", \"eclipse\", \"3am neon\", \"golden hour\", \"no time at all\"]),     twist: Roll([\"everything is wet\", \"one object is enormous\", \"seen from below\",                  \"made of light\", \"mid-collapse\", \"impossibly calm\"])   };   return Generate_Image({     Subject: x,     Apply:   d,                    // honor ALL four rolls at once     Rule:    \"Reconcile the rolls into one image, however unlikely the combination\",     Craft:   \"Whatever the dice say, execute it beautifully\"   }); }",
      "prompt_ko": "@Gdgtify 'roll_the_scene(x)' 함수형 템플릿 — AI가 style(baroque/vaporwave/woodcut/data-viz/graffiti/naive folk) · mood(euphoric/ominous/tender/absurd/reverent/feral) · time(dawn/eclipse/3am neon/golden hour/no time) · twist(everything is wet/one object enormous/seen from below/made of light/mid-collapse/impossibly calm)를 무작위로 굴려 임의 주제(x)를 2x2 그리드에 4가지 조합으로 재현. 규칙=네 주사위를 한 이미지로 화해시키되 아무리 이상해도 아름답게 실행. ★재현 시 주제·주사위값을 구체 고정(예: 붉은 여우).",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, four wildly different stylistic interpretations of the SAME subject — a single red fox — each cell reconciling one random roll of style, mood, time and twist into one coherent, beautifully executed image. Top-left: baroque style, reverent mood, at eclipse, everything is wet — an ornate wet-furred fox beneath a darkened sun, dramatic chiaroscuro. Top-right: vaporwave style, euphoric mood, 3am neon, made of light — a glowing neon fox dissolving into pink-and-cyan light. Bottom-left: woodcut style, ominous mood, dawn, seen from below — a stark carved black-line fox looming against a pale dawn sky. Bottom-right: naive folk style, tender mood, golden hour, one object is enormous — a childlike folk-art fox beside a giant golden leaf. Each panel fully committed to its own aesthetic, unified only by the fox subject and the clean 2x2 grid.",
      "result": "results/gdgtify-dice-roll-scene-grid.webp",
