      "prompt": "GPT image 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\nUltra-detailed typographic portrait of a legendary football icon created from thousands of layered newspaper clippings, magazine textures, handwritten notes, vintage paper fragments, scattered letters, and bold motivational typography. The realistic face emerges seamlessly from the typography while maintaining perfect facial identity and natural skin detail. The portrait blends words like SUCCESS, FOCUS, DISCIPLINE, DREAMS, GOALS, AMBITION, POWER, MOTIVATION, KNOWLEDGE, VISION, CREATE, LEARNING, FUTURE, PASSION, ACHIEVE, ENERGY integrated organically into the clothing, hair, and background. Dynamic flying letters, ink splatters, distressed paper textures, fragmented typography, grunge collage aesthetic, monochrome sepia palette with black ink accents, aged parchment background, editorial newspaper design, cinematic high contrast, fine typography composition, ultra-sharp details, museum-quality mixed-media artwork, elegant negative space, premium poster design, centered composition, 8K resolution, hyper-detailed, award-winning graphic design, Behance trending, Adobe MAX style, typography art masterpiece.",
      "prompt_ko": "@Taaruk_ 수천 겹의 신문 스크랩·잡지 텍스처·손글씨 메모·빈티지 종이 조각·흩어진 활자·굵은 동기부여 타이포로 형상을 만드는 '타이포그래피 초상' 템플릿. 형상이 활자에서 매끄럽게 떠오르되 정체성/디테일 유지, SUCCESS·FOCUS·DISCIPLINE 등 단어를 의복·머리·배경에 유기적으로 통합. 날아다니는 활자·잉크 스플래터·낡은 종이 텍스처·그런지 콜라주·모노크롬 세피아+블랙잉크·양피지 배경·에디토리얼 신문 디자인. ★원문은 축구 레전드 인물이지만 Jake 지정으로 인물 대신 일반 오브젝트(클래식 세단/버스 등)에 적용.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-detailed typographic composition of a classic vintage sedan in three-quarter front view, created from thousands of layered newspaper clippings, magazine textures, handwritten notes, vintage paper fragments, scattered letters and bold typography. The realistic car emerges seamlessly from the typography while maintaining accurate automotive form, chrome trim, panel lines and natural material detail. Words like SPEED, JOURNEY, FREEDOM, DRIVE, ROUTE, HORIZON, CLASSIC, ENGINE, MOTION, POWER, VINTAGE, ROAD integrated organically into the bodywork, wheels and background. Dynamic flying letters, ink splatters, distressed paper textures, fragmented typography, grunge collage aesthetic, monochrome sepia palette with black ink accents, aged parchment background, editorial newspaper design, cinematic high contrast, fine typography composition, ultra-sharp details, museum-quality mixed-media artwork, elegant negative space, premium poster design, centered composition, 8K resolution, hyper-detailed, award-winning graphic design, typography art masterpiece.",
