      "title": "Minimal Grain Speedline 스포츠 포스터 시스템 (재사용 JSON 디자인시스템 — 변수 치환, 예: Sprint Study)",
      "prompt": "Here’s the reusable system used for all 4 posters:\n\nStyle: Minimal Grain Speedline Sports Poster\n\n{\n  \"style_name\": \"Minimal Grain Speedline Sports Poster\",\n  \"style_slug\": \"minimal-grain-speedline-sports-poster\",\n  \"style_version\": \"2.1.0\",\n  \"style_summary\": \"A sparse sports editorial poster system built from an expansive warm-white grain field, one low-positioned high-contrast action photograph, long horizontal speed bands, tiny widely tracked uppercase typography, and a single controlled accent color.\",\n  \"environment_variables\": {\n    \"SUBJECT\": \"The main athlete or motion-focused subject\",\n    \"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"The decisive athletic action or movement\",\n    \"PRODUCT_OR_PROP\": \"The unbranded sport prop or piece of equipment\",\n    \"LOCATION\": \"The minimal sporting environment or surface\",\n    \"BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS\": \"Sparse environmental marks and horizontal graphic structures\",\n    \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"Short widely tracked uppercase title\",\n    \"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"Compact supporting phrase or event line\",\n    \"ACCENT_SYMBOL\": \"Small separator, index mark, number, or geometric symbol\",\n    \"WARDROBE_STYLE\": \"Unbranded athletic wardrobe and protective gear\",\n    \"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"4:5 or 5:4\"\n  },\n  \"prompt_template\": \"Create a {ASPECT_RATIO} image in the \\\"minimal-grain-speedline-sports-poster\\\" visual style.\\n\\nSubject: {SUBJECT}\\nAction: {SUBJECT_ACTION}\\nProp/Product: {PRODUCT_OR_PROP}\\nLocation: {LOCATION}\\nBackground: {BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS}\\nMain text: {MAIN_TEXT}\\nSecondary text: {SECONDARY_TEXT}\\nAccent symbol: {ACCENT_SYMBOL}\\nWardrobe/styling: {WARDROBE_STYLE}\\n\\nKeep the upper field mostly empty. Place one large high-contrast athlete low and off-center. Use 6–12 long parallel horizontal bands behind the subject. Limit color to warm paper white, charcoal, and one accent color. Apply fine paper grain. No real teams, logos, or athlete likenesses.\",\n  \"negative_prompt\": \"real team, real athlete, celebrity likeness, official logo, sponsor mark, jersey number, watermark, QR code, crowd, stadium, scoreboard, statistics, glossy 3D type, neon, gradients, smoke, lens flare, cartoon, painterly, excessive blur, malformed anatomy\"\n}",
      "prompt_ko": "@VigoCreativeAI 'Minimal Grain Speedline Sports Poster' 재사용 디자인시스템(style_version 2.1.0). 한 시각언어를 4종 스포츠 포스터(Sprint/Corner/Baseline/Footwork Study)에 락: ①광대한 웜화이트 그레인 필드 ②저위치 고대비 액션 사진 1장 ③긴 가로 스피드밴드 ④극소·넓은 자간 대문자 타이포 ⑤스터디당 단일 액센트컬러. environment_variables로 SUBJECT/SUBJECT_ACTION/PRODUCT_OR_PROP/LOCATION/BACKGROUND/MAIN_TEXT/SECONDARY_TEXT/ACCENT_SYMBOL/WARDROBE/ASPECT_RATIO(4:5 or 5:4)를 치환. ★'고정 구조 × 가변 요소' 방법론 — 한 변수세트만 바꾸면 시리즈 통일. 재현 시 변수를 구체값으로 채워 단일 포스터화(여기선 Sprint Study).",
