      "title": "슬로우셔터 모션블러 패션 에디토리얼 포스터 (Stillness in Motion — 통행 군중·잔상·장노출, 9:16)",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 vertical fashion editorial poster with realistic slow-shutter photography and elegant minimal typography.\n\nSubject: [person / gender / appearance]\nOutfit: [fashion styling]\nScene: [street / minimalist studio / interior]\nColor palette: [main colors]\nMotion effect: [moving crowd / walking motion blur / layered afterimages / double exposure]\nTitle: [MAIN TITLE]\nSubtitle: [Short subtitle]\n\nKeep one clear visual anchor while using authentic directional motion blur, ghosting, long-exposure trails, or layered afterimages to show movement and the passage of time.\n\nThe motion should feel photographic rather than like a digital special effect. Preserve realistic anatomy and recognizable facial features while allowing moving figures, clothing, or surrounding people to dissolve naturally into soft blur.\n\nUse a clean, restrained background with generous negative space. Add subtle film grain, soft focus, imperfect exposure, low saturation, and natural light for an editorial photography feel.\n\nTypography should be minimal and integrated into the composition: only the main title and one short subtitle, using clean modern sans-serif typography. Do not include VOL numbers, dates, image numbers, or unnecessary information.\n\nOverall aesthetic: experimental fashion photography, slow-shutter motion blur, editorial magazine poster, cinematic and understated, realistic photography, refined but not overly commercial.",
      "prompt_ko": "@mrlarus 'Stillness in Motion' — 슬로우셔터 사진과 미니멀 타이포의 9:16 패션 에디토리얼 포스터. 피사체[인물/성별/외형]·의상·씬[거리/미니멀 스튜디오/실내]·컬러팔레트·모션이펙트[군중 이동/보행 모션블러/레이어드 잔상/이중노출]·타이틀·서브타이틀을 변수로. 선명한 시각 앵커 하나를 유지하면서 진짜 방향성 모션블러·고스팅·장노출 궤적·잔상으로 움직임과 시간의 흐름을 표현(디지털 특수효과가 아닌 사진적 느낌). 사실적 해부학과 알아볼 수 있는 얼굴은 보존하되 움직이는 인물·옷·주변 사람은 자연스러운 블러로 용해. 넉넉한 여백의 절제된 배경, 은은한 필름그레인·소프트포커스·낮은 채도·자연광. 타이틀과 짧은 서브타이틀만, 클린 산세리프. VOL 번호·날짜·이미지 번호 금지. (예시: 트렌치코트 여성, 황혼 횡단보도)",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a 9:16 vertical fashion editorial poster with realistic slow-shutter photography and elegant minimal typography. Subject: a poised young woman standing still and facing the viewer, sharp and realistic face, the clear visual anchor of the frame. Outfit: a tailored beige trench coat over a black turtleneck. Scene: a minimalist city crosswalk at dusk with a clean restrained background and generous negative space. Color palette: muted greys, warm beige and soft black. Motion effect: passing crowds and the trench coat hem dissolving into authentic directional motion blur, ghosting and long-exposure trails while she stays perfectly sharp — photographic motion, not a digital special effect. Preserve realistic anatomy and recognizable facial features. Add subtle film grain, soft focus, imperfect exposure, low saturation and natural light for an editorial photography feel. Typography minimal and integrated: main title 'STILLNESS IN MOTION' and one short subtitle 'a quiet moment while everything moves', clean modern sans-serif. No VOL numbers, dates, image numbers or extra info. Overall: experimental fashion photography, slow-shutter motion blur, cinematic and understated, refined but not overly commercial.",
