      "gen_prompt": "LUXURY PRODUCT EDITORIAL CAMPAIGN. Premium advertising poster for a faceted amber-gold luxury perfume bottle with a polished gold cap. High-end luxury fashion advertising, premium editorial design, minimalist luxury branding, sophisticated magazine-cover aesthetic, Vogue-inspired visual direction. Main subject: the amber-gold perfume bottle as the sole hero element, centered with flawless presentation, premium craftsmanship, luxury glass textures and refined materials clearly visible. Layout: small luxury tagline 'THE ESSENCE OF LIGHT' at top center; oversized serif headline behind and above the product; centered hero product occupying the middle section; small product annotation beside it; refined color selection indicators near the product; luxury brand logo 'LUMIERE PARIS' centered below; contact and social information aligned at the bottom. Preserve balanced spacing, hierarchy, symmetry and negative-space. Typography: large elegant serif, luxury editorial font treatment, refined tracking, subtle background text overlays. Lighting: professional luxury studio lighting, soft diffused highlights, realistic shadow beneath the bottle, premium reflections, high-end catalog quality. Color palette: warm amber gold, pearl white background, soft gray accents, refined neutral tones. Ultra realistic product photography, 8K, Vogue editorial standard, premium branding execution.",
