      "prompt": "Love this style for visualizing bands. I am using Nano Banana because it has fewer restrictions. \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous albums that are similar to pink floyd: input ::= [music_work_set] + [artist_set] + [panel_count] + [graphic_style]\n\nselect album_icon_panel_grid\nfrom music_design_reinterpretation_archive\nwhere works = [music_work_set]\nand authorization_rule = {\n  use_official_assets_only_if_supplied: true,\n  otherwise: \"create fictionalized symbolic interpretations inspired by the work's themes, not copied cover art\"\n}\nand per_panel_logic = {\n  album_identity: ai_infer([music_work], \"core symbol, scene, object, pose, mood, or visual metaphor\"),\n  artist_label: [artist],\n  title_label: [music_work],\n  simplification: \"reduce original visual idea into clean emblematic geometry\",\n  composition: \"single framed panel with title block and artist block\",\n  line_language: \"bold black outlines, white negative space, geometric fills, decorative borders\"\n}\nand visual_style = {\n  mode: [graphic_style],\n  palette: \"black, white, grayscale only\",\n  texture: \"screenprint, etched glass, linocut, art deco poster, stained-glass leading\",\n  layout: \"clean multi-panel grid\",\n  typography: \"ornamental uppercase display type with strong hierarchy\"\n}\nand exclusions = [\n  \"no direct copyrighted album art unless supplied\",\n  \"no cluttered fan collage\",\n  \"no photoreal musicians unless authorized\",\n  \"no random symbols unrelated to the music work\",\n  \"no weak title hierarchy\",\n  \"no color unless explicitly requested\"\n];",
      "prompt_ko": "음반을 '상징 기하'로 환원해 패널 그리드로 만드는 SQL 문법 프롬프트. authorization_rule에 저작권 회피가 내장돼 있음 — 공식 에셋이 제공된 경우만 사용하고, 아니면 '커버아트를 베끼지 말고 작품 주제에서 착안한 허구의 상징적 해석을 창작'. 패널별 로직: 앨범 정체성을 핵심 상징·장면·오브젝트·포즈·무드·시각 은유로 AI 추론 / 아티스트 라벨 / 타이틀 라벨 / 원 아이디어를 깔끔한 엠블럼 기하로 단순화 / 타이틀 블록+아티스트 블록이 있는 단일 액자 패널 / 굵은 검정 외곽선·흰 여백·기하 채움·장식 테두리. 스타일=흑백 그레이스케일 전용, 스크린프린트·에칭글라스·리놀륨판화·아르데코·스테인드글라스 납선 질감, 장식적 대문자 디스플레이 서체. 금지: 저작권 커버아트 직접 사용 / 난잡한 팬 콜라주 / 무허가 실사 뮤지션 / 무관한 상징 / 약한 타이틀 위계 / 컬러.",
      "gen_prompt": "A clean 2x2 panel grid, 16:9, of four fictional progressive-rock album emblems rendered in black, white and grayscale only. Each framed panel reduces one album's theme into clean emblematic geometry: panel 1, a prism splitting a single beam into a hard-edged fan above a horizon line; panel 2, a cracked bell suspended inside concentric rings; panel 3, a lone figure walking into a vanishing corridor of doorways; panel 4, a mechanical heart bound in wire against a radiant sunburst. Bold black outlines, white negative space, flat geometric fills and decorative art-deco borders. Each panel carries an ornamental uppercase display title block with a smaller artist block beneath it, in strong typographic hierarchy. Screenprint, linocut, etched-glass and stained-glass leading textures. Fictionalized symbolic interpretations only, never copied cover art. No photoreal musicians, no cluttered fan collage, no color.",
