      "prompt": "Product design takes work but you can experiment with fun ideas with GPT Image 2. This prompt can come up with product ideas inspired by anything. \n\nPrompt: \nGenerate a [PRODUCT] inspired by [THING].  Rules: - do not merely decorate the product with the subject - infer DESIGN_DNA from [THING] - preserve FUNCTIONAL_CORE of [PRODUCT] - translate THING’s visual identity into the industrial design language of the product - the final object must feel like a believable premium real-world product, not a novelty prop - infer MATERIAL_SYSTEM, SIGNATURE_FEATURES, and CONTROL_LANGUAGE automatically - map PRODUCT components into THING-inspired functional forms - integrate subtle branding or symbolic cues derived from [THING] - place the product in an inferred or specified ENVIRONMENT that enhances its luxury and usability - no hard-coded materials, features, controls, logos, colors, or parts unless supplied",
      "prompt_ko": "'무엇에서 영감받은 어떤 제품'을 만드는 범용 산업디자인 제너레이터. 핵심은 첫 줄 금지 규칙 — **제품에 소재를 단순히 장식하지 말 것**. 대신 ①[THING]에서 DESIGN_DNA를 추론하고 ②[PRODUCT]의 FUNCTIONAL_CORE는 보존하며 ③THING의 시각적 정체성을 그 제품군의 산업디자인 언어로 번역. 최종 오브젝트는 '신기한 소품'이 아니라 '실재할 법한 프리미엄 실물 제품'으로 느껴져야 함. MATERIAL_SYSTEM·SIGNATURE_FEATURES·CONTROL_LANGUAGE는 자동 추론, 제품 구성요소를 THING 기반 기능형태로 매핑, 은근한 브랜딩·상징 큐 통합, 럭셔리·사용성을 강화하는 환경에 배치. 재료·기능·조작계·로고·색·부품 하드코딩 금지(제공된 경우 제외).",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium espresso machine whose industrial design DNA is inherited from a concert grand piano, photographed as a believable real-world flagship product. The machine is not decorated with piano imagery: its proportions, materials and control language are translated from the instrument. A high-gloss lacquered ebony body with a single curved lifting lid over the group head echoing a raised soundboard lid, brass pedal-like actuation levers, an ivory-and-black key-strip control panel along the front edge, a felt-damped drip tray, taut steel steam-wand lines echoing strings, and a subtle cast-iron frame motif. The functional core stays legible: portafilter, group head, steam wand, pressure gauge and water reservoir all clearly readable. Placed on a dark walnut counter in a softly lit modern apartment, warm rim light, shallow depth of field, luxury product photography. A believable premium object, never a novelty prop.",
