      "title": "타이니플래닛 스테레오그래픽 파노라마 2x2 — 랜드마크 중심 구형 세계 (지리 타당성 강제)",
      "prompt": "I used to do these with Midjourney video. Now Kling has it covered. \n\nHere is the prompt I used: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 wonders of the world:  Generate a photoreal tiny-planet panorama centered on [ANCHOR_SITE].  Rules: - infer SURROUNDING_CONTEXT from ANCHOR_SITE - place CENTERPIECE at the exact visual center of the spherical world - wrap the surrounding city, terrain, roads, coastline, neighborhoods, mountains, or landscape into a circular HORIZON_RING - use stereographic tiny-planet distortion, not a normal aerial view - make the world curve visibly around the landmark - preserve landmark recognizability and geographic plausibility - include SCALE_CUES only if they strengthen realism - sky and clouds should curve around the planet edge - lighting must unify the entire sphere - no hard-coded landmark, city, terrain, weather, buildings, roads, people, or objects unless supplied",
      "prompt_ko": "랜드마크를 중심에 놓고 주변을 원형 지평선 링으로 감는 타이니플래닛 프롬프트. 규칙: ①[ANCHOR_SITE]에서 SURROUNDING_CONTEXT를 추론 ②중심물을 구형 세계의 정확한 시각 중심에 배치 ③주변 도시·지형·도로·해안선·동네·산맥을 원형 HORIZON_RING으로 감기 ④일반 항공뷰가 아니라 **스테레오그래픽 타이니플래닛 왜곡** 사용 ⑤랜드마크 주위로 세계가 눈에 띄게 휘게 ⑥랜드마크 식별성과 지리적 타당성 보존 ⑦스케일 큐는 사실감을 높일 때만 ⑧하늘·구름도 행성 가장자리를 따라 휨 ⑨조명은 구 전체를 하나로 통일. 랜드마크·도시·지형·날씨·건물·도로·인물 하드코딩 금지.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of four photoreal tiny-planet panoramas, each centered on one landmark: the Colosseum, Machu Picchu, the Treasury at Petra, and the Taj Mahal. In every panel the landmark sits at the exact visual center of a small spherical world, while its surrounding context — city blocks, terraced ridges, canyon walls, formal gardens and river — wraps into a circular horizon ring around it. Strong stereographic tiny-planet distortion rather than a normal aerial view: the world curves visibly around the landmark, with roads and walls bending along the sphere and the sky and clouds curving around the planet edge. Each landmark remains clearly recognizable and geographically plausible. Unified lighting across the entire sphere, crisp photoreal detail, clean sky gradient.",
      "result": "results/gdgtify-tinyplanet-stereographic-wonders-grid.webp",
