      "prompt": "I asked Nano Banana to show me 4 hidden gem manga series. I bet the output would look kind of similar with GPT\n\nPrompt: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 hidden gem mangas about demons: A = { Nendoroid chibi figure of protagonist, matte PVC, action pose, iconic outfit }\nB = { L‑shaped cardboard box: two vertical walls and a floor, all covered in manga panels }\nC = { pop‑up paper elements: sound‑effect cutouts, torn fragments, speech bubble extracts }\nD = { interaction: figure touches/stands on/punches a 2D paper piece }\nE = { label: “[TITLE] — [AUTHOR NAME]” in simple black text at bottom }\nF = { lighting: soft diffused product light, no harsh shadows, white seamless background }\n\nBOX = (B ∩ mono_panels) ∪ (A ∩ color_figure) ∪ (C ∩ popup_layer) ∪ (D ∩ contact_zone) ∪ (E ∩ typography) ∪ (F ∩ studio)\nWhere:\n- B panels are automatically selected by matching iconic scenes to the character’s pose and mood.\n- A is posed dynamically (inferred from series climax), with big head and tiny body, oversized weapon/hands if appropriate.\n- C elements are chosen from frequently used SFX in the manga, cut out and standing vertically, casting a slight shadow on the floor.\n- D is a boolean collision between the figure’s limb and a designated paper piece, creating a believable touch.\nAll colors strictly off in the box, figure in full saturation.\nOutput: 1:1 product shot.",
      "prompt_ko": "A~F 요소를 집합 연산(∩, ∪)으로 조립하는 문법. A=주인공 넨도로이드 치비 피규어(무광 PVC, 액션 포즈, 상징적 의상) / B=L자 골판지 박스(수직벽 2면+바닥, 전면이 만화 패널로 덮임) / C=팝업 종이 요소(효과음 컷아웃, 찢긴 조각, 말풍선 추출) / D=인터랙션(피규어가 2D 종이 조각을 만지거나 딛거나 때림) / E=하단 라벨 '[제목] — [작가명]' 단순 검정 텍스트 / F=조명(부드러운 확산 제품광, 강한 그림자 없음, 화이트 무한배경). 핵심 규칙 — B의 패널은 캐릭터의 포즈·무드에 맞는 상징적 장면으로 자동 선택, A는 클라이맥스에서 추론한 역동적 포즈(큰 머리·작은 몸·과장된 무기/손), C는 그 만화에서 자주 쓰인 효과음을 오려 세워 바닥에 옅은 그림자, D는 팔다리와 지정 종이 조각의 불리언 충돌. **박스 안은 완전 무채색, 피규어만 풀채도.** 1:1 제품샷. ※ 원문은 실제 만화 시리즈 4종 대상 → 저작권 회피로 오리지널 캐릭터로 치환.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 1:1 product shot on a white seamless background. An L-shaped cardboard box — two vertical walls and a floor — is entirely covered in monochrome manga panels printed in black and white with screentone. Standing inside it is a Nendoroid-style chibi figure of an original demon-hunter protagonist: matte PVC, oversized head and tiny body, dynamic action pose, a horned mask pushed to one side, a tattered haori, and an oversized curved blade held high. The figure is in full saturation color against the strictly black and white box. Pop-up paper elements stand vertically off the panels: die-cut sound-effect bursts, torn panel fragments and a speech-bubble cutout, each casting a slight shadow onto the floor. The blade tip physically touches and bends one standing paper piece, a believable contact point. A simple small black text label sits along the bottom edge. Soft diffused product lighting, no harsh shadows.",
