      "prompt": "Tattoo art inspired by books. I need to work on its logic a bit more :) It should work for any topic actually but I want to add more tattoo design styles to randomize. \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, do this for designs inspired by non-copyrighted open space books: 16:9 @ skin_canvas(tone='latte_foam_porcelain', texture='natural_skin')  @ tattoo_design(style=random_choice(['traditional','tribal','Japanese','geometric']), subject=infer_design($ DESIGN)) @ coffee_ink(outlines='strong_espresso', shading='fine_ground_coffee_granules', highlights='crema_gloss', dotwork='coffee_bean_clusters') @ parlor_lighting(type='moody_spotlight', background='dark_velvet', rim_light='subtle_amber') @ macrophotography(lens='100mm', dof='shallow', detail='coffee_grain_texture') def render_coffee_tattoo(design=\"$DESIGN\"):     return \"caffeinated_skin_art\" RENDER render_coffee_tattoo() as a 16:9 portrait, moody atmosphere, 8K.",
      "prompt_ko": "@데코레이터 + def 함수 문법으로 쓴 타투 디자인 프롬프트. @skin_canvas(톤='라떼폼 포슬린', 질감='자연 피부') @tattoo_design(스타일=random_choice(['traditional','tribal','Japanese','geometric']), 주제=infer_design($DESIGN)) @coffee_ink(외곽선='진한 에스프레소', 음영='고운 커피 분쇄 입자', 하이라이트='크레마 광택', 도트워크='커피콩 군집') @parlor_lighting(무드 스포트라이트, 다크 벨벳 배경, 은은한 앰버 림라이트) @macrophotography(렌즈=100mm, 얕은 심도, 커피 그레인 텍스처). 핵심 아이디어 = **잉크를 커피의 물성으로 치환** — 외곽선/음영/하이라이트/도트워크를 각각 에스프레소·분쇄입자·크레마·원두로 매핑. 작성자 본인이 '타투 스타일을 더 랜덤화하고 싶다'고 언급.",
      "gen_prompt": "An extreme macro photograph, 16:9, of a tattoo rendered entirely in coffee. The skin canvas is a latte-foam porcelain tone with natural pores and fine texture. The tattoo is a geometric celestial composition — a sextant, an orbiting ringed planet and a constellation lattice — inked with strong espresso-dark outlines, shading built from fine ground-coffee granules, glossy crema highlights along the raised edges, and dotwork clustered like coffee beans. Moody tattoo-parlor spotlight, dark velvet background, subtle amber rim light along the skin. Shot on a 100mm macro lens with shallow depth of field, resolving individual coffee-grain texture. Rich, atmospheric, 8K.",
