      "title": "매크로 메가타입 포스터 시스템 (일렉트릭블루 4:5 — 거대 흰 동사를 실사 피사체가 우측에서 관통, JSON 스타일시트)",
      "prompt": "Json👇\n\n{\n  \"style_name\": \"Macro Megatype\",\n  \"style_slug\": \"macro-megatype\",\n  \"style_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"style_summary\": \"Electric-blue print field poster where an oversized white condensed verb is the primary graphic, partially buried by a right-edge photoreal subject crop, with corner registration marks, micro labels, and one soft mood word.\",\n  \"canvas\": {\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n    \"background\": \"flat electric blue, subtle paper grain, cream margin feel\",\n    \"finish\": \"print poster texture, not glossy UI\"\n  },\n  \"fixed_structure\": {\n    \"typography\": {\n      \"main\": \"ultra-condensed heavy white sans, massive scale, upper field\",\n      \"rule\": \"subject may occlude 30-50% of letterforms; title remains autocompletable\"\n    },\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"placement\": \"invades from right edge\",\n      \"treatment\": \"photoreal, macro detail, tight crop\",\n      \"role\": \"proves the verb; does not replace the type hierarchy\"\n    },\n    \"chrome\": {\n      \"marks\": \"thin corner crop brackets\",\n      \"labels\": \"small technical microcopy top-left and bottom-right\",\n      \"mood_word\": \"one lowercase soft word bottom-left, off-white\"\n    },\n    \"avoid\": [\n      \"title fully clear of subject with no occlusion\",\n      \"sticker type floating above image\",\n      \"busy multi-object scenes\",\n      \"neon cyber grade\",\n      \"extra decorative illustrations\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"environment_variables\": {\n    \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"single verb\",\n    \"SUBJECT\": \"hero crop\",\n    \"MOOD_WORD\": \"soft adjective\",\n    \"TOP_LABEL\": \"small left metadata\",\n    \"BOTTOM_LABEL\": \"small right metadata\",\n    \"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"4:5\"\n  },\n  \"prompt_template\": \"Create a 4:5 print poster on electric blue paper grain. Oversized white condensed title \\\"{MAIN_TEXT}\\\" in the upper field, partially buried by a photoreal {SUBJECT} invading from the right edge. Corner crop marks. Top-left label: {TOP_LABEL}. Bottom-right label: {BOTTOM_LABEL}. Bottom-left mood word: {MOOD_WORD}. Clean editorial poster. Type is primary.\",\n  \"runs\": [\n    {\n      \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"CALL\",\n      \"SUBJECT\": \"scarlet macaw head close-up, black beak, red plumage\",\n      \"MOOD_WORD\": \"vivid\",\n      \"TOP_LABEL\": \"2031 / FIELD 04\",\n      \"BOTTOM_LABEL\": \"PLUME / NOTE 04\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"FOCUS\",\n      \"SUBJECT\": \"vintage camera body with silver lens, metal wear\",\n      \"MOOD_WORD\": \"clear\",\n      \"TOP_LABEL\": \"FRAME 08 / OPTIC\",\n      \"BOTTOM_LABEL\": \"LENS / STUDY 08\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"GROW\",\n      \"SUBJECT\": \"green cactus with spines and red flower bud\",\n      \"MOOD_WORD\": \"steady\",\n      \"TOP_LABEL\": \"STUDY 13 / DRY\",\n      \"BOTTOM_LABEL\": \"FORM / NOTE 13\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"MOVE\",\n      \"SUBJECT\": \"blue mesh running shoe side crop, white sole\",\n      \"MOOD_WORD\": \"light\",\n      \"TOP_LABEL\": \"MOTION 21 / MESH\",\n      \"BOTTOM_LABEL\": \"SOLE / TEST 21\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
      "prompt_ko": "JSON 스타일시트 형식(style_name/canvas/fixed_structure/environment_variables/prompt_template/runs)으로 포스터 '시스템'을 정의하는 프롬프트. 재사용 시 runs 배열의 변수만 갈아끼운다.\n★핵심 규칙 — **피사체가 글자를 30~50% 가려도 되지만, 타이틀은 '자동완성 가능한' 수준으로 남아야 한다.** 타이포가 주인공이고 피사체는 그 동사를 증명하는 역할이지 위계를 뒤집지 않는다.\n캔버스=4:5, 플랫 일렉트릭 블루에 은은한 종이결, 크림 여백감, 광택 UI가 아닌 인쇄 포스터 질감. 타이포=초압축 헤비 화이트 산세리프를 상단에 거대 스케일로. 피사체=우측 가장자리에서 침입, 실사 매크로 타이트 크롭. 크롬 요소=얇은 모서리 크롭 브래킷 + 좌상단/우하단 소형 기술 마이크로카피 + 좌하단 소문자 무드워드 1개(오프화이트).\n금지: 피사체에 안 가린 온전한 타이틀 / 이미지 위에 떠 있는 스티커형 타이포 / 다물체 난잡 씬 / 네온 사이버 그레이딩 / 장식 일러스트.\n변수: MAIN_TEXT(동사 1개)·SUBJECT(히어로 크롭)·MOOD_WORD(부드러운 형용사)·TOP_LABEL·BOTTOM_LABEL. 원문 예시 런=CALL(주홍마코앵무 두상)/FOCUS(빈티지 카메라)/GROW(선인장).",
      "gen_prompt": "A 4:5 print poster on flat electric blue paper with subtle grain and a cream margin feel, print texture rather than glossy UI. An oversized ultra-condensed heavy white sans-serif title reading 'CALL' fills the upper field at massive scale. A photoreal macro close-up of a scarlet macaw head — black beak, vivid red plumage, individual feather detail — invades from the right edge and partially buries 30-40% of the letterforms, though the word stays readable. Thin corner crop brackets at the frame edges. Small technical microcopy top-left reading '2031 / FIELD 04' and bottom-right reading 'PLUME / NOTE 04'. One lowercase off-white mood word 'vivid' sits bottom-left. Clean editorial poster composition where type is the primary graphic and the subject proves it. No sticker-type floating above the image, no busy multi-object scene, no neon cyber grade, no decorative illustration.",
