      "prompt": "Created with GPT 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\n\n((Ultra-luxury skincare campaign)), ((editorial cosmetic advertising)), ((viral premium beauty commercial)), ((photorealistic)), ((award-winning product photography)), ((hyper-realistic textures)), ((8K ultra detail)), ((premium brand campaign)), ((exclusive visual identity))\n\nA beautiful female fashion model with naturally glowing skin wearing a ((matching glossy waterproof raincoat and bucket hat)), standing beside the skincare product while looking confidently toward the camera.\n\nThe skincare product is transformed into a ((luxury fashion character)), wearing a ((miniature premium raincoat)), ((tailored designer jacket)), ((matching bucket hat or hoodie)), ((cute luxury mini handbag)), ((fashion scarf)), ((tiny premium accessories)), perfectly fitted around the product without hiding the label.\n\nEverything follows a ((single monochrome color palette)) matching the product color (Blue / Green / Orange / Pink). Every accessory, clothing detail, umbrella, handbag, buttons, stitching and decorative elements perfectly match the product color.\n\nLuxury monsoon concept with ((real rain droplets)), ((wet glossy reflections)), ((water beads)), ((mirror wet floor)), ((soft rainfall atmosphere)), ((mist particles)), ((cinematic volumetric lighting)), ((premium studio lighting)), ((luxury beauty lighting)), ((soft rim light)), ((high-end advertising composition)).\n\nThe product remains the hero of the image with the model naturally supporting the composition.\n\nElegant premium typography on the left side only:\nHeadline:\n\"Monsoon Beauty Starts Here\"\n\nSubheadline:\n\"Hydrate. Protect. Glow.\"\n\nThree minimalist premium feature icons below:\n• Deep Hydration\n• Skin Barrier Protection\n• Radiant Glow\n\n((NO Urdu text)), ((NO Instagram UI)), ((NO social media elements)), ((NO watermark)), ((NO extra products)), ((NO low quality)), ((NO cartoon)), ((NO CGI look)), ((NO distorted hands)), ((NO deformed face)), ((NO blurry text)), ((NO cluttered background))\n\nLuxury cosmetic advertisement, international skincare campaign, Vogue beauty editorial, Dior campaign mood, Chanel cosmetic photography mood, Lancôme luxury lighting mood, premium commercial composition, clean background, centered product, emotionally elegant, highly shareable, viral advertising aesthetic, masterpiece, best quality.",
      "prompt_ko": "★핵심 아이디어 — **제품에 옷을 입힌다.** 스킨케어 용기를 '럭셔리 패션 캐릭터'로 변환해 미니어처 레인코트·테일러드 재킷·버킷햇/후디·미니 핸드백·스카프를 **라벨을 가리지 않게** 딱 맞게 착장시킨다. 옆에 선 모델은 제품과 **같은 색의 광택 레인코트와 버킷햇**을 맞춰 입어 '커플룩'을 만든다.\n★두 번째 규칙 — **((단일 모노크롬 팔레트))를 제품 색에 맞춘다.** 액세서리·의류·우산·핸드백·단추·스티칭·장식까지 전부 제품 색(블루/그린/오렌지/핑크 중 하나)으로 통일. 이 한 줄이 광고를 '캠페인'처럼 보이게 만든다.\n컨셉=럭셔리 몬순 — 실제 빗방울·젖은 광택 반사·물방울·거울 같은 젖은 바닥·안개 입자·볼류메트릭 조명.\n위계 규칙: **제품이 히어로, 모델은 구도를 받쳐주는 역할.** 타이포는 좌측에만 ('Monsoon Beauty Starts Here' / 'Hydrate. Protect. Glow.' + 3개 아이콘). 무드 레퍼런스로 Dior/Chanel/Lancôme를 직접 지목.\n네거티브에 ((NO Instagram UI))·((NO 워터마크))·((NO CGI look)) 등을 이중괄호로 강하게 명시.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-luxury skincare campaign photograph, editorial cosmetic advertising, photorealistic, 8K. A beautiful female model with naturally glowing skin wears a matching glossy blue waterproof raincoat and bucket hat, standing beside the skincare bottle and looking confidently toward the camera. The product itself is transformed into a luxury fashion character: it wears a tiny tailored blue raincoat, a matching miniature bucket hat, a small luxury handbag and a fashion scarf, all fitted perfectly around the bottle without hiding its label. Every element follows a single monochrome blue palette matching the product — accessories, clothing, umbrella, buttons, stitching and trim all in the same blue. Luxury monsoon setting with real rain droplets, wet glossy reflections, water beads, a mirror-wet floor, soft rainfall, mist particles, cinematic volumetric lighting and soft rim light. The product remains the hero of the image with the model supporting the composition. Elegant premium typography on the left side only. Clean uncluttered background, centered product, high-end advertising composition, masterpiece quality.",
