      "category": "패션/에디토리얼",
      "title": "폭풍 속 쿠튀르 와이드샷 (인물이 화면의 15~20%만 — 드레스 완전고정 + 바람 물리 서술, 참조이미지형)",
      "prompt": "Made with Nano banana pro\nPrompt:\n\nUltra realistic high-fashion editorial photography using the uploaded reference image as an ABSOLUTE 1:1 reference for the couture gown, storm atmosphere and fashion aesthetic.\n\nUse the uploaded identity photo ONLY for:\n- exact face identity\n- exact facial anatomy\n- exact eyes\n- exact eyebrows\n- exact nose\n- exact lips\n- exact natural skin tone\n\nREFERENCE CONTROLS EVERYTHING ELSE.\n\nCanon EOS R5.\n\n85mm lens.\n\nRAW photograph.\n\nCAMERA\n\nVery wide cinematic shot.\n\nThe camera is positioned very far away.\n\nThe woman appears small in the landscape, occupying only about 15–20% of the frame.\n\nShe is running across the top of a grassy hill.\n\nThe dramatic landscape dominates the composition.\n\nFULL BODY.\n\nThe entire floor-length gown is completely visible.\n\nNothing is cropped.\n\nPOSE\n\nThe woman is running naturally across the hill.\n\nShe is viewed mostly from the side with a slight three-quarter angle.\n\nShe is NOT looking at the camera.\n\nShe looks forward toward the direction she is running.\n\nOne hand tightly holds the front of the gown across her chest to keep it from blowing open.\n\nThe other hand gathers part of the skirt while running.\n\nHer posture shows urgency as she struggles against the violent wind.\n\nThe running motion is natural, elegant and realistic.\n\nHAIR\n\nHair is styled into a sleek elegant low bun.\n\nOnly a few loose strands escape and whip violently in the wind.\n\nSTRICT DRESS LOCK\n\nRecreate EXACTLY the uploaded couture gown.\n\nKeep identical:\n\n- floor-length ivory haute couture gown\n- oversized balloon sleeves\n- deep plunging V neckline\n- fitted gathered waist\n- enormous multi-layered skirt\n- identical silhouette\n- identical proportions\n- identical fabric\n- identical stitching\n- identical folds\n- identical volume\n\nThe gown MUST remain floor-length.\n\nThe skirt must touch the ground exactly like the reference.\n\nDo NOT redesign the dress.\n\nDo NOT shorten the skirt.\n\nDo NOT change the sleeves.\n\nDo NOT change the neckline.\n\nKeep the jewelry identical.\n\nWIND\n\nViolent storm wind.\n\nThe enormous skirt flies dramatically in multiple directions.\n\nHuge sculptural folds sweep left, right and backward.\n\nThe long train streams several meters behind her while she runs.\n\nEvery fabric layer moves independently with realistic couture fabric physics.\n\nThe oversized sleeves inflate dramatically.\n\nThe movement feels powerful but physically believable.\n\nBACKGROUND\n\nWide grassy hill.\n\nMassive black storm clouds cover the sky.\n\nA huge bright lightning bolt strikes in the distance behind the woman, illuminating part of the clouds.\n\nAdditional faint lightning flashes are visible deeper inside the storm.\n\nNo buildings.\n\nNo people.\n\nOnly the dramatic landscape.\n\nLIGHTING\n\nDark storm atmosphere.\n\nSoft diffused overcast light.\n\nBrief cold flashes from the lightning illuminate parts of the clouds and subtly rim-light the flowing gown.\n\nLuxury Vogue editorial lighting.\n\nREALISM\n\nVisible skin texture.\n\nCorrect anatomy.\n\nNatural running motion.\n\nRealistic hands.\n\nFive fingers.\n\nAuthentic couture fabric physics.\n\nNo AI artifacts.\n\nNo plastic skin.\n\nNo distorted anatomy.\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nThe woman MUST appear far away on the hill.\n\nThe landscape and storm should dominate the composition.\n\nThe entire floor-length gown MUST remain fully visible.\n\nThe dress MUST stay 100% identical to the uploaded reference.\n\nThe lightning must remain in the distant background and enhance the dramatic atmosphere without overpowering the scene.\n\nThe final image must look like a real Vogue haute couture campaign photographed during a violent thunderstorm.\n\nUltra photorealistic.\n\n--ar 2:3 --style raw",
      "prompt_ko": "참조 이미지 2장을 **역할별로 분리 지정**하는 구조가 핵심. ①의상·폭풍 분위기·패션 미학은 업로드 레퍼런스를 1:1 절대 기준으로 / ②정체성 사진은 **오직 얼굴(눈·눈썹·코·입·피부톤)에만** 사용. `REFERENCE CONTROLS EVERYTHING ELSE.`로 나머지 권한을 명시적으로 넘긴다.\n★구도의 반전 — **인물이 프레임의 15~20%만 차지하게** 강제하고 풍경이 화면을 지배하게 한다. 패션 사진인데 카메라를 아주 멀리 두는 역발상. 다만 `FULL BODY / 드레스 전체가 보이고 아무것도 잘리지 않음`을 못박아 옷은 온전히 남긴다.\n★DRESS LOCK 블록 — 아이보리 플로어렝스 쿠튀르 가운의 오버사이즈 벌룬 소매·깊은 V넥·개더 웨이스트·거대한 다층 스커트를 실루엣/비율/원단/스티칭/주름/볼륨까지 '동일'로 나열하고, **재디자인 금지 / 기장 줄이기 금지 / 소매 변경 금지 / 넥라인 변경 금지**를 부정문으로 반복.\n포즈=언덕 위를 달리는 측면 3/4, 카메라를 보지 않음, 한 손으로 가슴 앞 가운을 붙잡고 다른 손으로 치맛자락을 걷음. 바람=폭풍급, 거대한 스커트가 여러 방향으로 날고 트레인이 수 미터 뒤로 흐름, **원단 레이어가 각각 독립적으로 움직임**.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-realistic high-fashion editorial photograph, very wide cinematic shot with the camera positioned far away. A woman in a floor-length ivory haute couture gown runs across the top of a grassy hill, occupying only about 15-20 percent of the frame while the dramatic windswept landscape dominates the composition. Full body visible, nothing cropped, the entire gown in frame with the skirt reaching the ground. She is seen mostly from the side at a slight three-quarter angle, looking forward in the direction she runs rather than at the camera, one hand holding the front of the gown closed across her chest while the other gathers part of the skirt, posture urgent against the violent wind. The gown has oversized balloon sleeves, a deep plunging V neckline, a fitted gathered waist and an enormous multi-layered skirt whose folds sweep left, right and backward while a long train streams several meters behind her, every fabric layer moving independently with realistic couture physics. Hair in a sleek low bun with a few loose strands whipping in the wind. Stormy overcast sky, dramatic natural light. Shot on a Canon EOS R5 with an 85mm lens, RAW photograph.",
