      "title": "럭셔리 세단 차창 너머 캔디드 초상 (콰이어트 럭셔리·올드머니 — 파파라치 시점, Phase One 80mm)",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\nUltra-realistic luxury fashion editorial portrait of the person from the attached photograph. She is seated in the rear passenger compartment of a premium luxury sedan and is candidly photographed from outside the vehicle through a partially lowered side window.\n\nThe woman tilts her head slightly downward and to the right, conveying calm confidence and effortless sophistication. Her right hand is raised behind her head, casually gathering her thick dark hair, creating natural tension in her wrist and fingers. The pose feels relaxed, elegant, and completely unforced.\n\nWardrobe & Accessories:\n- Large rectangular black acetate sunglasses with subtle gold accents on the temples.\n- A minimalist fitted black crew-neck top made of high-quality matte fabric.\n- A diamond stud earring is visible in her right ear.\n- No facial piercings.\n\nHairstyle & Makeup:\n- Thick, voluminous espresso-colored hair with soft natural waves and realistic movement.\n- A few delicate strands frame the forehead and temple.\n- Sophisticated no-makeup makeup look.\n- Naturally defined eyebrows.\n- A soft matte complexion with subtle contouring and a warm blush.\n- Matte muted dusty-rose lips with realistic texture.\n\nEnvironment:\nInside a modern luxury automobile featuring premium leather upholstery and elegant interior details. Soft, out-of-focus window reflections and blurred elements of the car's frame are visible in the foreground, creating an authentic paparazzi-style perspective. The background remains heavily blurred, with subtle hints of the luxurious cabin and natural daylight filtering through the distant windows.\n\nLighting:\nSoft diffused daylight enters through the car windows. Gentle highlights illuminate the hair and shoulders. Subtle shadows accentuate the cheekbones and jawline while preserving the moody editorial atmosphere. No harsh lighting or direct flash.\n\nMood:\nQuiet luxury, old-money elegance, high-fashion editorial imagery, exclusive celebrity candids, understated glamour.\n\nCamera & Photography:\nCaptured on a Phase One XF IQ4 medium-format camera with an 80mm f/1.8 lens. Medium close-up shot, slightly low camera angle, extremely shallow depth of field, cinematic bokeh, realistic lens rendering, and authentic optical compression.\n\nColor Grading:\nNatural, film-like tones with muted colors, delicate warmth, soft contrast, realistic film grain, and a premium magazine-quality finish.\n\nSkin Details:\nVisible pores, fine facial hairs, natural skin texture, realistic imperfections, natural complexion, and no artificial skin smoothing.\n\nNegative Prompt:\nLow quality, blur, soft focus, distorted face, poor anatomy, extra fingers, extra limbs, duplicated features, CGI, cartoon, anime, plastic skin, beauty filters, excessively retouched skin, unrealistic eyes, poor lighting, watermark, logo, text, frame, and visual artifacts. Aspect ratio 3:4",
      "prompt_ko": "★구도 장치 — **차 밖에서, 반쯤 내린 차창을 통해** 뒷좌석 인물을 찍는다. 전경에 차 프레임과 창 반사가 흐리게 걸리면서 '연출 아닌 포착' 느낌(파파라치 시점)이 만들어진다. 이 전경 방해물이 오히려 사실감의 근거가 된다.\n포즈=고개를 살짝 아래·오른쪽으로 기울이고, 오른손을 머리 뒤로 올려 두꺼운 흑발을 무심히 쓸어올림 — 손목과 손가락에 자연스러운 긴장. 억지스럽지 않은 이완된 우아함.\n착장=골드 포인트가 들어간 대형 사각 블랙 아세테이트 선글라스 / 무광 고급 원단의 미니멀 블랙 크루넥 / 오른쪽 귀에 다이아 스터드. 메이크업=노메이크업 메이크업, 매트 더스티로즈 립.\n무드 키워드를 '콰이어트 럭셔리, 올드머니 우아함, 셀럽 캔디드, 절제된 화려함'으로 지정 — **브랜드 없이 계급감을 만드는 어휘.**\n카메라=Phase One XF IQ4 중형 + 80mm f1.8, 미디엄 클로즈업, 약간 로우앵글, 극도로 얕은 심도, 광학 압축감.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-realistic luxury fashion editorial portrait of a woman seated in the rear passenger compartment of a premium luxury sedan, candidly photographed from outside the vehicle through a partially lowered side window. She tilts her head slightly downward and to the right with calm confidence, her right hand raised behind her head casually gathering thick espresso-colored hair with natural tension in the wrist and fingers. She wears large rectangular black acetate sunglasses with subtle gold accents on the temples, a minimalist fitted black crew-neck top in matte fabric, and a diamond stud earring. Sophisticated no-makeup makeup, naturally defined brows, soft matte complexion, muted dusty-rose lips. Premium leather upholstery inside, with soft out-of-focus window reflections and blurred elements of the car frame across the foreground creating an authentic candid perspective, the background heavily blurred with daylight filtering through distant windows. Soft diffused daylight, gentle highlights on hair and shoulders, subtle shadows on cheekbones and jawline. Quiet luxury, old-money elegance, understated glamour. Captured on a Phase One XF IQ4 medium-format camera with an 80mm f/1.8 lens, medium close-up, slightly low angle, extremely shallow depth of field, cinematic bokeh, authentic optical compression.",
