      "title": "빗물 웅덩이 반사로 그린 관계 4단계 (열정→사랑→갈등→이별, 실제 인물은 프레임 가장자리 신발·다리만)",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a 4-image visual story series. Each image must be generated separately, not combined into one collage. All images should be vertical 9:16, cinematic, realistic, atmospheric, and based on rainy puddle reflections on the ground.\n\nCore visual language:\nThe main subject in each image is the reflection in a puddle on a rainy street. The real people may appear only partially at the edge of the frame, such as shoes, legs, or a bit of clothing. The reflection should feel natural and imperfect, with ripples, raindrops, wet asphalt texture, water stains, and slight distortion. Do not make the puddle look like a perfect mirror. The real-world pose and direction must match the reflected pose and direction. Strong mood, soft cinematic lighting, believable urban environment, subtle storytelling, no text.\n\nThe 4 images should show 4 stages of a relationship:\n\n1. Passion\nA young couple walking very close together under one transparent umbrella on a rainy summer afternoon street. Their reflections are near each other, intimate, warm, and youthful. The water is relatively calm.\n\n2. Love\nThe couple embracing quietly in the rain on an older street at dusk, with soft warm light reflected in the puddle. Their reflections almost merge into one shape. Emotional, tender, and calm.\n\n3. Conflict\nThe couple after an argument on a colder rainy city street at night. They are no longer close. One stands under the umbrella, the other stands in the rain. Their reflections are separated, with more visible ripples and a colder tone.\n\n4. Separation\nA breakup scene at a rainy night street or station. One person stays still under an umbrella, while the other turns away and walks off. Their reflections are farther apart, partially broken by rain, with a strong sense of distance and emotional loss.\n\nMake the 4 images feel like one coherent series with the same visual method, but each scene should happen in a different time and place, so it feels like a real progression rather than four moments from the same minute.",
      "prompt_ko": "★서사 장치 — **주인공은 사람이 아니라 '웅덩이에 비친 반사'다.** 실제 인물은 프레임 가장자리에 신발·다리·옷자락 정도만 부분적으로 걸친다. 감정을 얼굴이 아니라 **두 반사 사이의 거리**로 말하는 구조.\n★리얼리티 규칙 두 개 — ①**웅덩이를 완벽한 거울로 만들지 말 것**(잔물결·빗방울·젖은 아스팔트 질감·얼룩·약한 왜곡). ②**현실의 포즈·방향과 반사의 포즈·방향이 일치해야 한다.**\n4단계 진행:\n① **열정** — 여름 오후, 투명 우산 하나를 함께 쓰고 바짝 붙어 걷는 젊은 커플. 반사가 가깝고 따뜻하다. 물결은 비교적 잔잔.\n② **사랑** — 해질녘 오래된 거리에서 조용히 포옹. 따뜻한 빛이 웅덩이에 반사되고 **두 반사가 거의 하나의 형태로 합쳐진다.**\n③ **갈등** — 밤, 더 차가운 거리. 한 사람은 우산 아래, 다른 한 사람은 빗속에. 반사가 분리되고 물결이 거칠어지며 톤이 차가워진다.\n④ **이별** — 비 오는 밤거리나 역. 한 사람은 우산 아래 멈춰 서 있고 다른 한 사람은 돌아서 걸어간다. 반사는 멀어지고 빗줄기에 부분적으로 깨진다.\n★마무리 지시 — 네 장면의 **시간과 장소를 각각 다르게** 해서 '같은 1분의 네 컷'이 아니라 실제 진행처럼 보이게 할 것.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical 9:16 cinematic photograph whose main subject is a reflection in a rain puddle on a city street. A young couple walks very close together under one transparent umbrella on a rainy summer afternoon; we see the real people only partially at the edge of the frame — their shoes, lower legs and a bit of clothing — while their reflections in the puddle carry the whole image, close together, intimate, warm and youthful. The puddle is not a perfect mirror: gentle ripples, falling raindrops breaking the surface, wet asphalt texture, water stains and slight distortion. The reflected poses and directions match the real figures exactly. Soft cinematic lighting, believable urban environment, strong quiet mood, subtle storytelling, no text.",
