      "title": "플랫 벡터 여행 포스터 — 전경·중경·배경 3층 분해 + 순백(#FFFFFF) 이중 강제 ([PLACE] 템플릿, 3:4)",
      "prompt": "Premium travel posters \n\nGPT image 2 \n\nprompt:\nCreate a premium editorial travel poster illustration of [PLACE]. Automatically identify and depict the most iconic landmarks, architecture, geography, and visual identity associated with [PLACE].\n\nStyle: flat vector illustration, ultra clean minimalism, mid-century modern aesthetic, editorial travel poster style inspired by Scandinavian graphic design and vintage tourism prints, no photorealism, no textures, no noise, no gradients.\n\nComposition: vertical 3:4 poster layout. Foreground: a peaceful, characteristic ground-level scene unique to [PLACE] (paths, steps, local plants, or water as appropriate). Midground: the most recognizable architectural style and skyline elements of [PLACE], with subtle silhouettes of people, local transport, and everyday life integrated naturally. Background: layered landscape or skyline of [PLACE] fading into the horizon, with 2–3 globally recognized landmarks of [PLACE] worked subtly into the scene.\n\nArchitecture: simplified geometric rendering of [PLACE]'s authentic architectural style, clean edges, balanced symmetry, flat color blocking.\n\nColor palette: a cohesive palette appropriate to [PLACE]'s real-world visual identity. The base/background color must be pure, bright white (# FFFFFF) — strictly no yellow tint, no cream, no ivory, no off-white, no golden or beige-yellow hues anywhere in the image. Use clean whites only, paired with [PLACE]-appropriate accent colors (blues, greens, terracotta, navy, etc. as fits the location), bright yet restrained saturation.\n\nLighting: bright daylight with soft, minimal shadows, fresh and clean atmosphere, calm and refined mood.\n\nTypography: add text at bottom center: \"[PLACE NAME IN CAPS]\" (large modern sans-serif, spaced lettering), with the country name as a small subtitle below.\n\nMood: calm, elegant, premium travel-magazine aesthetic, timeless and culturally accurate to [PLACE].\n\nQuality: ultra clean vector edges, perfect alignment and composition, high resolution, print-ready premium poster design.\n\nNegative prompt: no yellow, no cream, no ivory, no beige-yellow, no sepia, no golden tones, no gradients, no photorealism, no texture noise.",
      "prompt_ko": "[PLACE] 한 곳만 갈아끼우면 도시별 시리즈가 나오는 여행 포스터 템플릿. 랜드마크·건축·지리를 AI가 알아서 식별하게 맡긴다.\n\n★가장 눈여겨볼 지점 — **흰색을 '순백'으로 못박는 집요함.** 배경색을 순수한 밝은 흰색(#FFFFFF)으로 지정하는 데 그치지 않고, 노란기·크림·아이보리·오프화이트·황금빛·베이지옐로를 화면 어디에도 쓰지 말라고 본문에서 열거한 뒤, 네거티브 프롬프트에서 노랑·크림·아이보리·베이지옐로·세피아·골드를 **한 번 더 반복**한다. 생성 모델이 '흰 배경'을 요청받으면 미묘하게 크림톤으로 흐르는 습성이 있는데, 그걸 두 겹으로 막은 것.\n\n★두 번째 — **화면을 전경·중경·배경 3층으로 명시 분해.**\n- 전경: 그 장소 특유의 지면 높이 장면(길·계단·현지 식물·물)\n- 중경: 가장 알아보기 쉬운 건축 양식과 스카이라인, 인물·교통수단·생활상을 실루엣으로 자연스럽게 섞음\n- 배경: 지평선으로 흐려지는 레이어드 풍경 + 세계적으로 알려진 랜드마크 2~3개를 은근히 배치\n\n스타일 = 플랫 벡터 일러스트, 극단적 미니멀, 미드센추리 모던, 스칸디나비아 그래픽디자인 + 빈티지 관광 포스터. 포토리얼·질감·노이즈·그라데이션 전부 금지.\n건축은 기하학적으로 단순화(깔끔한 모서리·균형 잡힌 대칭·플랫 컬러 블로킹), 조명은 밝은 대낮에 그림자 최소.\n타이포는 하단 중앙에 [지명 대문자] 큼직한 모던 산세리프 + 그 아래 국가명 소제목.\n\n세로 3:4. 라이브러리에 같은 작성자의 창틀형 여행 포스터가 있으나 그쪽은 프레임 구조, 이건 3층 레이어 + 순백 강제로 문법이 다름.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium editorial travel poster illustration of Lisbon, Portugal, in flat vector style with ultra clean minimalism and a mid-century modern aesthetic, in the spirit of Scandinavian graphic design and vintage tourism prints. No photorealism, no textures, no noise, no gradients. Vertical poster layout built in three layers: in the foreground a peaceful ground-level scene of tiled steps climbing a narrow street with potted plants; in the midground the recognizable pastel townhouses with terracotta roofs and wrought-iron balconies, a yellow tram climbing the hill, and small silhouettes of people going about daily life; in the background a layered skyline fading toward the horizon with the Belem Tower and the 25 de Abril bridge worked subtly into the scene. Architecture rendered as simplified geometry with clean edges, balanced symmetry and flat color blocking. The background base color is pure bright white (#FFFFFF) — strictly no yellow tint, no cream, no ivory, no off-white, no golden or beige-yellow anywhere — paired with restrained accents of deep blue, terracotta and sage green. Bright daylight with soft minimal shadows, fresh clean atmosphere, calm refined mood. At the bottom center the word 'LISBON' in large spaced modern sans-serif with 'PORTUGAL' as a small subtitle beneath. Ultra clean vector edges, perfect alignment, print-ready premium poster design. No sepia, no golden tones, no gradients.",
