      "title": "바우하우스 기하 스크린프린트 티셔츠 — 주제를 최소 기하기호로 추상화 (태그블록 문법, 플랫컬러 3x3 그리드)",
      "prompt": "Another t-shirt prompt for GPT. I would probably remove the text \n\n<bold_bauhaus_geometric_tee>   MEDIUM: Flat-colour screen print on a bright white or light grey cotton T-shirt.   PRINT_STYLE: Hard-edge geometric abstraction, pure flat colour blocks with no outlines, precise primary colour separation, crisp sans-serif typography.   COMPOSITION: Central subject reduced to a few bold geometric symbols (circles, bars, triangles, arcs) in a dynamic asymmetric but balanced arrangement. Key elements are anchored to an invisible grid.   TYPOGRAPHY: Minimalist grotesk sans-serif in lowercase or uppercase; a large headline sits flush with a colour block, secondary text in a neat horizontal bar.   COLOR: True red, ultramarine blue, lemon yellow, black, white, and occasional warm grey. Colours never blend.   TEXTURE: Perfectly flat, matte ink with zero texture, simulating a clean contemporary screen print.   MOOD: Confident, intellectual, modern, rhythmic, structured, bold, and museum-gift-shop cool.   </bold_bauhaus_geometric_tee>    <transformation>   - Abstract the subject into its simplest geometric essence — a lightning bolt for electricity, concentric circles for a target, interlocking triangles for conflict.   - Compose using a strict grid of horizontal, vertical, and diagonal divisions.   - Assign each abstracted shape a single solid colour from the primary palette.   - Convert the subject name into a short, stark headline in a geometric sans-serif.   - Add a secondary label or date in a slim colour bar at the bottom.   - Any implied motion becomes a diagonal bar or an intersecting line, never a swoosh.   </transformation>    <layout_rules>   - Divide the shirt front into an invisible 3x3 or golden-ratio grid.   - Place the largest shape(s) in one quadrant, balanced by a bold headline in another.   - Use colour blocks themselves as compositional containers for text.   - Keep a generous white margin around the entire composition so it breathes.   - Alignment must be precise, but asymmetry is welcome — like a 1923 Bauhaus poster.   </layout_rules>    <typography_rules>   - Use only geometric sans-serif typefaces (Futura, DIN, or similar).   - Set all text in tight, clean uppercase or clean lowercase, never mixed whimsically.   - Text sits on colour blocks or directly on the white shirt.   - No outlines, no drop shadows, no italics.   - Secondary text must be small, horizontal, and perfectly aligned.   </typography_rules>    <color_rules>   - Strictly limited to red, blue, yellow, black, white, and one warm grey.   - Colours are always solid with hard edges; no gradients, no halftones.   - Shirt colour is integral — white or light heather grey.   - No more than 4 colours plus the shirt in a single design.   </color_rules>    <rendering_rules>   - Render as a perfectly flat vector screen print on a shirt.   - Edges are razor sharp.   - Ink is opaque matte; no print texture, no distress, no misregistration.   - The design must look like a modern art poster translated to apparel.   </rendering_rules>    <finish>   - Bold Bauhaus geometric T-shirt.   - Primary colour blocks, stark sans-serif typography, pure abstraction of subject.   - Clean, flat screen print on white cotton.   - Minimal, intellectual, highly graphic, and unmistakably modern.   - Looks like a wearable design-school manifesto.   </finish>    <avoid>   - Avoid outlines, shading, and gradients.   - Avoid organic curves or hand-drawn elements.   - Avoid crowded compositions.   - Avoid decorative frames or vintage effects.   - Avoid colours outside the strict primary+black+white+grey palette.   </avoid>",
      "prompt_ko": "★티셔츠 그래픽 디자인용 태그블록 문법(`<bold_bauhaus_geometric_tee>` + `<transformation>` + `<layout_rules>`). 어떤 주제든 **바우하우스식 기하 추상**으로 변환한다.\n\n매체 = 밝은 화이트/라이트그레이 면 티셔츠의 플랫컬러 스크린프린트. 프린트 스타일 = 하드엣지 기하 추상, 윤곽선 없는 순수 플랫 색블록, 정밀한 원색 분리, 선명한 산세리프.\n\n★변환 규칙(핵심) — **주제를 가장 단순한 기하 본질로 추상화한다:** 전기 → 번개 볼트, 타깃 → 동심원, 갈등 → 맞물린 삼각형. 함의된 움직임은 **대각 바나 교차선으로**(스우시 곡선 금지).\n\n★레이아웃 — 티셔츠 앞면을 보이지 않는 3x3 또는 황금비 그리드로 나누고, 가장 큰 형태를 한 사분면에, 굵은 헤드라인을 다른 사분면에 배치해 균형. **색 블록 자체를 텍스트의 조판 컨테이너로 쓴다.**\n\n색 = 순수 빨강·울트라마린 블루·레몬 옐로·검정·흰색·따뜻한 회색(색은 절대 섞이지 않음). 질감 = 완전 플랫 무광 잉크, 제로 텍스처. 무드 = 자신감·지적·현대적·리드미컬·구조적·미술관 기프트샵.\n(작성자 부기: \"텍스트는 아마 빼는 게 나을 것\" — 글자 없이 기하 기호만으로도 성립.)",
      "gen_prompt": "A flat-colour screen print on a bright white cotton T-shirt, bold Bauhaus geometric abstraction. The subject — a thunderstorm — is reduced to a few bold geometric symbols: a hard-edged lightning bolt as a diagonal wedge, concentric arcs, a circle and intersecting bars, arranged on an invisible 3x3 grid in a dynamic asymmetric but balanced composition. Pure flat colour blocks with no outlines, precise primary colour separation — true red, ultramarine blue, lemon yellow, black, white and a warm grey — colours never blending. The colour blocks themselves act as containers: a minimalist grotesk sans-serif headline sits flush against one block, a small secondary label runs in a slim horizontal colour bar at the bottom. Implied motion rendered as a diagonal bar, never a swoosh. Perfectly flat matte ink with zero texture, simulating a clean contemporary screen print. Confident, intellectual, modern, rhythmic, structured, museum-gift-shop cool.",
