      "category": "아트 포스터",
      "title": "레트로 펄프 커버 × 디자이너토이 — MEDIUM/MATERIAL/SURFACE/FORM/COLOR/COMPOSITION/MOOD 7슬롯 + transformation/layout/finish/avoid XML 스타일팩",
      "prompt": "I can't replicate all of Midjourney's styles but I can come up with new ones that are cool in their own way. Here is one for GPT Image v2:  just give it a topic. I gave it \"4 fallen kings and their kingdoms\" \n\n<retro_pulp_designer_toy_cover>   MEDIUM: Vintage literary cover art fused with soft designer-toy diorama and ornamental music-poster framing.   MATERIAL: Matte vinyl, smooth ceramic, soft toy plastic, printed paper grain, flat ink, and raised decorative frame elements.   SURFACE: Clean toy-like volumes combined with aged print texture, limited-color ink fields, subtle halftone, and ornamental engraved borders.   FORM: Subject simplified into a collectible object or toy-world scene, staged inside a vintage cover layout with bold silhouette framing and decorative graphic architecture.   COLOR: Cream paper base with deep teal, brick red, forest green, warm black, muted gold, ivory, and selective pastel toy accents.   COMPOSITION: Poster-cover layout with strong central silhouette, large negative space, title-zone logic, ornamental borders, and miniature toy-set details.   MOOD: Nostalgic, collectible, literary, playful, premium, and slightly surreal.   </retro_pulp_designer_toy_cover>    <transformation>   - Convert the subject into a simplified designer-toy or miniature object with rounded forms, clean surfaces, and charming collectible proportions.   - Reframe the composition as a vintage book-cover or album-poster design with strong silhouette blocks, decorative borders, and aged cream paper space.   - Reinterpret background environments as toy-like diorama scenery, tiny buildings, symbolic props, simplified landscapes, or staged object clusters.   - Replace realistic texture with matte toy material, flat ink print fields, screen-print grain, and subtle paper aging.   - Convert small repeated details into ornamental motifs, stars, gears, clouds, leaves, icons, frame flourishes, or tiny toy props.   - Preserve the subject identity while making it feel like a rare retro cover illustration produced as a boutique designer-toy display.   </transformation>    <layout_rules>   - Use title-zone space without hard-coding specific words.   - Keep the subject readable as both a toy object and a poster icon.   - Use bold silhouettes and large simple color blocks.   - Let decorative borders and ornaments support the subject rather than overpower it.   </layout_rules>    <finish>   - Retro literary cover fused with designer-toy charm.   - Clean, nostalgic, graphic, tactile, and collectible.   - A toy diorama pretending to be a classic printed artifact.   </finish>    <avoid>   - Avoid modern glossy cyberpunk lighting.   - Avoid chaotic sports splatter as the main identity.   - Avoid excessive tiny text.   - Avoid photoreal skin, cloth, or metal.   - Avoid losing the vintage print-poster structure.   </avoid>",
      "gen_prompt": "Vintage literary cover art fused with a soft designer-toy diorama and ornamental music-poster framing, on the topic of four fallen kings and their kingdoms. The kings are simplified into collectible designer-toy figures with rounded forms, clean matte vinyl and smooth ceramic surfaces, charming toy proportions, staged inside a vintage book-cover layout with a bold central silhouette, large negative space, a clear title zone and raised ornamental engraved borders. Their ruined kingdoms are reinterpreted as toy-like diorama scenery — tiny buildings, symbolic props, simplified landscapes. Cream paper base with deep teal, brick red, forest green, warm black, muted gold and ivory; flat limited-color ink fields, subtle halftone, screen-print grain and gentle paper aging. Nostalgic, collectible, literary, playful, premium, slightly surreal. No glossy cyberpunk lighting, no photoreal skin or metal, no tiny text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★이 글의 값어치는 그림이 아니라 **스타일팩을 XML 태그로 캡슐화하는 문법**이다. 주제어만 던지면 되는 재사용 팩:\n\n```\n<retro_pulp_designer_toy_cover>\n  MEDIUM / MATERIAL / SURFACE / FORM / COLOR / COMPOSITION / MOOD\n</retro_pulp_designer_toy_cover>\n<transformation> … 변환 규칙 6줄\n<layout_rules>  … 배치 제약\n<finish>       … 최종 인상\n<avoid>        … 금지 5줄\n```\n\n- **7슬롯 정의부**가 스타일의 정체를 고정한다(매체·재질·표면·형태·색·구도·무드). 이 7개는 어떤 스타일에도 그대로 재사용 가능한 뼈대다.\n- **`<transformation>`이 진짜 엔진** — \"주제를 X로 바꿔라\"를 동사로 6줄 적는다: 피사체→수집형 토이, 구도→빈티지 표지, 배경→디오라마, 텍스처→무광 토이+플랫 잉크, 반복 디테일→장식 모티프, 그리고 **정체성은 보존**.\n- **`<avoid>`가 스타일을 지킨다** — 글로시 사이버펑크 조명·포토리얼 피부/금속·과다 소문자 텍스트 금지. AI가 기본값으로 미끄러지는 방향을 미리 막는 것.\n- 작성자 의도: 미드저니 스타일을 복제하는 대신 **GPT-image2용 새 스타일을 직접 정의**. 이 XML 골격이 그 방법론이다.",
      "ref_image": null,
