      "title": "Human Fragments Vol.17.1 'Motion & Pause' — 환경은 글자 안에, 인물·전경은 강한 원근으로 글자를 뚫고 (Vol.17 개선판)",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 editorial typography poster built around one human-centered moment.\n\nUse oversized, cropped letters as the main composition structure. Embed the environment inside the letterforms, while the person, body movement, or a foreground object breaks through the letters with strong perspective. The typography should shape the image, not simply sit on top of it.\n\nScene: [roller skating / swimming / cycling / coffee break]\nSubject: [young Asian woman / Western man / Asian man / Western woman]\nTitle: [custom two-word title]\nSeries: HUMAN FRAGMENTS\nYear: 2026\n\n4 directions:\n\n1. ROLL SIGNAL — a roller skater gliding past the camera, one skate enlarged in the foreground, body and urban scene passing through giant letters.\n\n2. BLUE CURRENT — a swimmer moving through turquoise water, one arm reaching toward the camera, water and splashes filling and breaking beyond the typography.\n\n3. CITY LOOP — a cyclist turning through a city street, the front wheel enlarged by perspective and visually connected with circular letterforms.\n\n4. BREW PAUSE — a quiet café moment, with the hand and coffee cup closer to the camera while the person and window scene are woven into oversized type.\n\nUse realistic photography, natural skin and fabric, believable water and motion, subtle paper grain, strong negative space, and a restrained color palette.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 editorial typography poster built around one human-centered moment: ROLL SIGNAL. Oversized, cropped letterforms are the main composition structure, filling and running off the frame. The urban environment — asphalt, railings, storefronts, sky — is embedded inside the letterforms themselves, seen through the counters and stems as if the type were a window. A young Asian woman roller skating glides past the camera; one skate is hugely enlarged in the extreme foreground with strong wide-angle perspective, and her body breaks forward through the letters rather than sitting behind them, so the typography shapes the image instead of resting on top of it. Small caption type reads HUMAN FRAGMENTS and 2026. Realistic photography, natural skin and fabric, believable motion blur in the wheels, subtle paper grain, strong negative space, restrained muted palette with a single accent.",
      "prompt_ko": "★Vol.17의 개선판이다. **무엇이 추가됐는지가 이 항목의 값어치** — 같은 시리즈의 이전판([[mrlarus-human-fragments-typography-poster]])과 나란히 두고 읽을 것.\n\n| | Vol.17 | **Vol.17.1** |\n|---|---|---|\n| 글자 | oversized typography | **oversized, cropped** (잘림 명시) |\n| 관계 | 인물·움직임·도시가 \"글자 안에 있거나/통과하거나/넘어가거나\" — 뭉뚱그림 | **역할 분리**: 환경 = 글자 *안에* 임베드 / 인물·신체·전경 오브젝트 = **강한 원근으로 글자를 뚫고 나옴** |\n| 선언 | (없음) | **\"The typography should shape the image, not simply sit on top of it\"** |\n| 4방향 | 장면만 다름 | 네 방향 **전부에 전경 확대가 일관** — 스케이트 한 짝 / 카메라로 뻗는 팔 / 원근으로 커진 앞바퀴가 원형 글자와 시각적으로 연결 / 손과 커피컵이 더 가깝게 |\n\n★배울 점 — **\"통합하라\"는 형용사를 '무엇이 뒤로 가고 무엇이 앞으로 나오는가'의 역할 분리로 바꾸면 결과가 결정론적이 된다.** Vol.17의 \"appear inside / pass through / break beyond\"는 셋 중 아무거나 고를 수 있어 매번 다르게 나오지만, Vol.17.1은 환경↔인물의 전후를 못박아 같은 구조가 반복 재현된다.\n\n- 부제 'Motion & Pause' = 움직임 3방향(스케이트·수영·자전거) + 정지 1방향(카페) 대비 구성.\n- 치환 슬롯: `Scene` / `Subject` / `Title(두 단어)` — Series·Year는 고정.\n※ 최초 판단은 '재탕'으로 탈락시켰으나 제이크 지적으로 재대조 후 편입(2026-07-25). 같은 시리즈라도 **규칙이 늘어났으면 다른 실험이다.**",
