      "title": "로우앵글 스트리트 일러스트 — 레퍼런스 얼굴 보존 + 신발 강제원근 + 결과물 구석에 원본 사진을 액자로 박아넣기",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\n  A dynamic full-body urban illustration of the subject (use the exact face from the provided reference image, ensuring high facial accuracy and identity preservation). The subject wears an oversized outfit with subtle accent details, paired with loose-fitting bottoms and bold, eye-catching footwear. The character has a sharp, confident gaze directed forward, conveying intensity and self-assurance.\n\nThe composition is captured from a dramatic low-angle perspective, emphasizing power and dominance. The subject's stance is strong and grounded, with exaggerated perspective on the footwear in the foreground for added depth. Surrounding the subject are fragmented concrete elements and subtle debris, suggesting an urban, gritty environment. The background is a clean white canvas featuring bold paint splashes and abstract geometric shapes, creating a modern street-art aesthetic.\n\nThe visual style combines crisp, clean line art with vibrant flat colors and soft cel shading for depth and dimension. The rendering should feel like a high-end urban illustration or stylized editorial artwork. Lighting is bright, even, and diffused across the entire scene, minimizing harsh shadows while maximizing clarity and detail.\n\nUltra-detailed, sharp focus, 8K resolution, vertical composition. Additionally, place the uploaded reference image in the bottom corner inside a curved-rectangle frame with rounded edges, clearly visible while seamlessly integrated into the overall design. Ensure the output image maintains a mandatory 4:5 aspect ratio.",
      "gen_prompt": "A dynamic full-body urban illustration of a young man, vertical 4:5. He wears an oversized jacket with subtle accent details, loose-fitting trousers and bold eye-catching sneakers, his gaze sharp and confident, directed straight forward with intensity and self-assurance. The composition is captured from a dramatic low angle that emphasises power and dominance; his stance is strong and grounded, with exaggerated perspective throwing the sneakers large into the foreground. Fragmented concrete chunks and subtle debris float around him, suggesting a gritty urban environment. The background is a clean white canvas with bold paint splashes and abstract geometric shapes in a modern street-art aesthetic. Crisp clean line art with vibrant flat colors and soft cel shading; bright, even, diffused lighting minimising harsh shadows while maximising clarity. In the bottom corner sits a small photograph inside a rounded-rectangle frame, clearly visible yet integrated into the design. Ultra-detailed, sharp focus, 8K.",
      "prompt_ko": "★세 장치의 조합이 이 스타일의 정체다:\n\n1. **로우앵글 + 신발 강제원근** — *\"dramatic low-angle perspective, emphasizing power and dominance\"* + *\"exaggerated perspective on the footwear in the foreground\"*. 인물을 크게 그리는 대신 **올려다보는 각도와 앞으로 튀어나온 신발**로 위압감을 만든다.\n2. **흰 캔버스 + 스트리트아트 배경** — 배경을 장면으로 만들지 않고 페인트 스플래시·기하 도형만 둔다. 인물이 뜨고, 파편 콘크리트가 거친 도시 맥락을 최소 비용으로 암시한다.\n3. ★**결과물 구석에 레퍼런스 원본 사진을 둥근 사각 액자로 박아넣기** — *\"place the uploaded reference image in the bottom corner inside a curved-rectangle frame\"*. 변환 결과와 원본을 한 장에 담아 **Before/After가 이미지 자체에 내장**된다. SNS 공유용 포맷으로 영리한 발상.\n\n- 렌더 규칙: 크리스프 라인아트 + 비비드 플랫 컬러 + 소프트 셀셰이딩, 조명은 균일 확산으로 \"그림자보다 선명도\"를 택한다.\n- 얼굴은 레퍼런스에서 **정확도·정체성 보존**([[mindboticni-paparazzi-smartphone-flaw-realism]]와 같은 계열의 지시).",
