      "title": "★파이썬 class로 쓴 프롬프트 — 속성·추론메서드·타이포메서드로 나눠 선언하고 render()로 호출 (점토 로어 스피어 2x2)",
      "prompt": "This wasn't made for books but works pretty well. Tried it on ChatGPT. \n\nPrompt: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 public space, non copyrighted books: class Handheld_Lore_Sphere:\n    def __init__(self, location=\"[LOCATION]\", narrative=\"[NARRATIVE]\"):\n        self.scale = \"Extreme macro photography, shallow depth of field, tilt-shift\"\n        self.anchor = \"A pair of life-sized, out-of-focus human hands cradling a perfect sphere in the center of the frame\"\n\n    def semantic_tactile_inference(self):\n        # AI AUTO-INFERENCE: Build the sphere's surface using native lore and clay textures\n        material = \"Vibrant, hyper-tactile modeling clay / plasticine with visible fingerprints\"\n        topography = infer_native_architecture_and_geography(self.location)\n        characters = f\"Dozens of tiny, expressive claymation figures acting out {self.narrative} across the spherical surface\"\n        return [material, topography, characters]\n\n    def typography(self):\n        # Floating clay text anchored to the sphere\n        text = infer_cultural_slogan(self.location)\n        return f\"Thick 3D clay letters spelling '{text}' curving along the equator of the sphere.\"\n\nrender(Handheld_Lore_Sphere())",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of four extreme macro photographs, each showing a pair of life-sized out-of-focus human hands cradling a perfect sphere in the centre of the frame, shallow depth of field, tilt-shift. Each sphere is built from vibrant, hyper-tactile modeling clay and plasticine with visible fingerprints, its surface sculpted into the native architecture and geography of a different place — one a hilly harbour town of stacked pastel houses, one a desert city of clay towers and palm groves, one a snowy fishing village of timber gables, one a terraced rice-valley settlement. Dozens of tiny expressive claymation figures act out a story across each spherical surface: hauling nets, climbing ladders, dancing in a square, carrying baskets. Thick 3D clay letters curve along the equator of each sphere spelling a short slogan. Bright even studio light, saturated clay colors, soft contact shadows between fingers and sphere, ultra-detailed fingerprint and tool-mark texture.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**프롬프트를 파이썬 클래스로 쓴다.** gdgtify 계열의 함수형 문법이 여기서 한 단계 더 갔다 — 1차 배치의 `infer_*(city)` 호출형([[gdgtify-spherical-cutaway-city-inference]])이 **클래스 선언 + 메서드 분리 + render() 호출**로 확장된 형태다.\n\n```python\nclass Handheld_Lore_Sphere:\n    def __init__(self, location=\"[LOCATION]\", narrative=\"[NARRATIVE]\"):\n        self.scale  = \"Extreme macro, shallow DOF, tilt-shift\"   # 촬영 규격\n        self.anchor = \"life-sized out-of-focus hands cradling a sphere\"  # 고정 구도\n\n    def semantic_tactile_inference(self):     # ← 재질·지형·인물을 모델에게 추론시킴\n        topography = infer_native_architecture_and_geography(self.location)\n        ...\n    def typography(self):                     # ← 글자도 추론 대상\n        text = infer_cultural_slogan(self.location)\n        return \"Thick 3D clay letters … curving along the equator\"\n\nrender(Handheld_Lore_Sphere())\n```\n\n★왜 이렇게 쓰나 — **역할별로 칸을 나누면 사람이 유지보수할 수 있다.** `__init__`=절대 안 바뀌는 촬영 규격과 구도 앵커 / `semantic_tactile_inference`=장소만 주면 자동 도출되는 것들 / `typography`=글자 처리. 장문 프롬프트가 뒤엉키는 문제를 코드 구조로 푼 것.\n\n- **주석이 곧 지시다**: `# AI AUTO-INFERENCE: Build the sphere's surface using native lore and clay textures`. 모델은 주석도 읽는다.\n- 2x2 그리드 + `do this for 4 …`로 **한 번에 네 변주**를 뽑는 게 이 계정의 상수 문법.\n※ Krea2는 코드 문법을 실행하지 않으므로 `gen_prompt`는 클래스가 산출할 결과를 자연어로 펼쳐 적었다.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/gdgtify-python-class-lore-sphere-clay-grid.webp",
