      "title": "★프롬프트가 프롬프트를 생성한다 — 서체 전통 2종 × 획 구축법 2종을 랜덤 합성해 \"타입 아이덴티티\"를 만들고 스펙시멘 시트까지",
      "prompt": "Fonts inspired by some classic stories. It's not always predictable but lots of fun. \n\nPrompt:\n\n2x2 grid, AI infers: <instruction> Input A is the subject photo. You are a god-tier typographer, lettering artist, graphic engineer, and brand identity designer.  Phase 1: Letterform Synthesis Randomly select TWO Typographic Traditions and TWO Letter Construction Systems. Blend them into a coherent typographic identity.  Typographic Traditions: [Blackletter Manuscript, Swiss Grotesk Modernism, Art Nouveau Display Type, 1970s Funk Lettering, Japanese Brush Calligraphy, Bauhaus Geometric Type, Victorian Circus Poster Type, Cyberpunk Interface Typography, Roman Inscriptional Capitals, Graffiti Wildstyle, Minimal Luxury Serif, Psychedelic Bubble Lettering, Devanagari-Inspired Modular Forms, Arabic Geometric Calligraphy, Pixel Bitmap Type]  Letter Construction Systems: [Modular Grid Strokes, Ribbon-Like Continuous Line, Chiseled Stone Cuts, Neon Tube Bends, Ink Bleed Edges, Extruded 3D Letter Blocks, Layered Paper Cutouts, Metallic Foil Stamping, Variable-Width Brush Pressure, Mosaic Tile Assembly, Embroidered Thread Stitches, Glitch Fragmentation, Inflated Balloon Forms, Laser-Cut Acrylic, Kinetic Split-Flap Segments]  Phase 2: Visual Rendering Generate a 2:1 horizontal asset sheet.  LEFT HALF: Transform the main subject or readable text in Input A into the generated typographic identity. Preserve exact composition, spacing relationships, silhouette, and camera angle.  RIGHT HALF: Create a clean type-specimen panel.  Phase 3: Text Content Render this text on the right panel:  \"Type Identity: [Generate a name from the selected elements]  <instruction> Input A is the source image. Goal: Transform Input A into '[Type Identity]'. Rules: Composition Fidelity: Preserve original layout, spacing, silhouette, and scene structure. Typographic Fusion: Combine [Typographic Tradition 1] with [Typographic Tradition 2]. Construction: Build the forms using [Letter Construction System 1] and [Letter Construction System 2]. Details: Include stroke contrast, terminals, joins, texture, dimensionality, and production artifacts. Lighting: Reveal material and letterform depth clearly. Rendering: High-resolution typographic design visualization. Output: ONE image, high-fidelity letterform transformation. </instruction>\" </instruction>",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid of typographic asset sheets, 16:9. Each panel is split in half: the left half transforms a subject word into a synthesised letterform identity, the right half is a clean type-specimen panel listing the identity's name and its construction rules. The four identities each blend two typographic traditions with two letter-construction systems — blackletter manuscript built with neon tube bends; Swiss grotesk modernism cut as chiselled stone; Art Nouveau display type assembled from layered paper cutouts; Japanese brush calligraphy rendered in embroidered thread stitches. Show stroke contrast, terminals, joins, texture, dimensionality and production artifacts clearly; lighting reveals material and letterform depth. High-resolution typographic design visualisation, clean neutral backdrop, museum-grade type specimen quality.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**프롬프트 안에서 프롬프트를 생성시킨다.** 3단계 구조가 전부다:\n\n**Phase 1 — Letterform Synthesis**: 두 배열에서 **각각 2개씩 무작위 선택**해 하나의 타입 아이덴티티로 융합\n- `Typographic Traditions` 15종: 블랙레터 필사본 / 스위스 그로테스크 / 아르누보 디스플레이 / 70년대 펑크 레터링 / 일본 붓서예 / 바우하우스 기하 / 빅토리아 서커스 포스터 / 사이버펑크 인터페이스 / 로마 각인 대문자 / 그래피티 와일드스타일 / 미니멀 럭셔리 세리프 / 사이키델릭 버블 / 데바나가리 모듈러 / 아랍 기하 캘리그래피 / 픽셀 비트맵\n- `Letter Construction Systems` 15종: 모듈러 그리드 획 / 리본형 연속선 / 돌 정 자국 / 네온관 구부림 / 잉크 번짐 / 3D 압출 블록 / 레이어드 페이퍼컷 / 메탈 포일 스탬핑 / 가변 붓압 / 모자이크 타일 / 자수 스티치 / 글리치 파편 / 풍선 팽창 / 레이저컷 아크릴 / 스플릿플랩 세그먼트\n\n★**전통(무엇처럼 보이나) × 구축법(무엇으로 만들어졌나)을 직교하는 두 축으로 분리**한 게 핵심이다. 15×15 = 225조합, 여기서 2×2를 뽑으니 사실상 매번 새 서체가 나온다.\n\n**Phase 2 — 좌우 분할 렌더**: 왼쪽은 원본 구도·간격·실루엣·카메라 각도를 **보존한 채** 글자만 변환, 오른쪽은 **타입 스펙시멘 패널**.\n**Phase 3 — ★자기참조**: 오른쪽 패널에 *다음에 쓸 프롬프트를 텍스트로 렌더링*한다. `Type Identity: [생성된 이름]` + 그 아이덴티티를 재현하는 `<instruction>` 블록 전문. **결과 이미지가 곧 다음 생성의 설명서**가 되는 구조.\n\n- 라이브러리의 룰렛 계열([[gdgtify-sql-random-style-lego-poster-grid]], [[gdgtify-dice-roll-scene-grid]])과 같은 발상이지만, **결과물에 레시피를 박아 넣는다**는 점이 새롭다.",
