      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\nUltra-realistic cinematic street fashion portrait of a stylish young woman standing beside a floor-to-ceiling glass storefront on a bustling city street at blue hour. She wears an oversized charcoal-black wool blazer over a fitted black tank top, light-wash high-waisted denim jeans, minimal silver hoop earrings, and effortless natural makeup. Her hair is loosely tied back with soft face-framing strands. She gazes confidently toward the camera with a calm editorial expression. The scene is photographed through the glass, creating layered reflections, subtle ghosting, and transparent overlays of the city. Long-exposure traffic creates vibrant red, orange, white, and teal light trails across the frame, while soft neon signs and blurred headlights produce cinematic bokeh. Mixed ambient twilight and storefront lighting illuminate the face with a gentle glow, balancing warm and cool tones. Premium luxury fashion campaign aesthetic, Vogue editorial photography, candid yet refined composition, shallow depth of field, soft film grain, realistic skin texture, optical lens reflections, natural color grading, Leica SL2-S, Summilux 50mm f/1.4, Kodak Portra 400 color palette, ultra-photorealistic, HDR, 8K, masterpiece.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-realistic cinematic street fashion portrait of a stylish young woman standing beside a floor-to-ceiling glass storefront on a bustling city street at blue hour. She wears an oversized charcoal-black wool blazer over a fitted black tank top, light-wash high-waisted denim jeans, minimal silver hoop earrings and effortless natural makeup; her hair is loosely tied back with soft face-framing strands, and she gazes confidently toward the camera with a calm editorial expression. The scene is photographed through the glass, creating layered reflections, subtle ghosting and transparent overlays of the city across her figure. Long-exposure traffic draws vibrant red, orange, white and teal light trails across the frame, while soft neon signage and blurred headlights produce cinematic bokeh. Mixed ambient twilight and storefront light illuminate her face with a gentle glow, balancing warm and cool tones. Premium luxury fashion campaign aesthetic, candid yet refined, shallow depth of field, soft film grain, realistic skin texture, optical lens reflections, natural colour grading, 50mm f/1.4 look, Kodak Portra 400 palette, 8K.",
      "prompt_ko": "★한 줄이 이 사진의 정체다 — **\"유리를 통과해 촬영한다\"**(`photographed through the glass`). 그 결과로 세 가지가 공짜로 따라온다: **겹쳐진 반사 / 미묘한 고스팅 / 도시의 반투명 오버레이.** 인물 위에 도시가 겹쳐지면서 한 장 안에 층(layer)이 생긴다.\n\n★시간대와 노출을 함께 지정해 색을 확보한다:\n- **블루아워** — 하늘의 차가운 잔광과 상점 조명의 따뜻함이 공존하는 유일한 시간대\n- **장노출 차량 광선**(red/orange/white/teal) — 정지한 인물과 흐르는 도시의 대비\n- 네온 사인과 흐린 헤드라이트로 **시네마틱 보케**\n\n- 조명 서술이 실무적이다: *\"혼합된 앰비언트 트와일라잇 + 상점 조명이 얼굴을 부드럽게 밝혀 **난색과 냉색을 균형**시킨다.\"* 유리 반사가 지저분해지지 않게 얼굴만은 확실히 살리는 장치.\n- 장비·필름 스택으로 톤을 못박는 관용 문법: `Leica SL2-S / Summilux 50mm f/1.4 / Kodak Portra 400`. 숫자 자체보다 **얕은 심도 + 부드러운 필름 그레인 + 자연스러운 색보정**의 신호로 작동한다.\n- 스타일링을 색으로만 서술(차콜블랙 블레이저·블랙 탱크탑·라이트워시 데님·실버 후프)해 시대감을 지운다.",
