      "prompt": "Made with GPT IMAGE 2\nPrompt \n\nAdvertising poster\n\nUse the uploaded product image as your main reference point.\n\nKeep the cup shape, logo placement, typography, proportions, corporate identity elements, lid design, textures, colors, materials, and overall brand style exactly as shown in the reference image.\n\nCreate an ultra-realistic Korean-style premium beverage advertising campaign.\n\nThe drink is elegantly located in the center of a luxurious minimalist studio. The background color is inspired by the taste of the drink and fits seamlessly into the exquisite monochromatic palette.\n\nLarge shiny drops of liquid made from the drink's signature ingredient naturally flow down from the upper edges of the composition.\n\nThe dynamic moment of pouring the ingredients is captured in the air above the drink, demonstrating how the thick liquid pours into the cup in an elegant cascade. The pouring element should be luxurious, appetizing and physically realistic.\n\nThe drink demonstrates the magnificent effects of mixing ingredients inside the cup, creating stunning gradients, swirling textures, creamy transitions and flowing ribbons of flavor.\n\nHigh-quality ingredients are neatly arranged around the base of the product, which tell the story of the drink's taste.:\n\nFresh ingredients\nFlavor cubes\nSauce cubes\nNatural side dishes\nExquisite culinary accents\n\nAll ingredients should look freshly prepared and very photorealistic.\n\nThe composition corresponds to the aesthetics of advertising elite Korean cafes:\n\nMinimalist luxury style\nPure negative space\nBalanced product focus\nElegant visual hierarchy\nPremium Commercial Photography\n\nLighting:\n\nSoft studio lighting\nLuxury backlight for photographing food\nGentle shadows\nSubtle reflections\nHigh-quality drink of commercial quality\n\nMaterials:\n\nGlossy liquids\nRealistic ice cubes\nCrystal clear glass\nRich creamy texture\nDetailed surface of ingredients\n\nMood:\n\nAn advertisement for a luxury Korean cafe, an advertising campaign for premium drinks, an elegant culinary editorial, commercial photography of products, sophisticated minimalist branding, and world-class advertising quality.\n\nUltra-realistic, 8K, ultra-detailed, commercial food photography, premium Korean advertising, luxury drink poster, shallow depth of field, masterpiece quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-realistic Korean-style premium beverage advertising poster. A tall iced beverage cup sits elegantly at the centre of a luxurious minimalist studio, its shape, lid design, texture and branding kept exactly as designed. The background colour is derived from the drink's own flavour, forming an exquisite monochromatic palette in soft peach. Large glossy droplets of the drink's signature ingredient flow down from the upper edges of the composition. Above the cup, the dynamic moment of pouring is captured in mid-air — a thick liquid cascading down into the cup in an elegant, appetising, physically believable ribbon. Inside the cup the ingredients mix into stunning gradients, swirling textures, creamy transitions and flowing ribbons of flavour. Around the base, fresh ingredients, flavour cubes, sauce cubes and delicate culinary accents are neatly arranged, telling the story of the taste, all freshly prepared and photorealistic. Soft studio lighting with luxury food backlight, gentle shadows, subtle reflections; glossy liquids, realistic ice cubes, crystal clear glass, rich creamy texture. Pure negative space, balanced product focus, elegant visual hierarchy, shallow depth of field, premium commercial food photography.",
      "prompt_ko": "★제품 광고에서 **맛을 어떻게 보여주는가**에 대한 답이 세 겹으로 쌓여 있다:\n\n1. **공중의 붓는 순간**(`the dynamic moment of pouring captured in the air above the drink`) — 완성된 음료가 아니라 **만들어지는 중**을 보여준다. 조건은 *\"럭셔리하고 식욕을 돋우며 물리적으로 사실적일 것.\"*\n2. **컵 안의 혼합**(`gradients, swirling textures, creamy transitions, flowing ribbons of flavour`) — 재료가 섞이는 광경 자체가 맛의 설명이 된다.\n3. **바닥의 재료 배치** — 신선한 재료·플레이버 큐브·소스 큐브·가니시. *\"맛의 이야기를 들려주는\"* 소품들.\n\n★배경색 규칙이 영리하다 — **음료의 맛에서 배경색을 도출**해 모노크로매틱 팔레트로 간다(`background color is inspired by the taste of the drink`). 딸기면 핑크, 말차면 그린. 제품과 배경이 한 색 계열이면 고급스러워진다.\n\n- 첫 블록은 [[simplyannisa-white-pedestal-product-promo-board]]와 같은 **제품 불변 계약**이다 — 컵 형태·로고 위치·조판·비율·CI 요소·뚜껑 디자인·텍스처·색·재질을 레퍼런스 그대로.\n- 상단에서 흘러내리는 **큰 광택 물방울**로 프레임 가장자리까지 제품 세계로 채운다.\n- 톤 좌표: \"고급 한국 카페 광고\" — 미니멀 럭셔리 + 순수 여백 + 균형 잡힌 제품 포커스.",
