      "title": "빗방울 창 너머 골든아워 초상 — 유리의 물방울·네온 반사·할레이션으로 \"우연히 찍힌 순간\"을 만든다",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:  Cinematic golden hour portrait photographed through the rain-speckled window of a vintage roadside café, beautiful young woman with warm olive-toned skin and soft brunette hair sitting quietly by the window, gently holding a ceramic coffee cup with both hands, her gaze slightly turned away from the camera as if lost in thought, warm sunset light illuminating her cheekbones and catching the strands of her hair, deep emerald-green interior shadows blending with glowing red neon reflections on the glass, dreamy amber bokeh lights in the background, candid imperfect framing with subtle motion blur, nostalgic 35mm Kodak Portra film aesthetic, rich film grain, soft focus, luminous halation around highlights, intimate romantic vintage editorial photography, cinematic and atmospheric mood, ultra-realistic, masterpiece --ar 4:5 --raw --stylize 120 --weird 3 --hd --preview",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic golden-hour portrait photographed through the rain-speckled window of a vintage roadside café. A young woman with warm olive-toned skin and soft brunette hair sits quietly by the glass, gently holding a ceramic coffee cup with both hands, her gaze turned slightly away from the camera as if lost in thought. Warm sunset light rakes across her cheekbones and catches individual strands of her hair. Deep emerald-green interior shadows blend with glowing red neon reflections on the glass, and dreamy amber bokeh lights float in the background. Candid imperfect framing with subtle motion blur, nostalgic 35mm film aesthetic, rich grain, soft focus, luminous halation blooming around the highlights, intimate romantic vintage editorial photography, atmospheric and ultra-realistic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★유리 한 장으로 층을 만드는 계열([[taaruk-through-glass-reflection-street-portrait]])의 실내 버전. 이쪽은 **빗방울**이 주인공이다.\n\n레이어 구성:\n- **유리 표면** — 빗방울(`rain-speckled`) + 붉은 네온 반사\n- **실내** — 딥 에메랄드그린 그림자\n- **외부 광** — 골든아워 석양이 광대뼈와 머리카락 가닥을 훑음\n- **배경** — 앰버 보케\n\n→ 냉색(에메랄드) · 난색(골든아워) · 강조색(레드 네온)이 유리를 사이에 두고 겹친다.\n\n★\"우연히 찍힌 순간\"을 만드는 3종 세트:\n`candid imperfect framing`(의도적으로 어긋난 프레이밍) + `subtle motion blur` + `gaze slightly turned away, as if lost in thought`(카메라를 안 보는 시선)\n→ 연출 티를 지우는 건 조명이 아니라 **불완전함의 명시**다.\n\n- **할레이션**(`luminous halation around highlights`)이 필름 룩의 핵심 — 밝은 부분 주변이 부드럽게 번지는 현상. 디지털 느낌을 지우는 가장 값싼 한 단어.\n- 원문 끝의 미드저니 파라미터(`--stylize 120 --weird 3`)는 Krea2에 대응물이 없어 제거했다.",
