      "title": "★생체모방 제품 컨셉시트 — 영감원의 해부 특징을 제품 기능으로 매핑(지느러미→통풍, 껍질→보호, 부리→센서)",
      "prompt": "A super versatile product design prompt for GPT. I used it for dinosaurs but you can use it for all kinds of ideas. \n\ninput:\nproduct_function = [any product function]\ninspiration_source = [any biological / mechanical / cultural / natural source]\nuser_context = [optional]\ntech_features = [optional]\nstyle_level = [minimal / premium / playful / luxury / futuristic / ai-infers]\n\nrun biomorphic_product_extraction:\n\nproduct_dna := infer product category, usage scenario, user interaction, power system, controls, safety needs, and ergonomic constraints\ninspiration_dna := infer silhouette, anatomy, texture, motion, structural logic, surface rhythm, protective forms, sensory cues, or symbolic traits\nfunction_mapping := map inspiration traits to product functions:\n  - fins → airflow / cooling / acoustic dispersion if relevant\n  - shell → protection / enclosure if relevant\n  - beak / snout / head → sensor / output / light / nozzle if relevant\n  - wings → folding / circulation / coverage if relevant\n  - scales / plates → vents / grip / modular panels if relevant\n  - roots / veins → cable routes / fluid paths / support if relevant\n  - eyes / spots → indicators / sensors / leds if relevant\n\nmaterial_system := infer ceramic, aluminum, fabric, recycled plastic, glass, rubber, wood, resin, carbon, silicone, or other appropriate materials\ncmf := infer color, material, finish, texture, surface softness, gloss, transparency, and accent colors\nproduct_name := generate a concise brandable name derived from function + inspiration\nfeature_list := generate realistic product-specific features\ndetail_panels := infer 4 close-up views that explain the most important features\nlayout := infer hero render + spec card + detail grid presentation\n\nrender:\na premium biomorphic product concept sheet with a hero product render and industrial-design feature documentation.\n\nforbidden:\nhard-coded dinosaur, hard-coded lamp, hard-coded speaker, hard-coded purifier, hard-coded fan, copied names, random anatomy, fake features unrelated to product function.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium biomorphic product concept sheet documenting a desk air purifier inspired by deep-sea creatures. The hero render sits centre-stage: a matte ceramic body whose shell-like outer plates open to reveal a soft-glowing intake, fin-shaped vents fanning along one side for airflow, a slender beak-like nozzle at the top as the outlet, and small luminous eye-like indicator dots along the spine. Materials read as ceramic, brushed aluminium, recycled plastic and soft-touch silicone with muted sand, deep teal and warm off-white CMF and a single amber accent. Around the hero render, a spec card lists a generated brandable product name and a short feature list, and a grid of four close-up detail panels explains the vent geometry, the nozzle mechanism, the modular plate joint and the base sensor ring. Clean neutral studio background, precise industrial-design layout, soft diffused lighting, ultra-detailed materials, award-winning product design presentation.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**생체모방(biomorphic)을 우연에 맡기지 않고 매핑표로 강제한다.** 이게 이 프롬프트의 엔진:\n\n```\nfunction_mapping := map inspiration traits to product functions:\n  fins        → airflow / cooling / acoustic dispersion\n  shell       → protection / enclosure\n  beak / head → sensor / output / light / nozzle\n  wings       → folding / circulation / coverage\n  scales      → vents / grip / modular panels\n  roots/veins → cable routes / fluid paths / support\n  eyes/spots  → indicators / sensors / leds\n```\n각 줄 끝에 **`if relevant`**가 붙어 있다 — 억지로 다 넣지 말라는 뜻.\n\n★2단계 DNA 추출이 선행한다:\n- `product_dna` := 제품 카테고리·사용 시나리오·사용자 상호작용·전원계·조작부·안전 요구·인체공학 제약\n- `inspiration_dna` := 실루엣·해부구조·질감·운동·구조 논리·표면 리듬·보호 형태·감각 신호·상징성\n→ 둘을 뽑은 **다음에** 매핑한다. 순서가 뒤집히면 그냥 동물 모양 껍데기가 나온다.\n\n- 산출물 레이아웃도 지정: **히어로 렌더 + 스펙 카드 + 디테일 4컷 그리드.** `detail_panels := infer 4 close-up views that explain the most important features` — \"가장 중요한 기능을 설명하는\" 4컷이라는 조건이 붙어 임의 확대를 막는다.\n- ★`forbidden` 목록이 범용성을 지킨다: **하드코딩된 공룡·램프·스피커·정화기·선풍기 금지, 베낀 이름 금지, 무작위 해부 금지, 제품 기능과 무관한 가짜 기능 금지.**\n  작성자는 공룡으로 썼지만 *\"어떤 아이디어에도 쓸 수 있다\"* 고 밝혔다.",
      "ref_image": null,
