      "title": "아이패드 화면에서 솟아오르는 3D 레이어드 페이퍼컷 디오라마 — 굽이진 길이 랜드마크를 잇고 종이 배너로 라벨링",
      "prompt": "🇲🇦 Morocco | 🇵🇹 Portugal\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a highly detailed 3D layered paper-cut diorama displayed on an iPad resting on a rustic wooden desk with an Apple Pencil on top. The scene features a winding road or pathway connecting the most iconic landmarks, landscapes, and cultural elements of [COUNTRY/CITY/REGION], each labeled with elegant paper banners. Include signature architecture, famous attractions, traditional markets, native flora, local wildlife, and cultural details unique to the destination. Add a vintage car with luggage traveling along the road toward the viewer, surrounded by layered paper trees, mountains, rivers, deserts, or coastlines as appropriate. Use realistic paper textures, crisp cut edges, folded details, soft drop shadows, and a vibrant handcrafted travel-poster aesthetic. Place the title \"[DESTINATION]\" at the top with a matching cultural icon, the subtitle \"IN MY iPad\", and a three-line poetic tagline highlighting the destination's beauty and spirit.",
      "gen_prompt": "A highly detailed 3D layered paper-cut diorama displayed on a tablet resting on a rustic wooden desk with a stylus lying on top. Inside the screen the scene rises out in cut-paper layers: a winding road threads through the country's most iconic landmarks, each labelled with a small elegant paper banner — a hilltop fortress, a tiled market square, a coastal lighthouse, a terraced vineyard. Layered paper trees, mountains, rivers and coastline recede in planes behind them, and a vintage car loaded with luggage travels along the road toward the viewer. Realistic paper textures, crisp cut edges, folded details, soft drop shadows between layers, vibrant handcrafted travel-poster palette. A title sits at the top with a matching cultural icon, a small subtitle beneath it, and a three-line poetic tagline below. Warm desk lighting, shallow depth of field on the wood grain.",
      "prompt_ko": "★두 겹의 액자 구조다 — **실물 책상 위 태블릿**(사진) 안에서 **종이 디오라마**(공예)가 솟아오른다. 매체가 셋(사진·화면·종이) 겹치면서 깊이가 생긴다. 라이브러리의 프레임인프레임 계열([[noorwithwifi-frame-in-frame-smartphone-travel-poster]])의 공예 버전.\n\n★구성 장치:\n- **굽이진 길이 랜드마크를 꿴다** — 나열이 아니라 동선으로 묶는 방식([[taaruk-floating-island-diorama-travel-poster]]의 리본 길과 같은 해법)\n- **각 랜드마크에 종이 배너 라벨** — 정보가 붙으면 관광 포스터가 아니라 지도가 된다\n- **짐을 실은 빈티지 자동차가 관객 쪽으로** — 시선의 출발점이자 여행의 서사\n\n- 종이 재질을 네 가지로 구체화: `realistic paper textures` / `crisp cut edges` / `folded details` / **`soft drop shadows`**(레이어 사이 그림자). 마지막 것이 없으면 평면 일러스트가 된다.\n- 조판 3단: 상단 제목 + 문화 아이콘 / 부제 / **3행 시적 태그라인**.\n- 치환 슬롯: `[COUNTRY/CITY/REGION]` `[DESTINATION]` — 원문의 \"IN MY iPad\" 부제는 기기명이라 `gen_prompt`에서는 일반화했다.",
