      "title": "★::가중치 + AI_INFER 조합 — 각 항목에 중요도(5/4/-4)를 매겨 브랜드 시스템 전체를 한 줄로 발주",
      "prompt": "It's been a long time since I actually did prompts for normal things. Here is one for Avant Garde home brands: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 avant garde home brand:: premium luxury advertising campaign for [PRODUCT]::5 Hero Object: AI_INFER(PRODUCT redesigned or staged as a sculptural desirable object, center-weighted, material-rich)::5 Brand Identity: AI_INFER(elegant brand name, minimal logo mark, 2-5 word tagline, 3-5 color palette, typography style)::4 Packaging System: AI_INFER(matching box, sleeve, label, product card, instruction insert, or display case)::4 Layout: clean editorial composition, generous negative space, tasteful product copy, spec card or UI overlay if relevant::4 Material Atmosphere: AI_INFER(surface, backdrop, props, mist, fabric, stone, light, curtain, reflections based on PRODUCT category)::5 Aesthetic: high-end product photography, quiet luxury, pitch deck quality, museum object, premium DTC brand launch::5 generic ad, clutter, cheap typography, random props, unreadable text, inconsistent brand system::-4",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of premium luxury advertising campaigns for four avant-garde home brands — a sculptural ceramic diffuser, a minimal cast-aluminium table lamp, a hand-thrown stoneware kettle and a linen-wrapped acoustic panel. In each panel the hero object is staged as a sculptural desirable object, centre-weighted and material-rich, against its own material atmosphere: mist over stone, draped fabric, a curved backdrop, soft reflections chosen to suit that product. Each brand carries its own elegant name, minimal logo mark, short tagline and restrained 3-5 colour palette with a consistent typographic style, and a matching packaging system appears beside the product — box, sleeve, label and product card. Clean editorial composition with generous negative space, tasteful product copy and a small spec card. High-end product photography, quiet luxury, museum-object presentation, premium brand-launch quality. No generic ad look, no clutter, no cheap typography, no random props, no inconsistent brand system.",
      "prompt_ko": "★두 문법의 결합이다 — **미드저니식 `::가중치`** + **`AI_INFER()` 위임**:\n\n```\npremium luxury advertising campaign for [PRODUCT]::5\nHero Object:        AI_INFER(조각적 오브제로 재디자인·연출, 중앙 무게, 재질감 풍부)::5\nBrand Identity:     AI_INFER(브랜드명·미니멀 로고·2~5단어 태그라인·3~5색 팔레트·타이포 스타일)::4\nPackaging System:   AI_INFER(박스·슬리브·라벨·제품카드·설명서·디스플레이 케이스)::4\nLayout:             클린 에디토리얼 구성, 넉넉한 여백, 스펙카드::4\nMaterial Atmosphere: AI_INFER(표면·배경·소품·안개·직물·돌·빛·커튼·반사 — 제품 카테고리에 맞춰)::5\nAesthetic:          quiet luxury, 미술관 오브제, 프리미엄 DTC 런칭::5\ngeneric ad, clutter, cheap typography, random props, inconsistent brand system::-4  ← ★음수 가중치\n```\n\n★배울 점:\n- **중요도를 숫자로 배분**한다. 히어로 오브젝트·재질 분위기·미학이 5, 브랜드 아이덴티티·패키지·레이아웃이 4. 무엇이 먼저 지켜져야 하는지가 명시된다.\n- **금지 항목에 `::-4` 음수 가중치** — 네거티브 프롬프트를 같은 문법 안에서 처리.\n- **브랜드 시스템 전체를 한 번에 발주**한다: 제품만이 아니라 이름·로고·태그라인·팔레트·타이포·패키지까지. `AI_INFER`로 위임하니 프롬프트는 짧고 결과는 완결된 브랜드 세계가 나온다.\n※ `::N` 가중치는 Krea2에 대응물이 없어 `gen_prompt`에서는 제거하고 서술 순서로 우선순위를 반영했다.",
