      "prompt": "Made with nano banana pro\nPrompt:\n\nUltra-premium cinematic advertising poster for Bowers & Wilkins Px8 luxury wireless headphones. Extreme macro close-up portrait of a sophisticated musician in a dark immersive studio environment. The headphones dominate the frame, with the premium earcup surface acting as a gateway into a breathtaking invisible world of sound: elegant waves of acoustic energy, subtle visualized frequencies, deep atmospheric layers, floating particles and rich musical textures reflected through the polished metal surface. Realistic acoustic distortion, smooth sound waves, detailed studio atmosphere, warm ambient lighting and cinematic depth visible around the headphones. Hyper-real human skin contrast: natural facial features, realistic skin texture, subtle warmth from studio lights, tiny details of hair and skin, calm focused expression with eyes closed in complete immersion. The Bowers & Wilkins Px8 headphones must look physically accurate and luxurious: precise aluminum construction, premium leather ear cushions, realistic metal reflections, engineered materials, clean craftsmanship. The surface is covered with ultra-fine dust particles, subtle fingerprints on metal edges, delicate reflections of studio lights and realistic texture details. Extreme tactile realism: warm human presence versus cold precision audio technology. Soft cinematic studio lighting, golden highlights, crisp reflections, smooth shadows, shallow depth of field, minimal dark background. Elegant premium composition with the headphones as the hero product. Include refined Bowers & Wilkins branding and “PX8” typography with optional tagline “HEAR EVERY DETAIL”. Color palette: deep black, graphite gray, warm gold, brushed aluminum silver, soft skin beige, dark studio shadows. Hyper-realistic cinematic product photography, luxury audio campaign, 8K, world-class commercial advertising quality. Negative prompt: cartoon, plastic skin, fake sound waves, cheap electronics advertising style, blurry headphones, weak reflections, exaggerated expression, influencer look, futuristic sci-fi headset, low-detail product",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-premium cinematic advertising poster for luxury wireless headphones: an extreme macro close-up of a musician in a dark immersive studio, eyes closed in complete immersion with a calm focused expression. The headphones dominate the frame, and the polished metal earcup surface acts as a gateway into an invisible world of sound — elegant waves of acoustic energy, subtly visualised frequencies, deep atmospheric layers, floating particles and rich musical texture reflected across it. The headphones look physically accurate and luxurious: precise aluminium construction, premium leather ear cushions, realistic metal reflections, engineered materials, clean craftsmanship, with ultra-fine dust particles, subtle fingerprints on the metal edges and delicate reflections of studio lights. Hyper-real human skin against it — natural facial texture, tiny details of hair and pores, warmth from the studio lights. Extreme tactile realism built on the contrast between warm human presence and cold precision audio technology. Soft cinematic lighting, golden highlights, crisp reflections, shallow depth of field, minimal dark background. Deep black, graphite grey, warm gold, brushed aluminium silver, soft skin beige. No cartoon, no plastic skin, no fake sound waves, no cheap electronics-ad look.",
      "prompt_ko": "★제품 광고의 컨셉이 한 문장에 담겼다 — **이어컵 표면을 '보이지 않는 소리 세계로 들어가는 관문'으로 쓴다**(`the premium earcup surface acting as a gateway into a breathtaking invisible world of sound`).\n\n헤드폰은 소리를 보여줄 수 없는 제품이다. 그래서 **금속 표면의 반사에 소리의 세계를 비춘다** — 음향 에너지의 파동, 시각화된 주파수, 대기층, 떠다니는 입자.\n\n★두 번째 축은 **대비**다: *\"warm human presence versus cold precision audio technology\"* (인간의 온기 vs 차가운 정밀 기술). 그래서 인물 피부를 극사실로 밀어붙인다 — 모공·머리카락·스튜디오 조명의 온기.\n\n★**제품에 '사용감'을 넣는다** — 초미세 먼지 입자, 금속 모서리의 미묘한 지문, 조명 반사. 완벽하게 깨끗한 제품은 CG처럼 보인다. 지문 한 줄이 실물감을 만든다.\n\n- 네거티브가 실전적이다: `fake sound waves`(가짜 음파) · `cheap electronics advertising style` · `futuristic sci-fi headset`(SF 헤드셋처럼 되는 것) — AI가 오디오 광고에서 미끄러지는 지점들.\n- 팔레트를 재질로 지정: 딥블랙 · 그라파이트 그레이 · 웜골드 · **브러시드 알루미늄 실버** · 스킨 베이지.\n※ 원문 실브랜드·모델명은 `prompt`에 보존, `gen_prompt`는 일반 제품으로 치환.",
