      "prompt": "This prompt turns any subject into colorful t-shirt designs. \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for science inspired topics: [EQUATION]  ($ SUBJECT) + (bold central comic emblem, thick black outlines, halftone dot shading) + (starbursts, impact lines, speed marks, jagged arrows) + (loud uppercase headline with red fill, black outline, shadow) + (2–4 speech bubble or badge callouts with punchy words) + (lower caption banner for stats or punchline) + (limited retro screenprint palette: red, navy, teal, orange, black, cream, vintage yellow) + (cream cotton shirt, flat-lay, subtle fabric texture) + (slight ink distress, misregistration, vintage wear) - (photorealism) - (soft gradients) - (tiny unreadable text) - (empty space without graphic framing) = [THE OUTPUT]  [INSTRUCTION] Render the visual solution. $ SUBJECT becomes a retro comic T-shirt graphic.  VISUAL LOGIC: - Center the subject as an action emblem, surrounded by comic energy. - Headline arches above, short callouts burst from key details. - Lower banner ties it together like a wearable poster.  MATERIAL LOGIC: - Ink sits on fabric, not floating. Halftone dots are visible at close range. - Colors stay flat, separated by black keyline.  OUTPUT: A finished flat-lay product mockup of the shirt, 8K, e-commerce ready.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of four science-inspired retro comic T-shirt graphics, each shown as a finished flat-lay product mockup on a cream cotton shirt with subtle fabric texture. Each design centres a bold comic emblem of its topic with thick black outlines and halftone dot shading, surrounded by starbursts, impact lines, speed marks and jagged arrows. A loud uppercase headline arches above in red fill with black outline and drop shadow; two to four speech-bubble or badge callouts burst from key details with punchy words; a lower caption banner ties the composition together like a wearable poster. Limited retro screenprint palette of red, navy, teal, orange, black, cream and vintage yellow. Slight ink distress, misregistration and vintage wear — the ink sits on the fabric rather than floating above it, halftone dots visible at close range, colours flat and separated by a black keyline. No photorealism, no soft gradients, no tiny unreadable text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★[[gdgtify-equation-syntax-miniature-artifact]]와 같은 **방정식 문법**의 두 번째 사례. 덧셈으로 스타일을 쌓고 뺄셈으로 금지한다:\n\n```\n($ SUBJECT)\n+ (굵은 중앙 코믹 엠블럼, 두꺼운 검정 외곽선, 망점 음영)\n+ (스타버스트, 임팩트 라인, 스피드 마크, 들쭉날쭉 화살표)\n+ (빨강 채움 + 검정 외곽 + 그림자의 큰 대문자 헤드라인)\n+ (2~4개 말풍선·배지 콜아웃)\n+ (하단 캡션 배너)\n+ (제한된 레트로 스크린프린트 팔레트: 빨강·네이비·틸·오렌지·검정·크림·빈티지 옐로)\n+ (크림 코튼 셔츠, 플랫레이, 은은한 원단 질감)\n+ (약간의 잉크 거칠기, 판 어긋남, 빈티지 마모)\n- (photorealism) - (soft gradients) - (tiny unreadable text) - (그래픽 프레이밍 없는 빈 공간)\n= [THE OUTPUT]\n```\n\n★이 프롬프트의 특별한 점은 **`MATERIAL LOGIC` 섹션**이다:\n> *\"**Ink sits on fabric, not floating.** Halftone dots are visible at close range. Colors stay flat, separated by black keyline.\"*\n\n→ 티셔츠 목업이 가짜로 보이는 이유는 **그래픽이 천 위에 떠 있어서**다. \"잉크가 천에 얹힌다\"는 한 줄이 인쇄물의 물성을 만든다.\n\n- `VISUAL LOGIC` 3줄이 배치를 잡는다: 주제를 액션 엠블럼으로 중앙에 / 헤드라인은 위로 아치 / 하단 배너가 전체를 묶어 **\"입는 포스터\"**로.",
