      "prompt": "🇸🇮 Slovenia; Two Destinations.\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a premium cinematic travel poster of [COUNTRY/DESTINATION] featuring [ICONIC LANDMARK 1], [LANDMARK 2], and [NATURAL SCENERY]. Place a bold [COUNTRY NAME] title at the top with the [NATIONAL EMBLEM/LOGO] and a short inspiring tagline: \"[TAGLINE].\" In the foreground, include a floating rocky island or scenic platform with an \"I ❤️ [COUNTRY]\" monument, a signature cultural or natural element, travelers or hikers, directional signposts highlighting key attractions, and the national flag. Add a flowing ribbon in the country's flag colors that transforms into a dramatic waterfall above the clouds. In the background, showcase the destination's most famous landmarks, lush landscapes, and majestic mountains or coastline under a warm sunrise or sunset. Style: ultra-detailed, photorealistic, vibrant colors, cinematic lighting, premium tourism poster, high contrast, 8K quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium cinematic travel poster of an alpine European country. A bold country title sits at the top with a national emblem and a short inspiring tagline beneath it. In the foreground a floating rocky island platform carries an I-heart-country monument, a signature cultural element, small hikers, directional signposts pointing to key attractions and the national flag on a pole. A flowing ribbon in the flag's colours sweeps up from the platform and transforms into a dramatic waterfall cascading above the clouds. Behind it, the country's most famous landmarks, a lakeside castle, lush green valleys and majestic snow-capped mountains stretch under a warm sunrise. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, vibrant colours, cinematic lighting, high contrast, premium tourism poster.",
      "prompt_ko": "★같은 작성자의 여행 포스터 계열 중 **가장 장식적인 판**. 요소를 많이 넣으면서 산만해지지 않는 이유는 **하나의 연결자**가 있기 때문이다:\n\n> *\"a flowing ribbon in the country's flag colors that **transforms into a dramatic waterfall above the clouds**\"*\n\n국기색 리본 → 폭포로 변신. 전경의 플랫폼과 배경의 산악을 하나로 잇는다. ([[goodmanprotocol-split-half-travel-poster-paintriver]]의 페인트 강, [[taaruk-floating-island-diorama-travel-poster]]의 리본 길과 같은 발상 — **흐르는 무언가로 화면을 꿰기**)\n\n★전경 구성이 관광 포스터의 관용구를 그대로 쓴다:\n- **부유하는 암석 플랫폼** — 디오라마 감각\n- **\"I ❤️ [국가]\" 기념물** — 실제 관광지의 포토스팟\n- **방향 이정표**(directional signposts) — 명소 이름을 자연스럽게 노출\n- 작은 등산객들 — 스케일\n\n- 치환 슬롯이 많다: `[COUNTRY/DESTINATION]` `[LANDMARK 1·2]` `[NATURAL SCENERY]` `[NATIONAL EMBLEM]` `[TAGLINE]`. 나라만 바꾸면 시리즈가 된다.",
