      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nAn ultra-realistic cinematic dreamy lifestyle photo celebrating SUMMER ’26, featuring a young Korean woman sitting alone on the upper platform of a faded coral-pink vintage lifeguard tower on a quiet seaside beach, captured from a close low-angle perspective.\n\nUse tighter framing focused on her upper body, dangling legs, and the weathered wooden platform, creating an intimate, peaceful, youthful composition. The lifeguard tower should feel naturally aged and sun-faded rather than newly painted or artificial.\n\nShe sits casually on the edge of the platform, wearing a pale blue-and-white striped sleeveless romper, lightweight white canvas sneakers, and a soft cream bucket hat resting loosely behind her head. A small vintage film camera hangs from one wrist, while she holds a half-melted pastel popsicle in the other hand.\n\nShe looks toward the distant ocean with a gentle, unposed smile, expressing quiet freedom, summer anticipation, and the feeling of an endless school holiday.\n\nHer dark hair is tied in a loose low ponytail, with wispy strands moving naturally in the warm coastal breeze. The striped fabric and hat ribbon flutter softly in the same direction.\n\nA translucent yellow kite is tied to the side railing, floating high above her and adding playful movement. Beside her are a folded striped beach towel, a small seashell pouch, and a pair of retro sunglasses.\n\nCute hand-drawn doodles are naturally integrated around the scene: tiny seashells, smiling suns, waves, stars, hearts, sparkles, seagulls, and miniature fish.\n\nAdd handwritten-style white sketch text floating across the open sky like notes from a summer diary:\n“SUMMER ’26”\n“sea you soon”\n“salt in the air”\n“stay golden”\n\nA vast pale blue summer sky dominates the background with generous negative space. Show only a thin suggestion of the sparkling ocean horizon near the lower edge, keeping the composition airy, uncluttered, and emotionally spacious.\n\nBright coastal daylight, soft overexposed highlights, hazy dreamy glow, subtle lens bloom, pastel film tones, low contrast, smooth highlight roll-off, naturally luminous skin.\n\nColor palette: faded coral pink, powder blue, seafoam, translucent yellow, warm white, sandy cream.\n\nStyle: cinematic editorial lifestyle photography, Korean indie summer aesthetic, nostalgic youth diary mood, Kodak Portra 160 film look, delicate film grain, ultra-detailed dreamy realism, natural skin texture, 8K, vertical aspect ratio 3:4.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-realistic cinematic dreamy lifestyle photo of a young woman sitting alone on the upper platform of a faded coral-pink vintage lifeguard tower on a quiet seaside beach, captured from a close low angle. Tight framing on her upper body, dangling legs and the weathered wooden platform, which reads naturally aged and sun-faded rather than freshly painted. She wears a pale blue-and-white striped sleeveless romper, white canvas sneakers and a soft cream bucket hat resting loosely behind her head; a small vintage film camera hangs from one wrist while the other holds a half-melted pastel popsicle. She looks toward the distant ocean with a gentle unposed smile. Her dark hair is in a loose low ponytail with wispy strands moving in the coastal breeze, the striped fabric and hat ribbon fluttering the same direction. A translucent yellow kite is tied to the side railing and floats high above; beside her sit a folded striped towel, a shell pouch and retro sunglasses. Cute hand-drawn doodles are integrated around the scene — tiny shells, smiling suns, waves, stars, hearts, sparkles, seagulls — with handwritten-style white sketch text floating across the sky like summer diary notes. A vast pale blue sky dominates with generous negative space, only a thin sparkling ocean horizon near the lower edge. Bright coastal daylight, soft overexposed highlights, hazy dreamy glow, pastel film tones, low contrast, delicate grain. Faded coral pink, powder blue, seafoam, translucent yellow, warm white, sandy cream.",
      "prompt_ko": "★사진 위에 **손그림 낙서와 손글씨를 얹는** 계열. [[goodmanprotocol-photoreal-plus-lineart-companion]]이 선화 캐릭터를 앉혔다면, 이쪽은 **낙서와 메모만** 흩뿌린다.\n\n**여름 다이어리 무드를 만드는 4요소:**\n1. **낡은 구조물** — *\"자연스럽게 바래고 햇빛에 색이 빠진\"* 코럴핑크 인명구조탑. 새로 칠한 것처럼 보이면 안 된다고 명시. 시간이 묻은 사물이 노스탤지어를 만든다.\n2. **소품이 이야기를 만든다** — 손목의 빈티지 필름카메라 + 반쯤 녹은 파스텔 아이스바 + 난간에 묶인 반투명 노란 연.\n3. **손그림 낙서** — 조개·웃는 해·파도·별·하트·갈매기를 장면에 자연스럽게 통합.\n4. ★**손글씨 스케치 텍스트를 하늘에** — `SUMMER '26` / `sea you soon` / `salt in the air` / `stay golden`. 여백에 떠 있는 일기 메모.\n\n★구도의 결정 — **하늘을 거대하게 비우고 바다는 하단에 가느다랗게만.** *\"airy, uncluttered, and emotionally spacious.\"* 감정을 넣는 게 아니라 **공간을 비워** 감정이 들어올 자리를 만든다.\n- 톤: 소프트 과노출 + 헤이지 글로우 + 파스텔 필름 + 낮은 대비 + Kodak Portra 160. 한국 인디 여름 사진의 관용 색.",
