      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a premium watercolor travel poster for {{CITY_NAME}} in a modern urban sketch style. Display \"{{CITY_NAME}}\" at the top in large black hand-painted brush lettering, with \"{{TAGLINE}}\" below in elegant red handwritten script.\n\nFeature the city's most iconic landmark perfectly centered, towering above the skyline. Surround it with recognizable local architecture illustrated using expressive black ink sketches and soft watercolor washes.\n\nIn the foreground, place a stylish traveler crossing a pedestrian crossing while looking up at the landmark. Add subtle city life (pedestrians, bicycles, taxis, trams, or local vehicles) and strong leading perspective lines.\n\nStyle: luxury editorial travel poster, warm ivory textured paper, soft golden-hour lighting, muted gray-blue palette with one city-inspired accent color, minimalist composition, generous negative space, vertical 2:3 ratio, ultra-detailed, museum-quality, 8K, crisp ink strokes, no logos, no watermarks, no borders, no AI artifacts.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium watercolour travel poster in modern urban-sketch style. The city name runs across the top in large black hand-painted brush lettering with a tagline beneath in elegant red handwritten script. The city's most iconic landmark stands perfectly centred, towering above the skyline, surrounded by recognisable local architecture drawn in expressive black ink sketch lines over soft watercolour washes. In the foreground a stylish traveller crosses a pedestrian crossing while looking up at the landmark, with subtle city life around them — pedestrians, bicycles, a tram — and strong leading perspective lines drawing the eye inward. Warm ivory textured paper, soft golden-hour light, muted grey-blue palette with one city-inspired accent colour, generous negative space, crisp ink strokes, vertical composition.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**시선 유도 장치가 인물이다.** 전경에 **횡단보도를 건너며 랜드마크를 올려다보는 여행자**를 두면, 관객의 시선이 자동으로 그 인물을 따라 위로 올라간다. 게다가 **강한 원근 유도선**(leading perspective lines)이 같은 방향으로 작동한다.\n\n★어반스케치의 재질 규칙:\n- **표현적인 검정 잉크 스케치선** + **부드러운 수채 워시** — 선이 먼저, 색이 나중\n- **웜 아이보리 질감 종이** — 흰 배경이 아니라 종이가 보여야 한다\n- **뮤티드 그레이블루 팔레트 + 도시에서 도출한 액센트 색 하나** — 색을 절제해 스케치를 살린다\n\n- 조판도 두 층: 상단 **큰 검정 손붓 레터링**(도시명) + 그 아래 **우아한 빨강 손글씨**(태그라인). 매체가 다른 두 글씨가 대비를 만든다([[vigocreativeai-outdoor-edition-type-poster]]의 인쇄체+손글씨 충돌과 같은 원리).\n- 치환 슬롯: `{{CITY_NAME}}` `{{TAGLINE}}` 둘뿐. 도시 시리즈로 바로 확장된다.",
