      "title": "★도시명 글자 하나하나가 창이 되어 각기 다른 장면을 담는다 — 빈티지 에디토리얼 여행 포스터 (서울)",
      "prompt": "🇰🇷 Seoul, where tradition meets tomorrow.\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a vintage editorial-style travel poster of South Korea on an aged cream parchment background. Place the gold serif title \"SOUTH KOREA\" at the top with a Taegeuk emblem beneath and the tagline \"CRAFTED THROUGH DYNASTIES\", framed by golden ginkgo leaves and pink-white Mugunghwa flowers. In the center, feature large gold-trimmed serif letters spelling SEOUL, with each letter revealing a scene: Gyeongbokgung Palace with women in hanbok, Dongdaemun Design Plaza, Namdaemun Market, an Insa-dong hanji paper artisan, and N Seoul Tower. At the bottom, blend traditional palace gates, hanok shops, a vintage kiosk, modern skyscrapers, N Seoul Tower, and a white-gray light rail tram. Include a stylish retro-dressed couple walking arm-in-arm alongside people in hanbok on a stone-paved street. Add the Hangul sign \"서촌 공방\" on a hanok storefront and place the coordinates 37.5665° N, 126.9780° E centered at the bottom. Use a warm muted color palette, elegant vintage typography, detailed travel-poster illustration, soft textures, and a timeless 1950s retro aesthetic.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vintage editorial-style travel poster on aged cream parchment. A gold serif country title sits at the top with a national emblem beneath it and a short tagline, framed by golden ginkgo leaves and pink-white hibiscus blossoms. In the centre, large gold-trimmed serif letters spell SEOUL — and each letter is cut open as a window revealing a different scene inside it: a palace courtyard with women in traditional dress, a curved modern design plaza, a covered market at night, a paper artisan at work, and a lit tower on a hill. Along the bottom, traditional palace gates, hanok shopfronts, a vintage kiosk, modern towers and a white-grey light rail tram blend into one street, where a retro-dressed couple walks arm in arm past people in traditional dress on stone paving. Coordinates are centred at the very bottom. Warm muted palette, elegant vintage typography, detailed travel-poster illustration, timeless 1950s retro aesthetic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★핵심 장치 — **도시명의 글자 하나하나가 창이 되어 각기 다른 장면을 담는다.**\n> *\"large gold-trimmed serif letters spelling SEOUL, **with each letter revealing a scene**\"*\n\n글자 안에 이미지를 넣는 건 흔하지만, **글자마다 다른 장면**을 배정하면 도시의 다면성이 한 단어에 들어간다. S-E-O-U-L 다섯 글자에 궁궐·디자인플라자·시장·공방·타워를 각각.\n\n★그리고 **하단은 시대를 섞는다** — 전통 궁궐문 · 한옥 상점 · 빈티지 키오스크 · **현대 고층빌딩** · 경전철이 한 거리에 공존하고, 레트로 차림의 커플과 한복 입은 사람들이 함께 걷는다. 태그라인이 그걸 요약한다: *\"tradition meets tomorrow.\"*\n\n- 액자 요소로 지역성을 만든다: **은행잎**과 **무궁화**가 상단 타이틀을 감싼다.\n- ★**좌표를 하단 중앙에** 넣는 게 여행 포스터의 디테일([[missdelulu9-collage-panel-editorial-magazine-cover]]의 좌표·바코드와 같은 장치) — 비용 없이 \"실제 인쇄물\" 인상을 만든다.\n- 한글 간판을 넣으라는 지시도 있다(`서촌 공방`). Krea2에서 한글은 깨지지만 **간판이 있다는 사실**은 재현된다.",
