      "prompt": "I usually do these prompts with GPT but here is one for international fast foods with Reve 2.1. \n\nPrompt: \n16:9, 2x2 grid,  do this for 4 lesser known hidden gem international fast foods:: select typography, hero_product, miniature_action from commercial_dioramas where theme = '[culture_vibe]'; /* visual render logic */ -- typography: giant, physical 3d text spelling \"[slogan]\" forming a backdrop cliff/mountain. -- hero_product: a colossal open bag of [product]. the spilled food forms the ground terrain. -- miniature_action: tiny scale models actively ai_infer(harvesting, carrying, or chopping the spilled food using era-appropriate tools). -- details: ai_infer(cultural flags, tiny vehicles, and foliage matching [culture_vibe]). -- lighting: bright, appetizing commercial food photography.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 16:9 2x2 grid of commercial food dioramas. In each panel, giant physical 3D lettering spelling a slogan rises at the back like a cliff or mountain range, and a colossal open bag of a regional snack tips forward so the spilled food becomes the ground terrain itself. Tiny scale-model figures work across that terrain — harvesting, carrying and chopping the spilled food with era-appropriate tools — while small cultural flags, miniature vehicles and matching foliage fill the middle ground. Bright, appetising commercial food photography lighting, hyper-detailed miniature textures.",
      "prompt_ko": "★[[gdgtify-sql-select-city-model-field-guide]]와 같은 **SQL 조회 문법**을 음식 디오라마에 적용한 판:\n```sql\nselect typography, hero_product, miniature_action\nfrom   commercial_dioramas\nwhere  theme = '[culture_vibe]';\n\n/* visual render logic */\n-- typography:       거대한 물리적 3D 글자가 슬로건을 이루며 **배경 절벽/산**을 형성\n-- hero_product:     거대한 개봉된 [제품] 봉지. ★**쏟아진 음식이 지면 지형이 된다**\n-- miniature_action: 작은 축소 모형들이 ai_infer(시대에 맞는 도구로 수확·운반·손질)\n-- details:          ai_infer([culture_vibe]에 맞는 문화 깃발·작은 차량·초목)\n```\n\n★두 개의 스케일 전환이 겹쳐 있다:\n1. **타이포 → 지형** — 글자가 배경 절벽이 된다\n2. **제품 → 지면** — 쏟아진 음식이 사람들이 딛는 땅이 된다\n\n라이브러리의 [[gdgtify-product-material-to-world-physics]](제품 물성→지형)의 후속인데, 여기서는 **타이포까지 지형화**한다.\n- `miniature_action`에 **\"시대에 맞는 도구\"**(era-appropriate tools) 조건을 붙인 게 디테일.\n- 작성자 메모: *\"보통 GPT로 하는데 이건 Reve 2.1로 해봤다\"* — 같은 프롬프트를 다른 모델에 돌린 실험.",
