      "prompt": "ChatGPT AI images \n\nPrompt:\n\nWhimsical watercolor storybook illustration of [HUMAN] and [ANIMAL] captured in a heartfelt [POSE]. Style the human in [CLOTHING] with a gentle, desaturated [PALETTE] palette. Design the characters with elegant elongated forms, simple rounded faces, tiny expressive dot eyes, and a soft childlike charm. Add delicate sepia sketch strokes, layered transparent watercolor washes, natural pigment variations, rough handmade paper texture, and softly bleeding edges. Create a minimalist airy composition with a warm emotional tone, subtle shadows, and minimal background elements for a timeless illustrated fairytale feeling.",
      "gen_prompt": "A whimsical watercolour storybook illustration of a young woman and a large dog captured in a heartfelt embrace, she kneeling with arms around its neck. She wears a soft oversized knit in a gentle desaturated sage palette. Both are drawn with elegantly elongated forms, simple rounded faces, tiny expressive dot eyes and a soft childlike charm. Delicate sepia sketch strokes underlie layered transparent watercolour washes with natural pigment variation, rough handmade paper texture and softly bleeding edges. Minimalist airy composition, warm emotional tone, subtle shadows, almost no background — a timeless illustrated fairytale feeling.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**캐릭터 조형을 네 가지로 규정**한 게 이 템플릿의 핵심이다:\n- **우아하게 길쭉한 형태**(elegantly elongated forms)\n- **단순한 둥근 얼굴**(simple rounded faces)\n- ★**작고 표현적인 점 눈**(tiny expressive dot eyes)\n- **부드러운 어린이다운 매력**(soft childlike charm)\n\n→ 특히 **점 눈**이 결정적이다. 눈을 그리지 않고 점으로 두면 표정이 자세와 실루엣으로 넘어가고, 그게 동화책 일러스트의 정서를 만든다.\n\n★수채의 물성도 다섯 겹으로 지정한다:\n**세피아 스케치 선** → **층진 반투명 워시** → **자연스러운 안료 편차** → **거친 수제 종이 질감** → **부드럽게 번지는 가장자리**\n\n- 치환 슬롯 4개: `[HUMAN]` `[ANIMAL]` `[POSE]` `[CLOTHING]` `[PALETTE]`. 포즈를 `heartfelt`(마음이 담긴)로 조건 지은 게 요령 — 그냥 나란히 서면 정서가 안 생긴다.\n- 구성은 **미니멀·에어리**로, 배경 요소를 최소화해 두 캐릭터의 관계만 남긴다.",
