      "prompt": "🇬🇷 Greece, but make it a vintage journal.\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a vintage travel journal–style watercolor and ink collage poster of [DESTINATION NAME] on textured off-white paper. Use soft watercolor washes, detailed hand-drawn ink sketches, handwritten-style captions, travel stamps, postcards, decorative patterns, and scrapbook elements. Include iconic landmarks such as [FAMOUS LANDMARKS], local culture, traditional architecture, landscapes, food specialties like [LOCAL FOODS], transportation, nature elements, and memorable travel experiences. Arrange everything in a dense artistic grid layout with warm colors, elegant typography, vintage journal details, and an authentic handmade travel poster aesthetic.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vintage travel journal-style watercolour and ink collage poster of a Mediterranean country on textured off-white paper. Soft watercolour washes sit under detailed hand-drawn ink sketches, with handwritten-style captions, travel stamps, postcards, decorative patterns and scrapbook elements filling the sheet. Iconic landmarks, traditional architecture, landscapes, local food specialities, transport, nature elements and small travel scenes are arranged in a dense artistic grid layout — compartmented but hand-placed, never scattered. Warm colours, elegant typography, authentic handmade travel poster aesthetic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★같은 작성자의 여행 저널 계열 세 번째인데 **배열 방식이 다르다**:\n| 항목 | 배열 |\n|---|---|\n| [[noorwithwifi-vintage-scrapbook-travel-journal]] | 중앙 태블릿 + 주변 콜라주 |\n| [[noorwithwifi-ink-sketch-travel-journal-scrapbook]] | 흰 종이에 균형 있게 흩뿌림 |\n| **이 항목** | ★**조밀한 예술적 그리드**(dense artistic grid layout) |\n\n→ **그리드로 묶으면 정보 밀도가 올라간다.** 흩뿌리면 스케치북이고, 격자로 나누면 **도감이나 편집 지면**처럼 읽힌다. 같은 재료로 다른 인상을 만드는 방법.\n\n- 채울 요소는 동일 계열: 랜드마크 · 전통 건축 · 풍경 · **현지 음식** · 교통 · 자연 · 여행 경험.\n- 재질: 질감 있는 오프화이트 종이 + 수채 워시 + 잉크 스케치 + **여행 스탬프** + 엽서 + 장식 패턴.\n- 치환 슬롯 3개: `[DESTINATION]` `[FAMOUS LANDMARKS]` `[LOCAL FOODS]`.",
