      "title": "거대한 국기가 랜드마크를 나선으로 감싸되 \"건축의 상징성은 보존되게\" — 항공 드론 시점 애국 장면",
      "prompt": "حين يحتضن العلم الوطن 🇸🇦\n\nالبرومبت ⤵️\n\nCreate a breathtaking ultra-realistic patriotic scene featuring [LANDMARK] dramatically wrapped by a gigantic flowing Saudi Arabian flag, with the fabric naturally spiraling around the structure while preserving its iconic architecture. The flag appears elegant and majestic, waving realistically in the wind with highly detailed cloth textures, cinematic golden-hour lighting, aerial drone perspective, expansive city skyline, atmospheric depth, volumetric sunlight, realistic reflections, HDR, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8K, epic national pride, luxury architectural photography, no people, no text, no watermark. Replace [LANDMARK] with any famous landmark or building",
      "gen_prompt": "A breathtaking ultra-realistic patriotic scene: a landmark tower is dramatically wrapped by a gigantic flowing national flag, the fabric spiralling naturally around the structure while the building's iconic architecture stays clearly readable beneath it. The flag looks elegant and majestic, waving realistically in the wind with highly detailed cloth texture, its folds catching cinematic golden-hour light. Shot from an aerial drone perspective with an expansive city skyline behind, atmospheric depth, volumetric sunlight and realistic reflections. No people, no text.",
