      "title": "장노출 모션블러 파인아트 — 색을 극단으로 포화시키고 움직임을 흐름으로 남겨 \"회화적 사실주의\"로",
      "prompt": "Prompt 1:\nMasterpiece, dynamic figure sprinting through saturated cobalt-blue space, oversized silver jacket catching dramatic light, vivid red trousers creating a trail of motion, extreme long-exposure blur, cinematic energy, dreamlike speed, painterly movement, emotional urgency, contemporary fashion photography, soft atmospheric glow, distorted motion trails, elegant abstraction, futuristic editorial aesthetic, rich color contrast, visual impact, floating shadows, museum-quality composition, ultra realistic, cinematic color grading, award-winning image.\n\nPrompt 2:\nMasterpiece, surreal red flower standing alone against a dark void, petals illuminated by intense crimson glow, soft horizontal motion blur creating an aura of movement, dreamlike botanical abstraction, cinematic darkness, dramatic contrast between red and black, velvety textures, atmospheric depth, visual poetry, minimal composition, emotional isolation, fine art botanical photography, subtle analog distortion, glowing bloom effect, painterly realism, mysterious elegance, ultra realistic, cinematic color grading, award-winning image.\n\nPrompt 3:\nMasterpiece, roaring snow leopard emerging from deep blue darkness, red and white fur illuminated by cinematic light, powerful motion blur stretching across the face and mane, mouth open in a dramatic roar, dreamlike wildlife surrealism, intense emotional energy, painterly realism, atmospheric depth, visual tension, luxury fine art animal photography, soft focus around the edges, luminous highlights, dramatic red-blue contrast, contemporary editorial aesthetic, museum-quality wildlife portrait, ultra realistic, cinematic color grading, award-winning image.\n\nPrompt 4:\nMasterpiece, mysterious human silhouette standing in deep blue darkness, oversized sculptural garment covered with glowing crimson blossoms, soft motion blur dissolving the figure into the background, dreamlike cinematic atmosphere, radiant red light emerging from within the fabric, painterly textures, emotional solitude, contemporary surreal fashion photography, dramatic color contrast, luminous particles floating in the air, atmospheric haze, visual poetry, elegant abstraction, museum-quality conceptual art, soft focus, glowing bloom effect, cinematic depth, ultra realistic, award-winning image.",
      "gen_prompt": "A dynamic figure sprinting through saturated cobalt-blue space, an oversized silver jacket catching dramatic light while vivid red trousers leave a trail of motion behind. Extreme long-exposure blur stretches the body into painterly movement, distorted motion trails floating like shadows through the frame. Cinematic energy and dreamlike speed, soft atmospheric glow, rich colour contrast, elegant abstraction, museum-quality composition, ultra realistic with cinematic colour grading.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**색과 움직임만으로 구성된** 파인아트 계열이다. 형태를 정확히 그리지 않고 **장노출 블러가 몸을 회화적 움직임으로 늘인다**(stretches the body into painterly movement).\n\n★작성자가 제시한 변주 3종이 이 스타일의 적용 범위를 보여준다:\n| 주제 | 색 구성 | 움직임 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 질주하는 인물 | 코발트블루 공간 + 실버 재킷 + **선명한 빨강 바지** | 수직 궤적 |\n| 어둠 속 붉은 꽃 | 크림슨 글로우 vs 블랙 보이드 | **수평 모션블러**의 아우라 |\n| 포효하는 설표 | 딥블루 어둠 + 붉고 흰 털 | 얼굴과 갈기를 가로지르는 블러 |\n\n→ 셋 다 **강한 단색 배경 + 대비되는 피사체 색 + 방향성 블러**라는 같은 공식이다.\n\n- 톤 어휘가 반복된다: `dreamlike` · `painterly` · `emotional` · `elegant abstraction` · `museum-quality`. 사진이 아니라 **회화로 읽히길** 요구하는 단어들.\n- 라이브러리의 모션 계열([[goodmanprotocol-still-subject-ghosting-crowd]] 등)과 반대다 — 저쪽은 **주체를 선명하게 남기고**, 이쪽은 **주체까지 흘려** 추상으로 간다.",
