      "prompt": "Nano banana pro promotional and Cinematic Prompt 🌼 ⤵️\n\nA crystal glass [FLOWER] sculpture with [PETALS], slight three-quarter angle view, asymmetric organic pose, delicate glass stamens in the center, chrome-silver reflective surface with translucent white swirls, long slim transparent stem slightly bent, gradient gray background, studio product photography, photorealistic render, high-end decorative art\n\nModel: Nano banana pro \n\n #NanoBananaPro",
