      "title": "★★\"여행 광고를 만들지 마라 — 그 설계 원리만 가져와 이 브랜드의 세계로 완전히 재해석하라\"",
      "prompt": "Prompt in 2 comments : \n\nAct as an award-winning FMCG creative director, senior advertising art director, food photographer, food stylist, graphic designer, 3D compositing artist and brand identity designer.\nCreate a premium MAGGI 2-Minute Noodles social campaign inspired by sophisticated modular editorial advertising systems.\nThe campaign must feel:\niconic bold youthful warm playful appetite-driven minimal contemporary globally polished\nTake the SYSTEMATIC DESIGN PRINCIPLES of premium editorial travel campaigns — recurring graphic paths, bold typography, dimensional compositing, negative space and modular storytelling — and reinterpret them completely through the visual world of MAGGI.\nDo NOT create travel advertising.\nCreate an unmistakable MAGGI campaign.\n────────────────────────\nFORMAT\n4:5 vertical 1080 × 1350 premium Instagram campaign artwork\nOne poster. One idea. One hero moment.\n────────────────────────\nCAMPAIGN IDEA\nMAGGI turns ordinary little moments into something worth stopping for.\nEvery campaign poster captures a different MAGGI moment:\nlate-night hunger hostel cravings rainy afternoons after-college hunger gaming nights office breaks Sunday laziness friends hanging out quick comfort meals\nEach execution changes the story while maintaining one recognizable MAGGI visual system.\n\nHEADLINE\n“[INSERT SHORT HEADLINE]”\nHeadline should be clever, conversational and instantly readable.\nMaximum 2–6 words.\nExamples of tone:\n“2 MINUTES. SORTED.” “CRAVING? FIXED.” “RAIN. MAGGI. REPEAT.” “THE BREAK WE NEEDED.” “LATE NIGHT HERO.” “JUST ADD MAGGI.”\nDo not use all examples simultaneously.\nChoose ONE headline.\n\nBRAND COLOUR SYSTEM\nBuild the campaign around:\nMAGGI signature yellow MAGGI red warm noodle golden-yellow clean off-white small accents of natural food colours\nYellow should dominate.\nRed functions as the high-impact graphic accent.\nMaintain extremely controlled colour consistency throughout.\nAvoid rainbow palettes.\n\nSIGNATURE MAGGI PATH\nOne long, glossy, perfectly cooked noodle moves through the artwork as the campaign’s recurring visual signature.\nThe noodle strand may:\ncurl behind the headline loop around the MAGGI packet pass behind the bowl emerge from a fork travel across negative space wrap around photographic objects disappear behind the subject reappear in the foreground guide the eye toward the CTA\nMake the noodle strand dimensional and photographic.\nGolden-yellow cooked noodle texture. Slight masala coating. Natural sheen. Tiny seasoning particles. Soft highlights.\nThe noodle should interact with the scene through realistic foreground/background occlusion.\nIt must feel clever and art-directed rather than randomly curved.\n\nCOMPOSITION\nUse a disciplined Swiss-inspired editorial grid.\nTOP:\nOversized bold headline.\nSmall supporting copy positioned close to it.\nMIDDLE:\nOne dominant MAGGI food/lifestyle visual occupying approximately 55–70% of visual attention.\nBOTTOM:\nSmall branding / product information.\nUse asymmetric balance.\nAllow food, people, packet, bowl and noodle strand to deliberately break the grid.\nCreate a clear visual journey:\nHEADLINE ↓ HERO MOMENT ↓ NOODLE PATH ↓ PRODUCT\nGenerous negative space.\nNo clutter.\n\nHERO VISUAL\nCreate ONE memorable MAGGI visual metaphor.\nFor this execution:\nA steaming bowl of freshly prepared MAGGI noodles becomes the centre of the composition.\nThe bowl is photographed at premium commercial-food-advertising quality.\nPerfect golden noodles piled naturally inside.\nVisible carrot pieces, peas, herbs and masala seasoning.\nA fork lifts a generous bundle of noodles.\nOne noodle escapes from the lifted bundle and transforms into the signature continuous noodle path travelling through the composition.\nPlace an authentic-looking MAGGI 2-Minute Noodles packet nearby, integrated naturally rather than floating randomly.\nThe food should be intensely appetising.\n\n────────── ※트윗 본문 ──────────\nFrom a simple maggi packet poster to high end premium poster.\n\nMade with GPT Image 2 \n\nTry it with prompt in comment section : ⏬ https://t.co/BOdwtT96zm",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium vertical social campaign poster for an instant noodle brand, built on a disciplined Swiss-inspired editorial grid. At the top, an oversized bold headline with small supporting copy set close beneath it. In the middle, the hero moment: a steaming bowl of freshly cooked golden noodles photographed at commercial food-advertising quality, carrot pieces, peas, herbs and seasoning visible, a fork lifting a generous bundle. ★From that lifted bundle a single glossy noodle strand escapes and becomes a continuous path travelling through the whole artwork — it curls behind the headline, loops around the packet, passes behind the bowl and crosses the empty space toward the bottom, interacting with every element through realistic foreground and background occlusion so it reads as art-directed rather than randomly curved. Golden-yellow cooked noodle texture with a light seasoning coat, natural sheen, tiny particles and soft highlights. A product packet sits nearby, integrated naturally rather than floating. Small branding information closes the bottom. Signature yellow dominates with red as the high-impact graphic accent on clean off-white; asymmetric balance, generous negative space, food and packet deliberately breaking the grid. Iconic, bold, youthful, warm, appetite-driven.",
      "prompt_ko": "★이 프롬프트의 설계 방식이 특이하다 — **다른 장르의 설계 원리를 빌려오되 그 장르가 되지는 말라**고 한다:\n> *\"프리미엄 에디토리얼 **여행 캠페인의 체계적 설계 원리** — 반복되는 그래픽 경로, 굵은 타이포, 입체적 합성, 여백, 모듈식 스토리텔링 — 을 가져와 이 브랜드의 시각 세계로 **완전히 재해석하라**.\"*\n> **\"여행 광고를 만들지 마라. 명백히 이 브랜드의 캠페인을 만들어라.\"**\n\n★그리고 그 \"반복되는 그래픽 경로\"를 브랜드 고유의 것으로 번역한 게 핵심이다 — **시그니처 면발 패스**:\n```\n한 가닥의 윤기 있는 면이 작품을 관통하는 캠페인의 반복 시그니처가 된다.\n  · 헤드라인 뒤로 감기고   · 패킷을 휘감고    · 그릇 뒤를 지나고\n  · 포크에서 빠져나오고    · 여백을 가로지르고 · 사물을 감싸고\n  · 피사체 뒤로 사라졌다   · 전경에 다시 나타나 · 시선을 CTA로 이끈다\n→ ★전경/배경 **오클루전을 실제처럼** 처리해야 하고,\n  \"영리하고 아트디렉션된\" 느낌이어야지 **아무렇게나 휘어진 곡선이면 안 된다**\n```\n\n★캠페인 아이디어를 한 문장으로 못 박은 것도 배울 점이다:\n> *\"이 브랜드는 평범한 작은 순간들을 **멈춰 설 만한 것**으로 바꾼다.\"*\n그리고 그 순간 목록을 나열한다 — 늦은 밤 허기 / 기숙사 야식 / 비 오는 오후 / 하교 후 / 게임하는 밤 / 사무실 휴식 / 나른한 일요일. **하나의 시각 시스템을 유지한 채 이야기만 갈아끼운다.**\n\n- 헤드라인도 조건부다: **2~6단어**, 영리하고 대화체로. 예시를 여럿 주되 *\"예시를 전부 동시에 쓰지 마라. **하나만 골라라.**\"*\n- 시선 흐름을 화살표로 지정: `HEADLINE ↓ HERO MOMENT ↓ NOODLE PATH ↓ PRODUCT`\n- 색은 지배색 1 + 강조색 1로 고정하고 *\"무지개 팔레트를 피하라.\"*\n※ 원문은 특정 실브랜드 지정인데 `gen_prompt`에서는 일반화했다.",
