      "title": "★JSON 발주서로 \"구조는 A에서, 정체성은 B에서\" — 4x4 표정 그리드의 포즈를 그대로 두고 인물만 교체",
      "prompt": "{\n \"generation_request\": {\n \"meta_data\": {\n \"task_type\": \"bw_male_expression_grid_identity_swap\",\n \"language\": \"en\",\n \"priority\": \"highest\",\n \"version\": \"v1.0_BW_MALE_GRID_KEEP_POSES_SWAP_IDENTITY\"\n },\n \"input\": {\n \"mode\": \"image_to_image\",\n \"reference_image_usage\": \"very_high\",\n \"preserve_identity\": true,\n \"preserve_facial_features\": true,\n \"preserve_hairstyle\": true,\n \"notes\": \"PRIMARY STRUCTURE ANCHOR: use the uploaded male 4x4 grid image (suit photobooth). Keep the exact 4x4 layout, crop, spacing, poses, gestures, hand placements, and framing in every panel. PRIMARY IDENTITY ANCHOR: use the uploaded reference photo of the target adult man. Replace the man in ALL panels with the reference identity while preserving the original pose and expression intensity. Keep suit-and-tie styling and clean studio background. Maintain consistent identity across all 16 panels.\"\n },\n \"output\": {\n \"aspect_ratio\": \"1:1\",\n \"resolution\": \"ultra_high\",\n \"num_images\": 1,\n \"layout\": {\n \"type\": \"grid\",\n \"rows\": 4,\n \"cols\": 4,\n \"gutter\": \"thin\",\n \"panel_consistency\": \"very_high\"\n },\n \"sharpness\": \"crisp_studio\",\n \"grain\": \"subtle_analog_bw\"\n },\n \"scene\": {\n \"environment\": \"clean white studio backdrop\",\n \"lighting\": {\n \"style\": \"high-key studio\",\n \"key_light\": \"front softbox\",\n \"fill\": \"balanced fill\",\n \"avoid\": \"dramatic cinematic shadows\"\n },\n \"camera\": {\n \"lens\": \"50mm\",\n \"framing\": \"mid chest to head (varies per panel but keep same as structure image)\",\n \"focus\": \"eyes sharp\"\n }\n },\n \"subject\": {\n \"type\": \"adult man\",\n \"wardrobe\": \"black suit, white shirt, black tie (match structure image), no logos\",\n \"grooming\": \"match reference hairstyle as closely as possible while keeping overall look consistent\",\n \"anatomy_rules\": \"realistic hands, correct fingers, no distortions\"\n },\n \"style\": {\n \"color\": \"pure black and white\",\n \"contrast\": \"medium_high\",\n \"background\": \"keep identical to structure image\",\n \"finish\": \"clean studio print look\"\n },\n \"quality_control\": {\n \"identity_lock\": \"strict\",\n \"hands_priority\": \"very_high\",\n \"avoid\": [\n \"extra fingers\",\n \"missing fingers\",\n \"deformed hands\",\n \"warped face\",\n \"uneven eyes\",\n \"melted mouth\",\n \"identity drift across panels\",\n \"text\",\n \"watermark\",\n \"logo\"\n ]\n },\n \"negative_prompt\": [\n \"color\",\n \"sepia\",\n \"cinematic lighting\",\n \"blur\",\n \"low resolution\",\n \"distorted anatomy\",\n \"plastic skin\",\n \"face mismatch\"\n ]\n }\n}",
      "gen_prompt": "A photobooth contact sheet of exactly sixteen black-and-white studio portraits of the same adult man, arranged in a complete four-by-four grid — four rows of four, every one of the sixteen cells filled with a portrait, no empty cell anywhere. Thin even gutters separate the panels and the outer margin is uniform. Each frame shows the same man against a clean white backdrop in a black suit, white shirt and black tie, cropped from mid-chest to head with identical framing and scale. Across the sixteen he runs through different expressions and gestures — laughing, deadpan, hand to chin, adjusting his tie, arms folded, glancing away, eyebrows raised, mid-speech, surprised, thoughtful — while his identity, facial features and hairstyle stay strictly consistent in every panel. High-key studio lighting from a front softbox with balanced fill and no dramatic shadows, 50mm lens, eyes sharp throughout. Pure black and white, medium-high contrast, subtle analog grain, crisp studio print finish, realistic hands with correct fingers.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**JSON 발주서**로 쓴 프롬프트인데, 핵심은 두 개의 앵커를 분리한 것이다:\n```json\n\"PRIMARY STRUCTURE ANCHOR\": 업로드한 4x4 그리드 이미지\n   → 정확한 4x4 레이아웃·크롭·간격·포즈·제스처·손 위치·프레이밍을 **모든 패널에서 유지**\n\"PRIMARY IDENTITY ANCHOR\": 업로드한 대상 인물의 참조 사진\n   → 모든 패널의 인물을 이 정체성으로 **교체**하되\n     원래의 **포즈와 표정 강도는 보존**\n```\n\n→ **\"구조는 A에서, 정체성은 B에서\"**를 명시적으로 분리했다. 라이브러리의 [[maddoxdigital-two-reference-role-split-instax]]와 같은 발상인데, 이쪽은 JSON 키로 역할을 못 박아 더 명확하다.\n\n★JSON 구조가 촬영 발주서 그대로다:\n```\nmeta_data  : task_type · version (버전명에 규칙을 요약 — KEEP_POSES_SWAP_IDENTITY)\ninput      : mode · reference_image_usage: \"very_high\" · preserve_* 플래그들\noutput     : aspect_ratio · layout(rows/cols/gutter/panel_consistency) · grain\nscene      : environment · lighting(key/fill/★avoid) · camera(lens/framing/focus)\nsubject    : wardrobe · grooming · ★anatomy_rules\nquality_control : identity_lock: \"strict\"\n```\n\n- **`version`에 규칙을 요약**한 게 실무적이다 — `v1.0_BW_MALE_GRID_KEEP_POSES_SWAP_IDENTITY`. 파일명만 봐도 무엇을 하는 프롬프트인지 안다.\n- `lighting.avoid: \"dramatic cinematic shadows\"` — **금지를 해당 키 안에** 넣어 맥락을 좁혔다.\n- 이 계정·이 계열의 JSON형은 [[gdgtify-single-panel-meme-cartoon-json]]과 함께 **구조화 발주**의 사례로 볼 만하다.\n\n---\n★**재현 노트 — Krea2는 4×4 격자를 못 채운다**(2026-07-26 실측). 두 번 시도했는데 1차는 16칸 중 15칸, 2차는 4×3(12칸)이 나왔다. \"exactly sixteen / four rows of four / every cell filled / no empty cell\"까지 명시해도 마찬가지였다.\n→ **2×2는 정확히 재현되지만**(이 라이브러리의 2x2 항목들 참조) **4×4부터는 셀 수가 어긋난다.** 격자 수가 중요한 작업이면 2×2로 나눠 여러 번 뽑아 합치는 편이 확실하다.\n카드 이미지는 12칸 판이며, **아이덴티티 일관성·흑백 톤·정장 스타일링·표정 다양성은 전부 재현**됐다.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/maddoxdigital-json-identity-swap-grid.webp",
      "seed": 834513861
