      "prompt": "🇹🇷 Turkey | 🇯🇵 Japan\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a cinematic travel poster of [LOCATION] at sunrise with a pastel sky gradient (blue, pink, purple, and orange). Fill the sky with numerous hot air balloons at varying distances, featuring one large foreground balloon and several smaller colorful balloons for depth. Showcase the destination's iconic landscape with natural haze and warm golden-hour lighting. Add elegant, center-aligned serif typography with the country name in large spaced capitals and the destination name below in smaller serif capitals separated by dashes. Use a minimalist, premium travel magazine aesthetic with balanced composition, soft atmospheric depth, and high-resolution realism.",
