      "prompt": "I asked GPT to give 4 interesting stats about a couple of cities around the world. This prompt does the research and visualization. \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, AI inferred topics: VARIABLES ::= Nu = numeral dominance     (the giant figure hits first) Rf = reference-axis fidelity (the marker sits at its true position) Vo = volume fidelity       (sculpture mass tracks the value) Ax = constant-axis legibility (the shared 0-max scale is readable) Ty = typographic hierarchy Ob = unit recognizability  (the repeated object is obvious) An = human-anchor legibility Sc = series consistency Th = thumbnail survival Sr = source-line presence Iso = isometric coherence Mo = monochrome discipline Fa = factual restraint Po = premium render polish  MAXIMIZE ::= J = 0.14Nu + 0.13Rf + 0.11Vo + 0.10Ax + 0.09Ty + 0.07Ob + 0.06An + 0.06Sc + 0.06Th + 0.05Sr + 0.03Iso + 0.02Mo + 0.07Fa + 0.01Po  CONSTRAINTS ::= Nu >= 0.92   // the numeral is the hook Rf >= 0.92   // marker position is the honesty test Vo >= 0.88   // mass tracks the value Ax >= 0.90   // the constant axis must be readable Ty >= 0.90   // strict hierarchy Ob >= 0.88 An >= 0.88   // the human sets scale Sc >= 0.90   // identical axis across the set Th >= 0.90 Sr >= 0.90   // every panel cites Iso >= 0.86 Mo >= 0.86 Fa >= 0.94   // no invented or unit-shifted figures Po >= 0.88  ENCODING ::=   giant numeral      -> the supplied value, exactly as sourced   axis marker height -> that value's position on the constant total   sculpture mass     -> the same value (must agree with the marker)   repeated object    -> the activity or category, not a count   human figure       -> scale reference only, carries no value  COMPOSITION ::=   badge zone    :: letter badge + category title, top-left   numeral zone  :: giant figure + unit, upper-left quadrant   body zone     :: one-sentence plain-language restatement   sculpture zone :: isometric mass, right of center   axis zone     :: constant reference strip, far right, 0 to max   source zone   :: source line, bottom-left, small  PALETTE ::=   warm grey and bone monochrome, single value range   no hue accents; separation comes from value and shadow only  MATERIAL ::=   matte clay or unpainted resin model, soft directional studio light   isometric camera, no perspective convergence, consistent shadow angle  TYPOGRAPHY ::=   numeral  :: heavy grotesque, 25-35% of frame height   unit     :: same family, one third the numeral size   title    :: caps, letterspaced, small   body     :: light weight, 3-4 lines maximum   source   :: smallest, muted   hierarchy :: numeral > title > sculpture > body > axis > source  SERIES ::=   the reference axis is IDENTICAL across every panel: same total, same ticks, same position   same layout grid, same badge system (A, B, C, D), same numeral placement   one panel = one statistic; never two numbers competing  THUMBNAIL_TEST ::=   at 400px the numeral, its unit, and the axis marker must all read  UNIT_CHAIN ::=   the numeral's unit MUST match the axis unit; if it does not, convert and show the chain   print any conversion assumption in the body line (e.g. \"at 3 hrs/day\")   never plot a converted figure against an axis measuring a different quantity  REQUIRED ::=   a constant reference axis with stated total, a value marker on that axis,   a human scale figure, a source line, a one-sentence restatement  FORBIDDEN ::=   unverified source data, made up data, hallucinations, inaccurate data   a numeral whose unit differs from the axis unit, an unstated conversion assumption, a marker position contradicting the numeral   sculpture mass contradicting the marker, an axis that changes between panels, a missing source line   color accents breaking the monochrome, perspective breaking the isometric, two competing numbers in one panel",
      "gen_prompt": "Isometric matte clay sculpture data visualization on a bone-white studio field. A giant heavy grotesque numeral dominates the upper-left quadrant with a small unit label. Right of center, an unpainted resin isometric mass whose volume tracks that value. Far right, a thin constant reference axis strip from zero to max with a single marker at the true position. A tiny human figure for scale only. Warm grey and bone monochrome, no hue accents, separation by value and shadow only. Soft directional studio light, consistent shadow angle, isometric camera with no perspective convergence. Small-caps letterspaced title top-left, muted source line bottom-left. Premium product-render polish.",
      "prompt_ko": "통계 수치를 **조각의 질량**으로 옮기되, 옆에 세운 고정 축의 마커 위치까지 같은 값을 가리키게 해서 **두 번 검증되는 그림**을 만든다. 진짜 핵심은 제약절에 있다 — `Fa >= 0.94`(factual restraint)로 **없는 수치를 지어내거나 단위를 바꾸는 것을 금지**했다. 데이터 시각화 프롬프트가 흔히 \"그럴듯한 숫자\"를 만들어내는 실패를 정면으로 막은 것. 점토·무채색·아이소메트릭으로 못 박아 색상 대비 없이 명암만으로 구분하게 한 것도 같은 맥락(장식이 값을 왜곡하지 못하게).",
