      "title": "★유리가 플라스틱처럼 보이는 이유 — 두께·굴절·액면 셋을 동시에 지시해야 한다",
      "prompt": "🍸The key is to allow the model to simultaneously account for the glass's thickness, refraction, and the liquid surface.\n关键是同时让模型看见玻璃的厚度、折射和液面。\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate an ultra-premium print advertisement for Absolut Vodka with a perfectly symmetrical left-right split composition and a minimal narrative environment. The final artwork must present one iconic Absolut Vodka bottle as the central hero within a balanced, mirrored visual structure, supported by a restrained atmospheric environment, elegant glassware, faint vapor or mist, subtle water presence, and premium editorial typography. The image must feel clean, cold, sculptural, and internationally luxurious, with exceptional bottle-glass realism and a quiet but powerful narrative atmosphere.\n\nCreative direction:\nCombine Milk Cloud Orbit and Cream Halo Transit. Keep the exact symmetrical premium poster skeleton, but intensify the most luxurious bottle-glass details and simplify the outer narrative field. Push cleaner shoulder highlights, stronger base refraction, more refined edge glow through cold mist, and a tighter left-right environmental balance. Reduce visible text slightly so the bottle becomes even more dominant and the poster feels more contemporary, expensive, and controlled.\n\nCore composition:\nUse a wide horizontal composition with a strong left-right symmetrical or near-symmetrical structure. The Absolut bottle must be the central visual anchor or slightly center-weighted inside the symmetrical setup. The scene should feel like two mirrored environmental tensions balancing around the bottle: cold air, vapor, glass, water reflections, and elegant negative space. The overall geometry must feel disciplined, premium, and visually calm.\n\nProduct logic:\nFeature a highly realistic Absolut Vodka bottle as the hero product. The bottle must feel unmistakable, iconic, and premium, with accurate glass shape, frosted or clear premium bottle treatment, crisp branding area, subtle label detail, and luxury transparency. The bottle must dominate the frame like a sculptural object.\n\nMilk Cloud Orbit glass-detail logic:\nThis is critical. Purify the most convincing product zones: shoulder highlight bands, base refraction, vertical edge glow, bottle silhouette crispness, and the optical density of the glass body through cold atmospheric light. The bottle must feel more jewel-like, more sculptural, and more expensive without becoming overly glossy or artificial.\n\nCream Halo Transit composition logic:\nKeep the same left-right symmetry, but tighten the environmental tension and reduce non-product information. The side atmospheres should feel more controlled and more integrated into one coherent luxury structure. Text must be more restrained, spacing cleaner, and the bottle’s authority more absolute.\n\nMinimal narrative environment:\nCreate a minimal but story-rich environment around the bottle using only a few highly controlled elements: a refined glass or coupe/tumbler, soft vapor or cold mist, subtle water or condensation traces, and clean reflected surface behavior. The environment must suggest atmosphere and narrative without becoming cluttered. It should feel like a premium late-night ritual or cold distilled moment rather than a bar scene.\n\nSymmetry logic:\nThe composition must rely on left-right balance. Use mirrored shadow fields, symmetrical negative space, or paired environmental cues on both sides of the bottle to create strong visual tension and stability. The symmetry must feel intentional, elegant, and premium, not mechanical or sterile.\n\nGlass and bottle realism:\nRender the Absolut bottle with exceptional glass realism: thick base distortion, crisp bottle shoulders, smooth cylindrical transitions, subtle edge highlights, internal refraction, clean bottle transparency or frosted-glass character, and refined label readability. Supporting glassware should also feel crystal-clear, heavy, and premium.\n\nLiquid and vapor logic:\nIf liquid appears, keep it minimal and precise: a touch of clear vodka in a premium glass, subtle water sheen, or restrained splash-free condensation logic. Add fine mist, cold vapor, or dust-like atmospheric particles to enrich the scene. These effects must remain delicate and controlled, never chaotic.\n\nLighting:\nUse extremely delicate high-end product lighting. Let the bottle edges, shoulders, and base catch premium highlight bands. Use cool-white and neutral-silver lighting with soft shadow falloff, subtle reflected glow, and sculptural negative space. The light must feel icy, clean, and luxurious.\n\nTypography logic:\nUse elegant English-only premium typography. Suggested tone:\nABSOLUT VODKA\nPURITY IN BALANCE\nor\nDISTILLED INTO FORM\nUse one strong headline, one support line, and very minimal copy if needed. Typography must feel editorial, premium, and secondary to the bottle. Reduce the text presence slightly compared with a standard print ad.\n\nBrand identity:\nThe Absolut identity must feel official, minimal, and globally luxurious. Keep branding clear but restrained. Let the bottle silhouette and glass quality carry much of the brand power.\n\nColor direction:\nUse a restrained cold-luxury palette:\nice white, silver-gray, frosted glass blue, charcoal shadow, soft smoke gray, and tiny hints of transparent liquid clarity.\nThe image must feel colder, cleaner, and more contemporary than a warm whisky ad.\n\nPrint aesthetic:\nApply a premium print-ad finish with subtle tactile richness. The final image should feel like a collector-grade vodka campaign poster with immaculate clarity and refined material depth.\n\nMood:\ncold, sculptural, minimal, premium, clean, editorial, symmetrical, luxurious, contemporary, product-dominant, distilled\n\nRendering style:\nultra-realistic Absolut Vodka print advertisement, symmetrical minimal narrative environment, intensified bottle-glass realism, refined glassware, subtle vapor and water atmosphere, reduced typography, cold luxury lighting, collector-grade print finish, world-class image quality, 8k\n\nNegative prompt:\ncheap liquor ad, cluttered bar scene, noisy typography, weak bottle presence, plastic glass, colorful nightclub vibe, messy splash explosion, warm amber lighting, cartoon rendering, low resolution, excessive props, muddy reflections, generic vodka poster",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-premium print advertisement for a clear vodka bottle, perfectly symmetrical left-right composition, wide horizontal frame. The bottle is the central sculptural hero in cold atmospheric light with faint vapor. Thick glass edge highlights that declare real wall thickness, clean shoulder reflection bands, front-plane transparency, realistic liquid meniscus distortion at the fill line, lower-base refraction bending the surface behind it. Elegant empty glassware mirrored on both sides, subtle water presence, generous negative space, restrained editorial typography. Cold, clean, jewel-like, internationally luxurious.",
      "prompt_ko": "**\"realistic glass\"라고만 쓰면 유리는 반드시 반짝이는 플라스틱 껍데기가 된다**는 진단에서 출발한다. 모델이 유리를 유리로 그리게 하려면 세 가지를 **동시에** 보게 해야 한다 — ①**두께**: 가장자리 하이라이트가 \"벽이 두껍다\"를 알린다 ②**액면**: 채워진 높이의 굴절 왜곡이 \"안에 진짜 액체가 있다\"를 알린다 ③**하단 굴절**: 바닥에서 뒤를 휘게 해 병을 실제 공간에 착지시킨다. 셋 중 하나만 빠져도 무너진다는 게 작성자의 지적이고, 실제로 술·화장품·향수 광고 프롬프트에 그대로 이식할 수 있는 노하우다. 구도는 좌우 대칭 + 텍스트 최소화로 병을 지배적으로 둔다.",
