      "id": "mrlarus-underwater-editorial-object-changes-story",
      "source": "https://x.com/MrLarus/status/2081331194994757778",
      "author": "MrLarus",
      "date": "2026-07-27",
      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "패션/에디토리얼",
      "title": "★소품 하나가 시리즈를 만든다 — 수중 포트레이트를 고정하고 '손에 든 물건'만 갈아 서사를 바꾼다",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 vertical underwater fashion editorial poster.\n\nCUSTOM INPUTS:\nSubject: [adult woman / appearance / hairstyle]\nDress: [color, material, silhouette, exposed shoulders, back, waist or leg]\nHandheld object: [flower / glass slipper / mirror / transparent mask / perfume bottle / other]\nPose and expression: [body direction, hand gesture, gaze, emotion]\nMain title: [original English title]\nSmall tagline: [short original sentence]\nColor palette: [main water color + dress color + accent color]\n\nShow an adult woman floating naturally beneath the water surface. The upper part of the frame must clearly reveal realistic ripples, refraction, caustic highlights and a distorted partial reflection of the subject.\n\nShe wears an elegant sculptural dress rather than a loose shirt. The design should reveal part of her shoulders, back, arms, waistline or legs, while the skirt and ribbons drift naturally through the water. Keep the body silhouette visible instead of covering her completely with fabric.\n\nThe subject holds one visually recognizable object in her hand. The object should be large enough to read clearly, but must not block her face or body. It should interact naturally with underwater light, buoyancy and movement.\n\nHer long hair, dress, ribbons, bubbles and handheld object should follow a consistent water-current direction. Preserve believable underwater physics, natural fabric weight and subtle motion.\n\nUse cinematic blue underwater lighting with light beams entering from above or behind the subject. Add realistic skin texture, fine wet hair strands, small irregular bubbles and suspended particles. Keep the face clear, expressive and alive, without plastic skin or CGI smoothness.\n\nBuild a refined fashion-magazine composition with strong negative space and editorial hierarchy. Integrate the exact main title “[MAIN TITLE]” into the scene using oversized high-contrast serif typography. Allow selected letters to be partially hidden behind the body, dress or object.\n\nEnhance the typography with subtle underwater refraction, stretched letterforms, translucent layering, displaced reflections and caustic light textures. Add the exact small tagline “[TAGLINE]” beneath it in a restrained layout.",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a 9:16 vertical underwater fashion editorial poster. An adult woman with long dark hair floats naturally beneath the water surface. The upper part of the frame clearly reveals realistic ripples, refraction, caustic highlights and a distorted partial reflection of the subject. She wears an elegant sculptural deep-crimson silk dress rather than a loose shirt, revealing her shoulders and part of her back, while the skirt and ribbons drift naturally through the water. Keep the body silhouette visible instead of covering her completely with fabric. She holds a bundle of vivid red anthurium flowers in one hand, large enough to read clearly but never blocking her face or body, interacting naturally with underwater light, buoyancy and movement. Her long hair, dress, ribbons, bubbles and the flowers follow one consistent water-current direction, with believable underwater physics and natural fabric weight. Cinematic deep-teal underwater lighting with light beams entering from above and behind her. Realistic skin texture, fine wet hair strands, small irregular bubbles and suspended particles. The face stays clear, expressive and alive, without plastic skin or CGI smoothness. Refined fashion-magazine composition with strong negative space and editorial hierarchy. Integrate the main title DESIRE into the scene in oversized high-contrast serif typography, letting some letters hide partially behind the body, dress and flowers. Enhance the typography with underwater refraction, stretched letterforms, translucent layering, displaced reflections and caustic light texture. Beneath it, place the small tagline what the water keeps in a restrained layout. Palette: deep teal water, crimson dress, gold accent.",
      "prompt_ko": "**하나의 프롬프트를 시리즈로 만드는 법** — 시각 언어(수면 반사·부유하는 머리카락·조형적 드레스·거대 세리프 타이포)를 **고정해두고 \"손에 든 물건\" 하나만 교체**한다. 작성자의 4연작이 그 증명: 붉은 안스리움=욕망 / 유리구두=갈망 / 손거울=반영 / 투명 가면=정체성. ★**\"소품은 장식이 아니다. 물건 하나가 분위기와 이야기를 바꾼다\"** — 물건이 서사의 변수다. 기술적으로 값진 지시 3개: ①상단 프레임에 **굴절·카우스틱·일그러진 부분 반영**을 반드시 드러낼 것 ②머리카락·드레스·리본·기포·소품이 **하나의 물살 방향**을 따를 것(부유물의 일관성이 물속처럼 보이게 하는 핵심) ③**\"헐렁한 셔츠 말고 조형적 드레스\"**·**\"천으로 다 덮지 말고 실루엣이 보이게\"**처럼 AI가 흔히 무너뜨리는 지점을 미리 못 박은 것. 타이포는 물의 굴절을 **글자에도 적용**해 층에 섞는다.",
