      "prompt": "🇵🇱 Poland | 🇺🇸 United States\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a premium travel journal-style collage poster inspired by [COUNTRY/CITY] on a clean off-white or textured paper background. Place a realistic hand holding a vertical travel pass or postcard at the center, featuring a vibrant landmark or iconic street scene with local architecture, transportation, and a warm cinematic sky. Design the lower section of the pass as an authentic local transit card or travel ticket. Surround the centerpiece with elegant black-and-white hand-drawn sketches, handwritten annotations, arrows, and labels showcasing famous landmarks, cultural symbols, native wildlife, traditional costumes, folk art, local cuisine, and iconic objects from the destination. Add bold serif titles reading \"TRAVEL JOURNAL\" and \"[COUNTRY/CITY]\" at the top, with \"[COUNTRY/CITY] TYPOGRAPHY\" at the bottom. Maintain a refined editorial layout with balanced spacing, realistic textures, vintage scrapbook aesthetics, high-detail line art, and a harmonious mix of monochrome illustrations and a single colorful focal point for a premium travel poster look.",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a premium travel journal-style collage poster inspired by KRAKOW, POLAND on a clean off-white textured paper background. At the centre, a realistic hand holds a vertical travel pass, its upper half showing a vibrant illustrated view of the Main Market Square with St. Mary's Basilica, a red tram and a warm cinematic sunset sky; the lower half of the pass is designed as an authentic local transit ticket with printed zone codes, a validation strip and small serial numbers. Surround the centrepiece with elegant black-and-white hand-drawn sketches, handwritten annotations, arrows and labels showing Wawel Castle, the Cloth Hall arcade, a folk-embroidered Krakow costume, a white stork, pierogi on a plate, an amber pendant, a horse-drawn carriage and a paper cut-out wycinanki pattern. Add bold serif titles reading TRAVEL JOURNAL and KRAKOW at the top, with POLAND at the bottom. Refined editorial layout with balanced spacing, realistic paper texture, vintage scrapbook aesthetics, high-detail line art, and a harmonious mix of monochrome illustration around one single colourful focal point.",
      "prompt_ko": "여행 저널 콜라주는 이 계정에 여럿 있는데, 이 건의 차별점은 **중앙 앵커의 정체**다. 랜드마크 사진이 아니라 ★**\"실제 손이 세로형 여행 패스를 들고 있는\"** 구도를 중심에 박는다. 그리고 그 패스의 **아래 절반을 진짜 현지 교통카드/승차권처럼** 디자인하라고 지정한다 — 존 코드·개찰 스트립·일련번호 같은 지루한 요소가 오히려 \"현지에 다녀온 물건\"이라는 실감을 만든다.\n\n★두 번째 규칙은 **색의 배분**이다. 주변 스케치를 전부 흑백 손그림으로 깔고 **컬러는 중앙 하나에만** 준다. 시선이 갈 곳이 하나로 정해지고, 나머지는 밀도를 담당한다. 요소 목록도 카테고리로 나눠 지정한다 — 랜드마크 / 문화 상징 / 토착 동물 / 전통 의상 / 민속 공예 / 현지 음식 / 상징적 사물. **칸을 나눠 두면 같은 나라를 여러 번 만들어도 매번 다른 것이 뽑힌다.**\n\n제목 3층(TRAVEL JOURNAL / 도시 / 국가)도 슬롯로 고정돼 있어 목적지만 갈아 끼우면 시리즈가 된다. 같은 계정 [[noorwithwifi-vintage-scrapbook-travel-journal]] · [[noorwithwifi-dense-grid-journal-collage-poster]]와 비교하면 앵커 전략의 차이가 보인다.",
