      "title": "★슬롯 템플릿에 '치트시트'를 붙인다 — 랜드마크×쿠튀르 퀼링, 구도 4층 고정 + 슬롯별 선택지 목록",
      "prompt": "Paper, Pearls & Iconic Places✨\n\nWhat if the world's most legendary landmarks inspired high-fashion paper art?\n\nA romantic Parisian dream, a golden Dubai rise, a coastal Sydney breeze, and a majestic Giza sunset... reimagined entirely out of 3D quilling and pearls.\n\nPrompt👇🏾\n\n--- (자기 답글 1: 프롬프트 본체) ---\n\nUniversal Plug-in Prompt\n\nCreate a highly detailed 3D paper quilling and relief art composition featuring [SUBJECT / WOMAN DESCRIPTION] in [POSE / PROFILE / SIDE-PROFILE / SERENE STANCE], standing beside a miniature, intricately handcrafted paper-sculpted [ICONIC LANDMARK / ARCHITECTURAL SUBJECT]. Set the entire composition against a [BACKGROUND COLOR / ATMOSPHERE] backdrop.\n\nThe woman wears an elaborate couture-inspired [DRESS SILHOUETTE] constructed entirely from [PRIMARY PAPER MATERIAL / QUILLING STYLE], featuring [PAPER TEXTURE / FILIGREE / PLEATS / PETALS], embellished with [PEARLS / BEADS / METALLIC DETAILS] in [ACCENT COLORS]. Her accessories include [HAT / CROWN / HEADPIECE / FAN / STAFF / OTHER PROP], while her pose interacts naturally with or gestures toward [LANDMARK / ARCHITECTURAL ELEMENT].\n\nThe landmark is meticulously recreated using [CARDSTOCK / TEXTURED PAPER / QUILLING / LAYERED PAPER], with intricate [LATTICE / GEOMETRIC / STEP / STRUCTURAL DETAILS] that clearly preserve its recognizable architectural identity.\n\nFrame the central scene with an elaborate decorative structure made from [ARCH / HEART FRAME / CRESCENT / SUNBURST / GEOMETRIC FRAME], incorporating [PEARL STRANDS / QUILLING / FOLIAGE / WAVES / BOTANICAL ELEMENTS].\n\nAt the base, create a dense handcrafted botanical arrangement featuring [FLOWER TYPES] in [FLOWER COLORS], combining oversized paper flowers, quilled leaves, layered petals, and intricate relief details to create a luxurious tactile foundation.\n\nUse [LIGHTING STYLE] studio lighting to emphasize the dimensional paper layers, crisp quilled edges, delicate shadows, subtle material textures, and realistic handcrafted depth. Maintain a refined editorial art direction with a sophisticated balance of [COLOR PALETTE], negative space, and visual hierarchy.\n\nRender the entire artwork as a premium handcrafted 3D paper quilling, paper filigree, and relief sculpture, with exceptional micro-detail, tactile material realism, elegant composition, crisp edges, subtle depth-of-field, and museum-quality craftsmanship.\n\nAspect ratio: 1:1.\n\n--- (자기 답글 2: 치트 시트) ---\n\nCheat Sheet\n\n[SUBJECT / WOMAN DESCRIPTION] -> Character identity and appearance\n[POSE] -> Profile, side-profile, standing, serene, gesturing\n\n[ICONIC LANDMARK] -> Eiffel Tower, Burj Khalifa, Sydney Opera House, Pyramid of Giza\n[BACKGROUND] -> Off-white, warm cream, ivory, etc.\n\n[DRESS SILHOUETTE] -> Strapless gown, halter dress, off-shoulder gown, high-neck gown\n[PAPER MATERIAL] -> Quilling, filigree, layered petals, textured cardstock\n\n[ACCENT COLORS] -> Lavender, gold, aqua, terracotta, crimson\n[ACCESSORIES] -> Pearl hat, crown, headpiece, fan, staff\n\n[ARCHITECTURAL DETAILS] -> Lattice, sails, steps, geometric structures\n[FRAME TYPE] -> Heart, arch, crescent, sunburst\n\n[BOTANICAL ELEMENTS] -> Roses, hydrangeas, lotuses, lilies, hibiscus\n[FLOWER COLORS] -> Match the landmark and couture palette\n\n[LIGHTING STYLE] -> Soft studio, warm golden-hour, bright cool studio\n[COLOR PALETTE] -> Define the dominant visual mood\nFormat -> --ar 1:1",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a highly detailed 3D paper quilling and relief art composition featuring an elegant woman with an upswept coiled-paper chignon, shown in serene side profile, standing beside a miniature intricately handcrafted paper-sculpted Eiffel Tower. Set the entire composition against a warm cream backdrop. She wears an elaborate couture off-shoulder gown constructed entirely from quilled paper strips and filigree, featuring layered petal pleats and fine curled-paper texture, embellished with strands of pearls and soft metallic gold detailing in lavender and champagne accents. Her accessories include a wide pearl-trimmed paper hat and a folded paper fan; her hand gestures gently toward the tower. The Eiffel Tower is meticulously recreated from textured cardstock and layered paper with intricate lattice ironwork and stepped structural detail that clearly preserves its recognisable architectural identity. Frame the central scene with an elaborate decorative arch built from pearl strands, quilled scrollwork and paper foliage. At the base, build a dense handcrafted botanical arrangement of oversized paper roses and hydrangeas in lavender, blush and cream, combining quilled leaves, layered petals and intricate relief detail into a luxurious tactile foundation. Use soft studio lighting to emphasise the dimensional paper layers, crisp quilled edges, delicate shadows, subtle material texture and realistic handcrafted depth. Refined editorial art direction with a sophisticated balance of lavender, cream and gold, generous negative space and clear visual hierarchy. Render as a premium handcrafted 3D paper quilling, paper filigree and relief sculpture with exceptional micro-detail, tactile material realism, crisp edges, subtle depth of field and museum-quality craftsmanship.",
      "prompt_ko": "제이크 투척 (입구B). 같은 계정의 기보유 [[yourplugai-handcraft-papercraft-universal-template]](07-23, 주제 자유 범용판)와 재질 언어는 같지만 **이 건은 구도를 고정한 특화판**이고, 무엇보다 **치트시트가 따로 붙어 있다.**\n\n★①**구도를 4층으로 못 박았다** — 슬롯을 아무리 채워도 화면이 무너지지 않는 이유다:\n```\n중앙   인물(퀼링 드레스) + 미니어처 랜드마크가 나란히, 손짓이 랜드마크를 가리킴\n테두리 장식 프레임 (아치 / 하트 / 초승달 / 선버스트)\n하단   대형 종이꽃 + 퀼링 잎의 밀집 식물 배치 = '촉각적 기단'\n배경   단색 (오프화이트 / 웜크림 / 아이보리)\n```\n**인물과 랜드마크를 같은 평면에 세워 스케일을 뒤집는 것**이 이 시리즈의 착상이다 — 에펠탑이 사람 키만 해지면서 둘 다 '공예품'이 된다.\n\n★②**치트시트가 본체의 절반이다.** 슬롯만 주면 쓰는 사람이 뭘 넣을지 몰라 헤매는데, 이 글은 답글에 **슬롯별 선택지 목록**을 따로 붙였다 — 랜드마크 4종, 드레스 실루엣 4종, 액센트 컬러 5종, 프레임 4종, 꽃 5종, 조명 3종. 그리고 마지막 줄이 좋다: **`[FLOWER COLORS] → 랜드마크와 쿠튀르 팔레트에 맞출 것`** — 선택지가 아니라 **선택 규칙**을 준다. 우리가 템플릿을 만들 때 그대로 따라 할 방식이다.\n\n★③**랜드마크의 정체성 보존**을 한 줄로 지킨다 — `intricate lattice / geometric / step details that clearly preserve its recognizable architectural identity`. 재질을 종이로 바꾸면 형태가 뭉개지기 쉬운데, \"알아볼 수 있어야 한다\"를 명시해 막았다. [[derekwall-glass-weekend-cover-execution-spec-cn]]의 유리 건축이 같은 문제를 같은 방식으로 푼다.",
