      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\nA candid Y2K street photography portrait of a cheerful young woman with a short messy bob haircut, laughing naturally while flashing a peace sign directly toward the camera, her outstretched hand dominating the foreground with dramatic perspective distortion, playful carefree expression, hair blowing wildly in the wind, captured on a quiet Japanese residential street, nostalgic early-2000s aesthetic, handheld snapshot feel, imperfect composition, shallow depth of field with soft foreground blur, dynamic motion blur from movement, dreamy cinematic softness, warm sepia-green film tones, faded Kodak Portra 400 / Fujifilm Superia look, subtle film grain, blooming highlights, vintage point-and-shoot camera flash mixed with soft overcast daylight, authentic analog photography, low contrast, muted earthy colors, spontaneous slice-of-life moment, cozy nostalgic atmosphere, emotional documentary style, imperfect focus, natural skin texture, 35mm film, disposable camera aesthetic, 28mm wide-angle lens, f/2.8, close-up portrait, ultra-realistic, highly detailed, editorial photography.",
      "gen_prompt": "A candid Y2K street photography portrait of a cheerful young woman with a short messy bob haircut, laughing naturally while flashing a peace sign directly toward the camera, her outstretched hand dominating the foreground with dramatic perspective distortion, playful carefree expression, hair blowing wildly in the wind, captured on a quiet Japanese residential street. Nostalgic early-2000s aesthetic, handheld snapshot feel, imperfect composition, shallow depth of field with soft foreground blur, dynamic motion blur from movement, dreamy cinematic softness. Warm sepia-green film tones, faded Kodak Portra 400 and Fujifilm Superia look, subtle film grain, blooming highlights, vintage point-and-shoot camera flash mixed with soft overcast daylight, authentic analog photography, low contrast, muted earthy colours. Spontaneous slice-of-life moment, cozy nostalgic atmosphere, imperfect focus, natural skin texture, 35mm film, disposable camera aesthetic, 28mm wide-angle lens, f/2.8, close-up portrait.",
      "prompt_ko": "\"자연스러운 스냅\"을 만드는 **구조적 장치 하나**가 이 프롬프트의 전부다.\n\n★**`her outstretched hand dominating the foreground with dramatic perspective distortion`** — 피스사인을 한 손을 렌즈 가까이 밀어넣어 **원근 왜곡을 일부러 만든다.** 28mm 광각(`28mm wide-angle lens`)이라 가까운 것은 과장되고 먼 것은 작아진다. 이 왜곡이 곧 **\"친구가 즉흥적으로 찍었다\"는 증거**가 된다 — 잘 찍은 사진에는 안 생기는 현상이니까.\n\n★나머지는 전부 **결함의 목록**이다. 이 계정 방식대로 나열형인데, 고른 항목이 정확하다:\n```\nimperfect composition   구도가 어긋남      dynamic motion blur   움직임 잔상\nimperfect focus         초점이 안 맞음      blooming highlights   번지는 하이라이트\nlow contrast            낮은 대비          subtle film grain     필름 입자\n```\n★색은 **필름 두 종을 겹쳐** 지정했다 — `faded Kodak Portra 400 / Fujifilm Superia look` + `warm sepia-green film tones`. 세피아-그린이 Y2K 일본 스냅의 색이다.\n\n조명도 혼합이다 — **`vintage point-and-shoot camera flash mixed with soft overcast daylight`**. 흐린 날 + 똑딱이 플래시. 이 조합이 2000년대 초 사진의 정체다. [[simplyannisa-hongkong-street-filmic-grading-portrait]]와 함께 \"필름 톤을 용어로 지정하기\" 세트.",
