      "category": "포스터/타이포",
      "title": "★거대 활자를 '창문'으로 쓴다 — 글자 안에 환경을 담고 사람은 그 앞에 온전히, 활자가 얼굴·몸통을 가르지 못하게",
      "prompt": "🤯 AI Visual Systems Vol.17.4: Motion & Grace!\nMade with ChatGPT-Image2\n\nThis set moves from explosive motion to quiet precision, using oversized typography to carry each scene.\n\n4 directions:\n1. COURT REACH — tennis through perspective\n2. GROUND LOOP — a power move shaped by type\n3. FENCE LINE — precision along a single line\n4. LATTE FLOW — a quiet pour inside the letters\n\nThe subject stays whole, while the environment moves through the typography.\n\nPrompt in the comments 👇\n\n--- (답글: 프롬프트 전문) ---\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 editorial poster in the HUMAN FRAGMENTS visual system.\n\nTheme: [tennis / breakdance / fencing / latte art]\nSubject: [age, gender, appearance, outfit]\nAction: [specific movement or handcraft]\nScene: [location and environment]\nTitle: [custom two-word title]\nSupporting line: [one short phrase]\nYear: 2026\n\nUse oversized cropped typography as the main compositional structure. The letters should act like windows that reveal the surrounding environment, while the person remains visually complete in front of them.\n\nDo not let the typography cut through the face, torso, arms, hips, thighs, or other important body parts. The letters should mainly divide and carry the sky, architecture, court, studio, floor, light, and background details.\n\nCreate strong depth by allowing one key action element to extend beyond the letterforms:\n\n1. COURT REACH — a young Western male tennis player lunging toward the camera, with the tennis ball and racket enlarged in the foreground while the court, net, and sky appear inside the letters.\n\n2. GROUND LOOP — a young Asian male dancer performing a powerful floor move, with one sneaker sole sweeping close to the camera while the rooftop, concrete ground, and city skyline fill the typography.\n\n3. FENCE LINE — a graceful young Asian female fencer lunging forward, with the foil tip and guard extending toward the viewer while the training hall and directional light appear inside the letters.\n\n4. LATTE FLOW — an elegant young woman creating latte art, with the milk pitcher, cup, and thin milk stream forming the main action while the café interior, wooden counter, coffee machine, and warm window light continue through the typography.\n\nUse realistic photography, believable anatomy, natural skin and fabric texture, clean foreground perspective, subtle paper grain, a warm off-white background, restrained color palettes, and refined editorial spacing.\n\nKeep the text minimal and freely placed:\n[Title]\nHUMAN FRAGMENTS\n[Short supporting line]\n2026",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 editorial poster in the HUMAN FRAGMENTS visual system, theme tennis. Oversized cropped typography forms the main compositional structure — the letters act like windows revealing the surrounding environment, with the court surface, net and open sky visible inside the letterforms, while a young Western male tennis player stays visually complete in front of them, lunging toward the camera. The typography must not cut through his face, torso, arms, hips or thighs; the letters mainly divide and carry sky, architecture, court and background detail. One key action element breaks depth by extending beyond the letterforms: the tennis ball and racket enlarged in the foreground, closest to the lens. Realistic photography, believable anatomy, natural skin and fabric texture, clean foreground perspective, subtle paper grain, a warm off-white background, restrained colour palette and refined editorial spacing. Minimal freely placed text: a two-word title, the words HUMAN FRAGMENTS, one short supporting line, and the year 2026.",
      "prompt_ko": "★MrLarus의 **HUMAN FRAGMENTS 시스템 Vol.17.4**. 이 계정은 같은 비주얼 시스템에 버전 번호를 붙여 연작으로 굴린다(라이브러리에 17.1·17.3 보유).\n\n★**이번 판본의 규칙은 '활자를 창문으로 쓴다'**:\n\n```\nUse oversized cropped typography as the main compositional structure.\n★**The letters should act like windows that reveal the surrounding environment,**\n  **while the person remains visually complete in front of them.**\n\n★★Do not let the typography cut through the face, torso, arms, hips, thighs,\n  or other important body parts.\n  The letters should mainly divide and carry the sky, architecture, court,\n  studio, floor, light, and background details.\n\nCreate strong depth by allowing **one key action element to extend beyond the letterforms**\n```\n\n★★**금지 조항이 이 시스템의 핵심이다.** 거대 활자를 인물에 겹치면 보통 몸을 자르는데, *\"글자는 하늘·건축·바닥·빛만 나눠 담고, 사람은 온전히 앞에 남긴다\"*로 역할을 갈랐다. 그래서 활자가 강해도 인물이 훼손되지 않는다.\n\n★그리고 **깊이는 '한 요소만 글자 밖으로'** 만든다 — 테니스공과 라켓, 스니커즈 밑창, 펜싱 검 끝, 우유 줄기. 레이어가 셋(전경 돌출 / 활자 / 활자 안 환경)으로 분명해진다.\n\n★4방향 배리에이션도 각각 **무엇이 글자 밖으로 나오는지**로 구분된다:\n```\n1. COURT REACH — 라켓·공이 전경으로, 코트·네트·하늘은 글자 안\n2. GROUND LOOP — 스니커즈 밑창이 카메라를 쓸고, 옥상·콘크리트·스카이라인은 글자 안\n3. FENCE LINE  — 검 끝과 가드가 관객 쪽으로, 훈련장과 방향광은 글자 안\n4. LATTE FLOW  — 피처·잔·우유 줄기가 주 동작, 카페 내부·원목 카운터는 글자를 관통해 이어짐\n```\n\n★작성자: *\"이 세트는 폭발적 움직임에서 고요한 정밀로 옮겨가며, **거대 타이포가 각 장면을 실어 나른다.** 인물은 온전하게 남고, **환경이 타이포그래피를 통과해 움직인다.**\"*\n\n같은 시스템: [[mrlarus-human-fragments-typography-poster]] · [[mrlarus-human-fragments-foreground-perspective]] · [[mrlarus-human-fragments-body-intact-one-breakout]]",
