      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 \n\nPrompt:\nAn ultra-realistic cinematic dreamy lifestyle photo celebrating SUMMER ’26, featuring a young Korean woman sitting alone on the upper platform of a faded coral-pink vintage lifeguard tower on a quiet seaside beach, captured from a close low-angle perspective.\n\nUse tighter framing focused on her upper body, dangling legs, and the weathered wooden platform, creating an intimate, peaceful, youthful composition. The lifeguard tower should feel naturally aged and sun-faded rather than newly painted or artificial.\n\nShe sits casually on the edge of the platform, wearing a pale blue-and-white striped sleeveless romper, lightweight white canvas sneakers, and a soft cream bucket hat resting loosely behind her head. A small vintage film camera hangs from one wrist, while she holds a half-melted pastel popsicle in the other hand.\n\nShe looks toward the distant ocean with a gentle, unposed smile, expressing quiet freedom, summer anticipation, and the feeling of an endless school holiday.\n\nHer dark hair is tied in a loose low ponytail, with wispy strands moving naturally in the warm coastal breeze. The striped fabric and hat ribbon flutter softly in the same direction.\n\nA translucent yellow kite is tied to the side railing, floating high above her and adding playful movement. Beside her are a folded striped beach towel, a small seashell pouch, and a pair of retro sunglasses.\n\nCute hand-drawn doodles are naturally integrated around the scene: tiny seashells, smiling suns, waves, stars, hearts, sparkles, seagulls, and miniature fish.\n\nAdd handwritten-style white sketch text floating across the open sky like notes from a summer diary:\n“SUMMER ’26”\n“sea you soon”\n“salt in the air”\n“stay golden”\n\nA vast pale blue summer sky dominates the background with generous negative space. Show only a thin suggestion of the sparkling ocean horizon near the lower edge, keeping the composition airy, uncluttered, and emotionally spacious.\n\nBright coastal daylight, soft overexposed highlights, hazy dreamy glow, subtle lens bloom, pastel film tones, low contrast, smooth highlight roll-off, naturally luminous skin.\n\nColor palette: faded coral pink, powder blue, seafoam, translucent yellow, warm white, sandy cream.\n\nStyle: cinematic editorial lifestyle photography, Korean indie summer aesthetic, nostalgic youth diary mood, Kodak Portra 160 film look, delicate film grain, ultra-detailed dreamy realism, natural skin texture, 8K, vertical aspect ratio 3:4.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-realistic cinematic dreamy lifestyle photo celebrating SUMMER '26: a young Korean woman sits alone on the upper platform of a faded coral-pink vintage lifeguard tower on a quiet seaside beach, captured from a close low angle. Tight framing focuses on her upper body, dangling legs and the weathered sun-faded wooden platform. She wears a pale blue-and-white striped sleeveless romper, white canvas sneakers and a soft cream bucket hat resting behind her head; a small vintage film camera hangs from one wrist while she holds a half-melted pastel popsicle in the other hand. She looks toward the distant ocean with a gentle unposed smile. Her dark hair is in a loose low ponytail with wispy strands moving in the coastal breeze; the striped fabric and hat ribbon flutter in the same direction. A translucent yellow kite tied to the side railing floats high above her. Beside her rest a folded striped beach towel, a small seashell pouch and retro sunglasses. Cute hand-drawn doodles are integrated around the scene — tiny seashells, smiling suns, waves, stars, hearts, sparkles, seagulls and fish — and handwritten-style white sketch text floats across the open sky like notes from a summer diary: SUMMER '26, sea you soon, salt in the air, stay golden. A vast pale blue sky dominates with generous negative space; only a thin suggestion of sparkling ocean horizon appears near the lower edge. Bright coastal daylight, softly overexposed highlights, hazy dreamy glow, subtle lens bloom, pastel film tones, low contrast. Palette of faded coral pink, powder blue, seafoam, translucent yellow, warm white and sandy cream. Kodak Portra 160 film look, delicate grain, natural skin texture, vertical 3:4.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**여백을 용도로 지정한 프롬프트**다. 하늘을 그냥 비우는 게 아니라 **일기장으로 쓴다**:\n\n```\n손글씨풍 흰 스케치 텍스트가 열린 하늘을 가로질러 **여름 일기의 메모처럼** 떠 있게:\n  \"SUMMER '26\"  \"sea you soon\"  \"salt in the air\"  \"stay golden\"\n\n★거대한 창백한 파란 하늘이 배경을 지배하고 **넉넉한 네거티브 스페이스**\n★반짝이는 바다 수평선은 **하단 가장자리에 실낱 같은 암시만**\n  → 구도를 가볍고, 어수선하지 않고, **정서적으로 널찍하게** 유지\n```\n\n★**바다 사진인데 바다를 거의 안 보여준다.** 바다를 크게 넣으면 풍경 사진이 되고, 실낱만 남기면 **하늘과 인물의 사진**이 된다. 무엇을 뺄지가 장르를 정한 사례.\n\n★소품이 서사를 나눠 맡는다 — 손목의 필름카메라(기록), 반쯤 녹은 아이스바(시간의 경과), 난간에 묶인 반투명 노란 연(움직임), 접힌 줄무늬 타월·조개 파우치·레트로 선글라스(체류의 흔적).\n\n★**같은 방향으로 흔들리게** 지정한 것도 디테일이다 — *\"줄무늬 원단과 모자 리본이 같은 방향으로 부드럽게 나부낀다\"*. 바람은 보이지 않으니 여러 물체가 같은 방향으로 움직여야 존재가 증명된다.\n\n★낙서(doodle)를 사진에 통합하는 방식도 값어치가 있다 — 작은 조개·웃는 해·파도·별·하트·갈매기·물고기. 실사 위에 손그림을 얹는 [[taaruk-sky-doodle-integrated-selfie-portrait]] 계열이고, 이쪽은 **여백에만** 얹는다는 규율이 더해졌다.\n\n★색을 6개로 못박았다: 바랜 코랄핑크 · 파우더블루 · 시폼 · 반투명 옐로 · 웜화이트 · 샌디크림. Kodak Portra 160 룩과 짝을 이뤄 톤이 흔들리지 않는다.",
