      "prompt": "Recraft V4.1 turns simple mockups into visuals that feel straight out of a real campaign shoot.\n\nNatural light, believable materials, subtle imperfections, effortless compositions — it’s the small details that make everything feel authentic.\n\nPrompts ↓ https://t.co/f0qLktYcDF\n\n--- (답글: 프롬프트 전문) ---\nPrompt 1:\nPhotorealistic top-down café mockup of a completely blank menu sheet placed on a vivid saturated red metal café chair outdoors. The paper surface is entirely empty with no text, no logos, no lines, and no graphic elements. Clean matte paper texture with subtle natural folds and soft sunlight shadows. Bright glossy red painted chair surface with smooth curved metal details, warm concrete pavement background, strong natural daylight, modern urban café aesthetic, premium editorial branding photography style.\n\nPrompt 2:\nBlank mockup of a plain oversized white t-shirt draped over yellow street barrier, no print or text, realistic folds, clean composition, natural sunlight, urban outdoor environment.\n\nPrompt 3:\nBlank mockup of plain oversized green t-shirt, green baseball cap and white socks hanging on clothesline, same outdoor composition and sky background, completely blank surfaces with no graphics or text, realistic sunlight and fabric texture.\n\nPrompt 4:\nBlank mockup of four plain pastel yellow aluminum cans held in hands in layered composition, same close-up arrangement style, completely empty labels, no graphics or typography, black clothing background, direct flash lighting, realistic reflections, clean beverage packaging mockup.",
      "gen_prompt": "A photorealistic top-down café mockup of a completely blank menu sheet placed on a vivid saturated red metal café chair outdoors. The paper surface is entirely empty — no text, no logos, no lines, no graphic elements of any kind. Clean matte paper texture with subtle natural folds and soft sunlight shadows, bright glossy red painted chair surface with smooth curved metal details, warm concrete pavement background, strong natural daylight, modern urban café aesthetic, premium editorial branding photography style.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**목업 프롬프트의 핵심은 '비움'을 몇 번이고 반복하는 것**이다. 네 개 프롬프트 전부 같은 구조:\n\n```\n1. 카페 메뉴판   : \"completely blank\" + \"entirely empty with **no text, no logos,\n                   no lines, and no graphic elements**\"  ← 4중 부정\n2. 오버사이즈 티 : \"Blank mockup\" + \"**no print or text**\" + 사실적 주름\n3. 티+캡+양말   : \"**completely blank surfaces with no graphics or text**\"\n                   + \"**same outdoor composition and sky background**\" ← 시리즈 일관성\n4. 알루미늄 캔 4 : \"**completely empty labels, no graphics or typography**\"\n                   + \"same close-up arrangement style\" · 검은 옷 배경 · 다이렉트 플래시\n```\n\n★모델은 빈 표면을 그리라고 하면 **뭔가를 그려 넣으려 한다.** 그래서 '비어 있다'를 긍정문(`completely blank`)과 부정문(`no text, no logos, no lines, no graphic elements`) **양쪽으로** 적어야 실제로 비워진다.\n\n★3·4번의 **`same outdoor composition and sky background` / `same close-up arrangement style`** — 여러 목업을 한 세트로 만들 때 **구도를 명시적으로 물려받게** 한다. 브랜드 목업 세트의 요령.\n\n★게시자 정리: *\"자연광, 믿을 만한 재질, **은근한 불완전함**, 힘 빼고 잡은 구도 — 모든 걸 진짜처럼 느끼게 하는 건 작은 디테일이다.\"* `subtle natural folds`(자연스러운 주름)가 그 '불완전함'의 실행이다.\n\n우리 적용점: 로고·패키지 시안을 얹을 **빈 목업**을 뽑을 때 그대로 쓸 문법.",
