      "prompt": "Made with GPT IMAGE 2 on @SocialSight \nPrompt:\n\nOMPT 1:\npreate a premium, minimalist product advertisement inspired by modern Apple-style poster design. Use the uploaded\nMar\nMajor IV Wireless Bluetooth On-Ear Headphones (Black) as the only product, preserving every design detail,\ntext.\nroportions, and branding exactly as in the uploaded image.\nComposition:\nAspect Ratio: 3:4 (portrait) Clean matte off-white/light beige background with soft studio lighting. Place the headphones hanging naturally from the top center, suspended by a realistic human hand entering from the top edge. The hand should gently hold the headband, creating a premium lifestyle feel. Behind the product, add one oversized bold condensed typography element in the background (for example: \"MARSHALL\" or \"MAJOR IV\"), using very large uppercase letters.\nUse a combination of black, light gray, and muted gold/tan sections with low opacity so the text acts as a graphic background rather than readable content. Keep the headphones centered and overlapping the typography to create depth.\nMinimal Elements:\nAdd only 2-3 small decorative elements such as tiny flying birds or subtle botanical leaves in opposite corners for balance. No unnecessary graphics, icons, or clutter. Plenty of negative space.\nBottom Layout:\nBottom left: Marshall Major IV Wireless Bluetooth Headphones Use clean bold sans-serif typography with minimal text only. Bottom right: A small rounded color selection card showing Black, Brown, Cream color circles. Add one small rounded pill-shaped website/contact placeholder below (simple and clean).\nLighting & Style:\nSoft diffused studio lighting. Premium product photography. Gentle realistic shadows beneath the headphones. High contrast with crisp edges. Luxury editorial advertising aesthetic. Ultra-clean layout with balanced spacing. No gradients except very subtle background lighting. No excessive text, no promotional badges, no price, no QR code, no watermark, no extra logos besides the uploaded Marshall branding. Hyper-realistic, premium commercial product poster, elegant, minimal, modern.\n\n--- (답글: 프롬프트 2) ---\nPrompt 2: Create a premium, minimalist lifestyle advertisement for the uploaded Marshall Major IV Wireless Bluetooth On-Ear Headphones with Mic (Black). Use the uploaded product exactly as provided, preserving the Marshall logo, shape, leather texture, materials, proportions, buttons, and every physical detail without alteration.\nComposition Aspect Ratio: 3:4 (portrait) Ultra-clean off-white background with a soft warm gradient. Place a stylish young model in side profile facing right with eyes gently closed, expressing relaxation and immersion in music. The uploaded Marshall Major IV headphones should fit naturally on the model's head with perfect perspective and realistic shadows. Keep the composition spacious with plenty of negative space for a premium editorial feel. Color Theme Take inspiration from the headphone itself:\nMatte Black Charcoal Gray Warm Beige Soft Ivory Deep Graphite\nUse these colors subtly throughout the design to maintain a sophisticated monochrome aesthetic.\nBackground Design Add soft flowing abstract curved lines behind the model in a very light gray. Include a few subtle floating abstract shapes or blurred light streaks in warm beige and charcoal for depth. Avoid bright or distracting colors. Typography\nKeep the text extremely minimal.\nTop Center: MARSHALL\nBottom Left: Major IV Wireless Bluetooth Headphones\nBottom Right:\n80 Hours Battery Bluetooth 5.0 Built-in Mic\nUse a clean modern sans-serif font with black and dark gray typography. Highlight only one keyword (such as Major IV) using a muted warm beige or graphite accent inspired by the headphone tones.\nStyle Premium commercial product photography. Apple-inspired minimal advertising. Soft diffused studio lighting. Ultra-realistic skin tones. Crisp product details. Natural shadows. Luxury editorial poster. Elegant composition with generous white space. High-end fashion and technology campaign aesthetic. Hyper-realistic, 8K quality. Constraints Use only the uploaded Marshall Major IV headphones. Keep the layout clean with very little text. No price, QR code, website, social media handles, promotional badges, or excessive icons. No clutter-focus entirely on the model, the headphones, and a refined premium presentation..",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium minimalist product advertisement in modern Apple-style poster design, 3:4 portrait. A pair of black on-ear headphones hangs naturally from the top centre, suspended by a realistic human hand entering from the top edge and gently holding the headband, against a clean matte off-white background with soft studio lighting. Behind the product sits one oversized bold condensed typographic element in very large uppercase letters, rendered in black, light grey and muted gold-tan sections at low opacity so the text reads as a graphic background rather than legible copy; the headphones stay centred and overlap the typography to create depth. Only two or three small decorative elements — tiny flying birds and subtle botanical leaves in opposite corners — balance the layout, with plenty of negative space. Bottom left carries a short product line in clean bold sans-serif; bottom right a small rounded colour-selection card with black, brown and cream circles above a small pill-shaped placeholder. Soft diffused studio light, gentle realistic shadow beneath the product, crisp edges, luxury editorial advertising aesthetic. No gradients beyond subtle background lighting, no price, no QR code, no badges, no watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**타이포그래피의 용도를 뒤집은 프롬프트**다. 두 개 프롬프트를 연속으로 올렸고(제품 단독 / 모델 착용), 둘 다 같은 규칙을 공유한다.\n\n```\n★배경에 **초대형 볼드 콘덴스드 타이포** 요소 하나 (아주 큰 대문자)\n  검정·라이트그레이·뮤티드 골드탄 섹션을 **낮은 불투명도**로 써서\n  ★**글자가 '읽히는 내용'이 아니라 '그래픽 배경'으로 작동하게**\n  제품은 중앙에 두고 **타이포와 겹치게** 해서 깊이를 만든다\n```\n\n★**`so the text acts as a graphic background rather than readable content`** — 이 한 줄이 AI 이미지의 약점(글자 정확도)을 **설계로 회피**한다. 어차피 못 읽을 글자라면 **읽을 필요가 없게** 만들면 된다. 영리한 우회다.\n\n★레이아웃을 위치로 지정한 것도 실무적이다:\n```\n상단 중앙 : 손이 프레임 위에서 들어와 헤드밴드를 쥐고 제품이 매달림\n좌하단    : 제품명 한 줄, 클린 볼드 산세리프\n우하단    : 작은 라운드 컬러 선택 카드(블랙·브라운·크림 원) + 알약형 플레이스홀더\n코너      : 작은 새나 식물 잎 2~3개만 (반대 코너에 배치해 균형)\n```\n\n★금지 목록이 광고 특유의 잡동사니를 정확히 겨냥한다 — `no price, QR code, website, social media handles, promotional badges, excessive icons`. 이것들이 하나라도 들어가면 프리미엄 톤이 깨진다.\n\n★두 번째 프롬프트(모델 착용본)에서는 **색을 제품에서 추출**하라고 지시한다 — *\"헤드폰 자체에서 영감을 얻어: 매트 블랙 · 차콜 그레이 · 웜 베이지 · 소프트 아이보리 · 딥 그래파이트\"*. 제품이 팔레트의 출처가 되면 화면이 저절로 통일된다.\n\n비교: [[gdgtify-city-initial-architecture-letterform]](글자를 형태로) · [[vigocreativeai-megatype-dossier-bureaucracy-realism]]",
