      "prompt": "The Sculpted Botanical Collection 🌸👗\n\nWhat happens when fine art paper-quilling enters the world of runway fashion?\n\nYou get vibrant gradients, sculpted leaf gowns, and striking profiles that pop off the screen\n\nFrom rainbow parasols to lime-green garden elegance, this 4-piece series explores how digital art can replicate the physical beauty of 3D paper relief and clay sculpture. \n\nPrompt👇🏾\n\n--- (답글: Universal Prompt) ---\nUniversal Plug-in Prompt \n\nCreate a masterful 3D paper quilling and mixed-media bas-relief artwork in a refined, high-fashion sculptural style, presented as a perfectly balanced 1:1 square composition.\n\nThe central subject is [SUBJECT / FIGURE], posed in [POSE / BODY POSITION] and facing [DIRECTION]. Style the figure with [HAIRSTYLE / HEADPIECE / HAT], wearing an extraordinary couture-inspired outfit constructed from [PRIMARY MATERIAL / PAPER TECHNIQUE], featuring [DRESS SILHOUETTE / GARMENT STRUCTURE] and dramatic [PLEATS / FOLDS / RIBBONS / PETAL FORMS].\n\nUse a sophisticated colour palette of [PRIMARY COLOURS], accented with [SECONDARY COLOURS / CONTRASTING ACCENTS]. Make the clothing highly dimensional, tactile, and sculptural, with [SPECIFIC TEXTURE OR MATERIAL BEHAVIOUR] creating visible depth and graceful movement.\n\nSurround the figure with [BOTANICAL ELEMENTS / FLOWERS / STEMS / TENDRILS / DECORATIVE DETAILS], arranged in a natural yet carefully composed visual rhythm. Include [HERO BACKGROUND ELEMENT] as a dramatic focal feature behind or around the subject.\n\nBlend [PAPER QUILLING / PLEATED PAPER / SCULPTED CLAY / TEXTILE / MIXED MEDIA] into a cohesive handcrafted bas-relief surface. Emphasize crisp paper edges, layered dimensional forms, delicate quilled details, molded textures, tactile surfaces, and realistic relief depth.\n\nSet the artwork against a [BACKGROUND COLOUR / SURFACE TEXTURE] backdrop with a minimalist gallery-like presentation. Use [LIGHTING STYLE] directional studio lighting to create soft yet defined 3D depth shadows, subtle highlights, and rich tactile contrast while preserving an elegant, clean visual atmosphere.\n\nMaintain a sophisticated minimalist high-fashion editorial aesthetic, with exceptional craftsmanship, graceful proportions, balanced negative space, and a premium handcrafted art-gallery presentation. The composition should feel immersive, poetic, contemporary, and visually refined.\n\nUltra-detailed, photorealistic 3D relief photography, handcrafted paper sculpture, sophisticated colour harmony, tactile material realism, intricate dimensional layering, refined shadows, premium editorial art direction, 1:1 aspect ratio.\n\n--- (답글: Cheat Sheet) ---\nCheat Sheet\n\n[SUBJECT / FIGURE] → Woman, dancer, bride, fashion muse\n[POSE / BODY POSITION] → Standing, seated, profile, walking\n\n[DIRECTION] → Facing left, right, forward\n[HAIRSTYLE / HEADPIECE / HAT] → Updo, long hair, structured hat, crown\n\n[PRIMARY MATERIAL / PAPER TECHNIQUE] → Quilling, pleated paper, crepe paper\n[DRESS SILHOUETTE / GARMENT STRUCTURE] → Mermaid gown, fan skirt, ribbed dress\n\n[PRIMARY COLOURS] → Sage, lime, pink, rainbow\n[SECONDARY COLOURS / ACCENTS] → Magenta, coral, orange, beads\n\n[SPECIFIC TEXTURE] → Ribbed, pleated, molded, layered, glossy\n[BOTANICAL ELEMENTS] → Stems, petals, flowers, tendrils\n\n[HERO BACKGROUND ELEMENT] → Giant flower, floral halo, abstract botanical form\n[MIXED MEDIA] → Paper + clay + textile\n\n[BACKGROUND] → Off-white plaster, warm ivory, soft lavender\n[LIGHTING] → Soft directional, overhead, gallery studio",
      "gen_prompt": "A masterful 3D paper-quilling and mixed-media bas-relief artwork in a refined high-fashion sculptural style, perfectly balanced 1:1 square composition. A woman in serene side profile faces left, hair swept into a sculpted updo, wearing an extraordinary couture-inspired gown constructed entirely from quilled and pleated paper — a fan-skirt silhouette with dramatic pleats, folds and petal forms. A sophisticated palette of sage and lime accented with magenta and coral, the clothing highly dimensional and tactile with ribbed, layered paper behaviour creating visible depth and graceful movement. Botanical elements — stems, petals, tendrils and quilled leaves — surround the figure in a natural yet composed rhythm, with a giant paper flower as the dramatic focal feature behind her. Crisp paper edges, layered dimensional forms, delicate quilled detail and realistic relief depth, set against an off-white plaster backdrop in a minimalist gallery-like presentation. Soft directional studio lighting creates defined 3D depth shadows and subtle highlights. Ultra-detailed photorealistic 3D relief photography, refined shadows, premium editorial art direction, 1:1.",
      "prompt_ko": "★같은 계정의 두 번째 세트. **범용 프롬프트 + 치트시트** 구조는 동일하고, 주제가 패션이다.\n\n★핵심은 **의상을 재료의 거동으로 서술**하는 것이다:\n```\n· [주요 재료/퀼링 기법]으로 **전적으로 구성된** 쿠튀르 드레스\n· [드레스 실루엣/의복 구조] + 극적인 [주름/접힘/리본/꽃잎 형태]\n· ★의상을 **highly dimensional, tactile, sculptural** 하게,\n  [구체적 질감 또는 재료의 거동]이 **가시적 깊이와 우아한 움직임**을 만들게\n```\n★`[SPECIFIC TEXTURE OR MATERIAL BEHAVIOUR]`라는 슬롯 이름이 정확하다 — 질감이 아니라 **재료가 어떻게 움직이는가**를 넣게 했다(리브드·플리티드·몰디드·레이어드·글로시).\n\n★치트시트:\n```\n[SUBJECT]      → 여성 · 무용수 · 신부 · 패션 뮤즈\n[PAPER 기법]   → 퀼링 · 플리티드 페이퍼 · 크레이프지\n[드레스 실루엣] → 머메이드 가운 · 팬 스커트 · 리브드 드레스\n[주색]         → 세이지 · 라임 · 핑크 · 레인보우\n[히어로 배경]   → 거대 꽃 · 플로럴 헤일로 · 추상 식물 형태\n[배경]         → 오프화이트 플라스터 · 웜 아이보리 · 소프트 라벤더\n```\n\n★**`minimalist gallery-like presentation`** — 배경을 전시장으로 설정하면 공예품이 **작품**으로 격상된다. 조명(소프트 디렉셔널 스튜디오)도 그에 맞춰 정해진다.\n\n★부조(bas-relief)라는 매체 지정이 이 시리즈의 정체다 — 완전한 3D도, 평면 일러스트도 아닌 **중간 깊이**. 그래서 그림자가 룩의 절반을 만든다.\n\n형제 세트: [[yourplugai-universal-prompt-plus-cheatsheet-paper-to-3d]] · [[yourplugai-quilling-landmark-and-gown-frame]] · [[yourplugai-bridal-mixedmedia-artist-hand-in-frame]]",
