      "title": "★도시 이름을 박지 말고 'SUBJECT_DNA를 추론하라'고 시킨다",
      "prompt": "I compared Nano Banana, Mai, and Reve for this prompt recently. Forgot to include GPT Image 2. \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 important Asian cities: Generate a photoreal miniature pop-up book diorama for [SUBJECT].Rules:- infer SUBJECT_DNA automatically- use BASE_DOCUMENT as the physical foundation- the subject must rise from the page as a paper-engineered 3D world- include inferred landmarks, architecture, terrain, infrastructure, cultural motifs, and small scale cues- show folded platforms, stairs, slots, hinges, support struts, and hidden paper mechanics- integrate the subject name or symbolic typography as raised paper letters or structural forms- the base page should contain an inferred map, diagram, blueprint, or printed context relevant to SUBJECT- everything must feel crafted from paper, cardstock, ink, miniature model materials, and precise pop-up engineering- no hard-coded city, landmark, tower, temple, map, color, or text unless supplied",
      "gen_prompt": "Generate a photoreal miniature pop-up book diorama for SEOUL. The subject must rise from the page as a paper-engineered 3D world. Include inferred landmarks, architecture, terrain, infrastructure, cultural motifs and small scale cues. Show folded platforms, stairs, slots, hinges, support struts and hidden paper mechanics. Integrate the city name as raised paper letters or structural forms. The base page contains a printed map and blueprint relevant to the city. Everything crafted from paper, cardstock, ink, miniature model materials and precise pop-up engineering. Single image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**하드코딩 금지를 마지막 줄에 못박는 문법.**\n\n```\n- infer SUBJECT_DNA automatically\n- no hard-coded city, landmark, tower, temple, map, color, or text unless supplied\n```\n\n도시를 지정하지 않고 **\"주제의 DNA를 알아서 추론하라\"**고 시킨 뒤, 맨 끝에 *\"공급되지 않은\n도시·랜드마크·탑·사원·지도·색·텍스트를 박아넣지 말라\"*고 막는다. 템플릿을 재사용 가능하게\n만드는 장치 — 주제만 갈아끼우면 그대로 돈다.\n\n★**물성을 길게 나열한다**: 접힌 플랫폼, 계단, 슬롯, 경첩, 지지대, 숨은 종이 기구.\n\"팝업북처럼\"이라는 한마디 대신 **종이 공학의 부품 이름을 열거**해서 질감을 확보한다.\n\n★**바탕 페이지에도 역할을 준다** — 주제와 관련된 지도·도해·청사진이 인쇄돼 있어야 한다고\n지시한다. 배경을 비우지 않는 방식이다.",
