      "prompt": "I love these prompts for books and manga. There is a way to jailbreak GPT to do them but I don't bother. Nano Banana Pro is pretty decent at them.\n\nPrompt: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for bleach and 3 other famous manga: A macro photograph of a manga comic book lying open on a wooden desk::4 \nThe Layout: A 4-panel action page featuring [SUBJECT]. Panels 1, 2, and 3 are drawn flat on the paper in traditional 2D black-and-white screentone ink::4 \nThe Eruption: In panel 4, the [SUBJECT] violently breaks the boundary of the paper, becoming a photorealistic, highly detailed 3D vinyl figure leaping into the real world::5 \nSelective Accent: The 2D ink is entirely black and white, but the 3D figure exploding from panel 4 is vibrantly colored in [COLOR] and casting real shadows on the book::5 \nPhysical FX: 3D resin action-lines and shattered 3D paper pieces flying through the air::4 \nFlat 2D image only, digital screen, messy::-2",
      "gen_prompt": "A macro photograph of a manga comic book lying open on a wooden desk. The layout is a four-panel action page featuring an original masked swordsman character. Panels 1, 2 and 3 are drawn flat on the paper in traditional 2D black-and-white screentone ink. In panel 4 the character violently breaks the boundary of the paper, becoming a photorealistic, highly detailed 3D vinyl figure leaping into the real world. The 2D ink is entirely black and white, but the 3D figure exploding from panel 4 is vibrantly coloured in crimson and casts real shadows on the book. 3D resin action-lines and shattered 3D paper pieces fly through the air. Not a flat 2D image, not a digital screen.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**한 화면 안에서 매체를 전환시키는 문법.**\n\n```\n레이아웃:    4칸 액션 페이지. 1·2·3칸은 전통 2D 흑백 스크린톤 잉크로 **종이 위에 평면으로**::4\n폭발:       4칸에서 [SUBJECT]가 **종이의 경계를 부수고** 사진처럼 정밀한 3D 비닐 피규어가 되어\n            현실로 뛰어나온다::5\n선택적 강조: 2D 잉크는 완전한 흑백, 4칸에서 튀어나온 3D만 [COLOR]로 채색되고\n            **책 위에 진짜 그림자를 드리운다**::5\n물리 효과:   3D 레진 속도선과 부서진 3D 종이 조각이 공중에 흩날림::4\n```\n\n★**\"경계를 부순다\"를 물리적으로 처리한 게 핵심**이다. 색(흑백↔컬러) · 차원(2D↔3D) ·\n그림자(없음↔있음)를 **동시에** 전환시켜 이탈감을 만든다.\n\n★부서진 종이 조각과 3D 속도선까지 지정해 \"뚫고 나온 흔적\"을 남긴다. 이 잔해가 없으면\n그냥 합성처럼 보인다.\n\n⚠️ 원문은 실제 만화 제목을 예로 들지만, 우리 재현은 저작권을 피해 오리지널 캐릭터로 돌렸다.",
