      "prompt": "Minimalist watercolor illustration of children joyfully playing in summer splash fountains.🌊\n\nMidjourney v8.2\n\nPrompt:\nMinimalist watercolor illustration on textured cold press handmade paper, 3:4 vertical, large negative space, delicate ink line art, translucent washes, wet on wet blooms, pigment granulation, floating droplets, cozy slice of life warmth, elegant editorial quality, museum quality, 8K. \nPALETTE: cobalt/cerulean sky, bare white paper for clouds, warm grey granite, lemon yellow and mint green accents. \nSCENE: A single Korean elementary school boy walks out of an arching fountain jet tunnel at Gwanghwamun Plaza, Seoul, on a bright summer day  soaked, grinning wide, shoulders lifted, one hand brushing water from his face, rubber sandals splashing wet stone. Pure childlike delight. \nCOMPOSITION: Eye level frontal perspective. Boy small in lower middle third. Arching jets form a receding ink arc tunnel converging to a soft vanishing point behind him. Single cohesive moment. \nENVIRONMENT: Anchor = arching jets + wet granite only. Boy and nearest jets ~60% resolved; distant buildings/trees dissolve into pale blue grey washes, broken graphite, pigment blooms, untouched paper. Sky nearly empty. \nWARDROBE: lemon yellow t shirt, mint green shorts, pale blue rubber clogs, soaked hair pushed back, tiny realistic droplets on face and fabric. \nLIGHT/WATER: Strong warm midday sun. Jets rendered as fine ink lines breaking into dots and comma shaped droplets, dry brush spray at landing, pale cerulean pooling on granite. Large untouched ivory paper areas preserved. No text, captions, signage, logos, watermarks, duplicated figures, extra limbs, distorted hands, crowded background, dark digital painting, heavy outlines, or glossy 3D rendering.",
      "gen_prompt": "Minimalist watercolour illustration on textured cold-press handmade paper, 3:4 vertical, large negative space, delicate ink line art, translucent washes, wet-on-wet blooms, pigment granulation, floating droplets, cosy slice-of-life warmth, elegant editorial quality. Palette: cobalt and cerulean sky, bare white paper for clouds, warm grey granite, lemon yellow and mint green accents. Scene: a single Korean elementary school boy walks out of an arching fountain jet tunnel on a bright summer day — soaked, grinning wide, shoulders lifted, one hand brushing water from his face, rubber sandals splashing wet stone. Composition: eye-level frontal perspective, the boy small in the lower middle third, arching jets forming a receding ink arc tunnel converging to a soft vanishing point behind him. Environment anchor is the arching jets and wet granite only: the boy and the nearest jets are about sixty percent resolved, while distant buildings and trees dissolve into pale blue-grey washes, broken graphite, pigment blooms and untouched paper. Sky nearly empty. Wardrobe: lemon yellow t-shirt, mint green shorts, pale blue rubber clogs, soaked hair pushed back, tiny realistic droplets on face and fabric. Jets rendered as fine ink lines breaking into dots and comma-shaped droplets, dry-brush spray at the landing, pale cerulean pooling on granite. Large untouched ivory paper areas preserved. No text, no signage, no logos.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**이 배치에서 가장 값어치 있는 발상 — 해상도를 예산처럼 배분한다.**\n\n수채·미니멀 일러스트에서 늘 실패하는 지점이 \"어디까지 그리고 어디서 멈출 것인가\"인데,\n이 프롬프트는 그걸 **퍼센트와 앵커로 못박는다**:\n\n```\nENVIRONMENT:\n  앵커 = 아치형 물줄기 + 젖은 화강암, 그것만.\n  소년과 가장 가까운 물줄기 = 약 60% 해결(resolved)\n  먼 건물·나무      = 옅은 청회색 워시, 끊긴 흑연, 안료 번짐, 손대지 않은 종이로 용해\n  하늘             = 거의 비움\n```\n\n★**\"60% resolved\"** 라는 표현이 핵심이다. \"디테일하게\"나 \"간결하게\" 같은 형용사 대신\n**완성도의 눈금**을 준다. 그리고 그 눈금이 **거리에 따라 감소**한다.\n같은 작가의 도서관 건([[goodman-watercolor-library-structured-block]])에도 같은 줄이 있다 —\n*\"먼 선반은 프레임 가장자리에 닿기 전에 용해된다.\"*\n\n★**물을 선으로 분해한 것**도 정교하다:\n*\"제트는 가는 잉크 선으로 그려지다 점과 쉼표 모양 물방울로 부서지고,\n착지 지점에서 드라이브러시 스프레이가 되며, 화강암 위에 옅은 청록으로 고인다.\"*\n물줄기 → 점 → 쉼표 → 스프레이 → 고임. **한 소재의 상태 변화를 순서대로** 적었다.\n\n★남는 종이를 명시적으로 지킨다 — *\"넓은 손대지 않은 아이보리 종이 영역을 보존할 것.\"*\n수채에서 여백은 \"안 그린 곳\"이 아니라 **지켜야 할 자원**이라는 태도.",
