      "prompt": "Minimalist watercolor illustration of a peaceful modern library. \n\nMidjourney v8.2\n\nPrompt:\nMinimalist pastel watercolor and ink illustration, 3:4 vertical, textured handmade cold press watercolor paper. \nSCENE: Contemporary Korean city hall library, quiet summer morning. Gently elevated viewpoint over wide wooden tiered reading steps with children, parents, and residents reading picture books, magazines, and novels. Tall curved wooden bookshelf along entire left wall extending to lower floor. White mezzanine bridge, glass railings, circular ventilation openings, small yellow bookcases below. \nMOOD: Cool summer refuge, peaceful, refreshing, communal, airy, air conditioned warmth. \nCOMPOSITION: Curved bookshelf and tiered seats as leading lines. People small, naturally distributed in lower half. Wide open ceiling, generous untouched paper at upper/outer edges. Distant shelves dissolve before frame edges.\nSTYLE: Delicate broken ink contours, translucent uneven washes, visible paper grain, wet on wet blooms, pigment granulation, dry brush gaps, softly incomplete architectural edges, quiet Korean storybook warmth. \nPALETTE: Warm ivory, pale oak brown, mint green, powder blue, muted mustard yellow, soft coral, cool gray, navy accents. \nNO text, logos, signage, or watermarks. \nNEGATIVE: Photorealism, fully rendered architecture, dense crowd, harsh shadows, saturated colors, glossy digital painting, perfect geometric lines, excessive detail, complete background wash, distorted stairs, duplicated people, malformed hands.",
      "gen_prompt": "Minimalist pastel watercolour and ink illustration, 3:4 vertical, textured handmade cold-press watercolour paper. Scene: a contemporary Korean city hall library on a quiet summer morning, seen from a gently elevated viewpoint over wide wooden tiered reading steps where children, parents and residents read picture books, magazines and novels. A tall curved wooden bookshelf runs along the entire left wall and extends to the lower floor; a white mezzanine bridge with glass railings, circular ventilation openings and small yellow bookcases below. Mood: a cool summer refuge, peaceful, refreshing, communal, airy. Composition: the curved bookshelf and tiered seats act as leading lines, people are small and naturally distributed in the lower half, the ceiling opens wide, generous untouched paper at the upper and outer edges, and distant shelves dissolve before reaching the frame edge. Style: delicate broken ink contours, translucent uneven washes, visible paper grain, wet-on-wet blooms, pigment granulation, dry-brush gaps, softly incomplete architectural edges, quiet Korean storybook warmth. Palette: warm ivory, pale oak brown, mint green, powder blue, muted mustard yellow, soft coral, cool grey, navy accents. No text, no logos, no signage.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**프롬프트를 산문이 아니라 블록으로 쓴다.** 여섯 칸이 고정이다:\n\n```\nSCENE       무엇이 어디에 있는가 (시점·공간·사람·건축 요소)\nMOOD        어떤 감각인가 (여기서는 \"여름의 시원한 피난처\")\nCOMPOSITION 시선을 어떻게 끌 것인가 + 무엇을 비울 것인가\nSTYLE       붓과 잉크의 물성\nPALETTE     색을 이름으로 나열\nNEGATIVE    무엇이 되면 실패인가\n```\n\n★**COMPOSITION 칸이 특히 잘 쓰였다** — 세 가지를 각각 지정한다:\n· **유도선** — *\"곡선 책장과 계단식 좌석이 리딩 라인 역할을 한다\"*\n· **사람의 크기와 분포** — *\"사람은 작게, 아래쪽 절반에 자연스럽게 분산\"*\n· **비울 곳** — *\"위쪽과 바깥 가장자리에 넉넉한 미처리 종이,\n  먼 선반은 프레임 가장자리에 닿기 전에 용해된다\"*\n\n★**NEGATIVE 칸이 정확히 '이 스타일의 반대말' 목록**이다:\n`포토리얼리즘 · 완전히 렌더된 건축 · 빽빽한 군중 · 강한 그림자 · 채도 높은 색 ·\n광택 있는 디지털 페인팅 · 완벽한 기하 선 · 과도한 디테일 · 배경 전체 채색`\n\"~하지 마라\"가 아니라 **실패 상태를 하나씩 이름 붙인** 것. 미니멀 수채가 무너지는\n경로를 아는 사람이 쓴 목록이다.\n\n★Midjourney v8.2용이라 NEGATIVE 블록이 따로 있다. 우리 Krea2는 cfg 1이라\n**네거티브가 사실상 무시**되므로, 재현본에서 그 부분은 시험되지 않는다.\n[[goodman-watercolor-resolution-budget]]과 같은 작가·같은 문법.",
