      "title": "★★제품은 손대지 말고 '세계를 갈라라' — 드러난 층마다 제품의 효능을 말하게 한다",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 Prompt: Reality Autopsy\n\nCut the world open, then let the layers explain the product.\n\nFull prompt in the next comment\n\n[답글]\nUse the uploaded product image as the single source of truth and create one premium campaign-ready advertisement for this product only.\n\nSilently analyze the product's category, function, audience, emotional promise, brand personality, silhouette, materials, colors, packaging, typography, logo behavior, ingredients or construction, and most ownable selling point.\n\nCORE CONCEPT:\nKeep the real product completely whole, accurate, and untouched. Slice open the environment around or beneath it in one precise, impossible cross-section, revealing hidden layers that visually explain what the product does, how it feels, what it contains, or why it matters.\n\nBuild every exposed layer from the product's real DNA. Layers may represent materials, ingredients, technology, craftsmanship, performance, energy, emotion, process, or sensory experience. Avoid random decoration. Every visible layer must communicate a real product benefit or brand promise.\n\nThe cross-section must feel dimensional and physically believable, with clear depth, material thickness, realistic transitions, shadows, fractures, pressure, reflections, and tactile micro-details. The product remains the undisputed hero and must never be dissected, damaged, buried, or visually overwhelmed.\n\nPRODUCT DNA LOCK:\nPreserve the product exactly: shape, proportions, structure, packaging, logo, label, typography, colors, materials, textures, finishes, reflections, and every visible detail. Do not redesign, recolor, relabel, distort, simplify, duplicate, open, cut, or invent product features.\n\nCREATIVE LOOP:\nSilently generate five different cross-section concepts grounded in the uploaded product. Score them for visual hook, originality, brand fit, instant readability, realism, product focus, and commercial strength. Reject anything generic, cluttered, confusing, or below 9/10. Produce only the strongest final concept.\n\nBRAND COMMUNICATION:\nIntegrate the real brand logo naturally. Create one original headline or slogan of two words maximum, based specifically on the selected product and revealed layers. Match the brand's authentic language, typography, scale, placement, and visual tone.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nOne hero product, one dominant environmental cross-section, refined negative space, bold editorial framing, cinematic commercial lighting, premium material accuracy, realistic contact shadows, controlled debris, sophisticated depth, and clean visual hierarchy.\n\n16:9. One standalone image. No grid, no collage, no split screen, no miniature world, no biological anatomy, no infographic icons, no arrows, no floating labels, no repeated products, no unrelated props, no mockup presentation, and no random text.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium campaign-ready advertisement, 16:9. One hero product — a glass jar of cold-pressed honey — stands completely whole, accurate and untouched on a stone counter. The environment beneath and around it has been sliced open in one precise, impossible cross-section, revealing hidden layers that visually explain what the product contains and why it matters: a stratum of honeycomb cells, a band of pressed wildflower meadow, a seam of raw beeswax, a dark layer of cool cellar stone. Every exposed layer is built from the product's own DNA and communicates a real benefit — no random decoration. The cross-section is dimensional and physically believable, with clear depth, material thickness, realistic transitions, shadows, fractures, pressure and tactile micro-detail, while the jar itself is never dissected, damaged or buried. Refined negative space, bold editorial framing, cinematic commercial lighting, premium material accuracy, realistic contact shadows, controlled debris, clean visual hierarchy. One standalone image — no grid, no collage, no split screen, no miniature world, no infographic icons, no arrows, no floating labels.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**\"세계를 갈라 열고, 그 층들이 제품을 설명하게 하라.\"**\n작가가 붙인 이름이 `Reality Autopsy`(현실 부검)다. 이 배치 최고작이고,\n제품 광고 프롬프트 중에서도 발상이 가장 선명하다.\n\n★**핵심은 대상을 바꿔치기한 것**이다:\n```\n자르는 것:  제품 ❌  →  제품 주변·아래의 환경 ✅\n제품은:     완전히 온전하고 정확하며 손대지 않은 채로\n결과:       단면이 제품을 해부하지 않으면서도 제품의 내부를 설명한다\n```\n제품 단면도는 흔한 광고 문법인데, 그러면 패키지를 훼손해야 한다.\n**환경을 대신 자르는 것**으로 그 딜레마를 피했다.\n\n★**층에 규율을 건다** — *\"드러난 모든 층은 제품의 진짜 DNA에서 만들어라.\n무작위 장식을 피하라. **보이는 모든 층은 실제 제품 효익이나 브랜드 약속을 전달해야 한다.**\"*\n층이 재현할 수 있는 것을 열거해 준다: 재료·성분·기술·장인정신·성능·에너지·감정·공정·감각 경험.\n\n★**CREATIVE LOOP — 모델에게 자기 검열을 시킨다.** 이게 이 프롬프트의 두 번째 발명이다:\n```\n① 업로드된 제품에 근거해 서로 다른 단면 컨셉 다섯 개를 조용히 생성한다\n② 각각을 채점한다 — 시각적 후크 · 독창성 · 브랜드 적합 · 즉시 가독성 ·\n                  사실성 · 제품 집중도 · 상업적 강도\n③ 진부하거나 산만하거나 혼란스럽거나 **9/10 미만인 것은 기각**한다\n④ 가장 강한 최종 컨셉 하나만 산출한다\n```\n앞 배치의 SQL·방정식 프롬프트가 **형식**을 빌려왔다면, 이건 **평가 절차**를 빌려왔다.\n`9/10`이라는 컷오프 숫자가 특히 실무적이다.\n\n★**슬로건을 두 단어로 제한**한다 — *\"선택된 제품과 드러난 층에 근거해\n최대 두 단어의 오리지널 헤드라인 하나를 만들어라.\"* 카피를 길게 쓰면\n단면의 시각적 설명과 경쟁하게 된다는 걸 아는 제약이다.\n\n★금지 목록이 정확히 **\"이 발상이 무너지는 형태\"** 들이다 —\n`그리드 · 콜라주 · 화면분할 · 미니어처 월드 · 생물 해부도 · 인포그래픽 아이콘 ·\n화살표 · 떠 있는 라벨 · 목업 프레젠테이션`.\n[[goodman-product-ad-marker-doodle]]과 나란히 두면 제품 광고의 두 방향이 보인다 —\n그쪽은 제품 **바깥에 낙서**를 얹고, 이쪽은 제품 **아래를 잘라 연다**.",
