      "title": "★제품을 '올라탈 수 있는 설치물'로 키우고 타이포 재질을 맛에서 파생 — 40~50%/10~15% 면적 지정 + 「VOL.1 금지」",
      "prompt": "🤯 Turned four summer drinks into full fashion campaigns!\n\nOversized products, fresh ingredients, glossy typography, and four different poses:\n\n1. MINT GLOW — lime and mint sparkle\n2. PEACH DRIFT — white peach oolong\n3. BERRY MOOD — berry yogurt smoothie\n4. CITRUS POP — grapefruit and orange blossom fizz\n\nOne visual system. Four flavors. Four different moods.\n\nMade with ChatGPT-Image2\nPrompt below 👇\n\n--- (작성자 답글 = 프롬프트 본체) ---\n\nPrompt:\n\n[Product type]: {sparkling tea / cold brew / smoothie / dessert drink / other}\n[Brand name]: {original fictional brand}\n[Product name]: {original product name}\n[Flavor]: {fruit, tea, dairy, herbs, or other ingredients}\n[Main headline]: {a short original two-word phrase}\n[Model]: {young adult woman, appearance, hairstyle, expression}\n[Pose]: {sitting, leaning, crouching, half-standing, or another interaction}\n[Outfit]: {youthful fashion styling}\n[Color palette]: {main color + neutral color + accent color}\n[Decorative ingredients]: {fruit, flowers, herbs, ice, leaves, or food materials}\n[Atmosphere]: {sunlight, mist, bubbles, reflections, condensation, or other}\n[Aspect ratio]: 9:16\n\nCreate the final image directly as a premium vertical fashion campaign for an original trendy drink or food brand.\n\nTurn the product into an oversized installation occupying around 40–50% of the frame. The young adult model should interact naturally with it by sitting, leaning, stepping, or balancing on the packaging. Show believable weight, contact, perspective, and body proportions. Her appearance should feel youthful, sweet, bright, and photorealistic, with natural skin texture, realistic hair, and an expressive gaze slightly toward the camera.\n\nUse a different pose for each image so the series does not feel repetitive. Keep the product and model as the clear primary subjects.\n\nPlace fruit, flowers, herbs, ice, leaves, or other flavor ingredients around the foreground and lower edges. These elements should enrich the scene but remain secondary, occupying only about 10–15% of the visual attention. Use partial cropping and soft foreground blur to create depth.\n\nAdd one oversized two-word headline behind the model and product. Give the typography a material effect inspired by the flavor: translucent glass, jelly, acrylic, condensation, bubbles, soft gradients, refraction, or glossy highlights. Let parts of the letters overlap naturally with the model and product to create spatial depth.\n\nDo not use \"VOL.1,\" \"ISSUE 01,\" decorative numbering, or generic template labels. Add 3–5 pieces of short original brand copy and arrange them asymmetrically along the frame edge, product contour, light direction, or circular graphic elements.\n\nUse a clean high-key studio environment, a soft color-gradient background, subtle reflective flooring, controlled sunlight, and a product-specific atmospheric effect. Keep the layout rich but uncluttered.\n\nPhotorealistic commercial photography, premium editorial styling, realistic liquid, ice, fruit, condensation, packaging materials, natural skin, accurate hands and feet, strong visual hierarchy, refined typography, and polished advertising quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium vertical fashion campaign for an original fictional sparkling tea brand. A tall lime-and-mint sparkling tea can is turned into an oversized installation, standing upright and occupying about half the frame; a young adult woman with a short bob and a bright, amused expression sits on the rim of the can with one leg drawn up, leaning back on one hand, her weight and contact with the metal surface believable, correct perspective and body proportions, photorealistic natural skin texture and realistic hair, gaze slightly toward the camera. She wears youthful summer styling: a cropped white knit, a pleated mint skirt and chunky sneakers. Fresh limes, mint sprigs and cracked ice are scattered across the foreground and lower edges, partly cropped and softly blurred so they enrich the scene without competing. Behind the model and the can, one oversized two-word headline reading \"MINT GLOW\" is rendered as translucent condensation-fogged glass letters with refraction and glossy highlights; parts of the letters pass behind her shoulder and the can to create depth. Three short lines of small brand copy sit asymmetrically along the frame edge and around a thin circular graphic. Clean high-key studio environment, soft mint-to-cream gradient background, subtly reflective floor, controlled sunlight, fine bubbles and condensation in the air. Palette of fresh mint green, warm off-white and a single lime-yellow accent. Photorealistic commercial photography, premium editorial styling, realistic liquid, ice, aluminium and glass materials, accurate hands and feet, strong visual hierarchy, polished advertising quality.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**기존 `제품이 무대가 된다`(mrlarus-product-as-architectural-stage-campaign)의 진화판이다.**\n발상은 같다 — 제품을 초대형으로 키우고 모델을 그 위에 실제 무게로 올린다.\n**새로 생긴 것은 수치와 금지 조항이다.** 그게 이 건을 따로 담는 이유다.\n\n```\n제품        화면의 40~50%            ← 전에는 \"초대형\"이라고만 했다\n재료        시선의 10~15%             ← 곁들임이 주역을 먹지 않게 상한을 뒀다\n포즈        장마다 다르게              ← \"시리즈가 반복돼 보이지 않게\"를 규칙으로 박음\n금지        VOL.1 / ISSUE 01 / 장식 번호 / 템플릿 라벨\n```\n\n★**「VOL.1 쓰지 마라」가 이 프롬프트에서 가장 배울 점이다.** 에디토리얼 톤을 요구하면\n모델이 잡지 흉내를 내면서 **의미 없는 호수·번호를 자동으로 붙인다.** 그게 AI 티가 나는\n지점인데, 작성자는 그걸 알고 **이름을 지목해 금지**했다. 우리 런북 §실측①(네거티브는\n긍정문으로)과 같은 자리 — 다만 여기선 \"쓰지 마라\"가 대상이 명확해서 통한다.\n\n★**타이포 재질을 맛에서 파생시킨다.** 글자를 유리·젤리·아크릴·응결·거품 중에서 고르되,\n**무엇을 고를지는 맛이 정한다.** 라임민트면 성에 낀 유리, 복숭아면 젤리 — 글자가 장식이\n아니라 **맛의 물성**이 된다. 그리고 글자 일부를 인물·제품 뒤로 넘겨 깊이를 만든다.\n\n⚠️**면적 비율(40~50% / 10~15%)은 Krea2가 잘 못 지킨다**(런북 §실측③). 재현본이 원문\n의도대로 나오는지는 이 건에서 다시 확인할 값어치가 있다 — 같은 계열 실패가 이미 두 번 있었다.",
